<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Holoholo Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwanda gûsoga gusintilwe no Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt2">MUANDA GÛSOGA GUSINTILWE NO</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kitwelelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Mubambo gwa musahû gwa Luka Musahû gûsoga kûlondana no Luka kimo mubina mu mabûkû ga kilageno kiya, kya kusintûlûla ngikeno gya Yesû Kilisitû. Limo lyabo lya kwêtwa: Musahû, kûlangêsha: Musahû Gûsoga. Gusintilwe nghimba gya luki lwa Yesû no Mateo, Maluko, Luka no Yoane. Luka hansitile ya mianda gya ngikeno gya Yesû, mone usintile byonka kibalo kya mianda gibele gya longa baana ba bûganga ba Yesû nghimba gya luki lwage no kûsangûka kwage, bûkû limo liitwe Bilongwa bya bikûla. Hakûle muntû ûmanyine kyaba kiyenene kya musahû kûlondana no Luka asintile no kwêsintêle mone mu bisambwa binge bitangêle kwana usintêle mu miaka kiloba nghimba gya Yesû Kilisitu. Musinti Luka ûbele ntêmbani bûsinti no bwêsambi bwage bûlangêshe kwana ûbele muntû mulangwe. Luka ûkebile kusinta kintû kyonse kigwane kya ngikeno gya Yesû, ûbele wa banga bilongwa monka mwabiêtêle, kûba bange bamone mo katolwa (Luk 1.1-3). Habele Muyuda (Bakolosai 4.10-14) No usintile mu ndjêla gya hûtû hûtû kibalo balya basi Bayuda bategelele. Bibyo byanalangêsha hûtû hûtû mwalê mukwêbasintûlwêla ngikeno gya Bayuda (Luk 1.8). Musahû gwa Luka Gwêgûlane no musahû gwa Matayo nogwa Maluko kibalo babele basinta bintû bigûlane bya muswelo gûmo. Mubûkata bwamabûkû gasatû, Luka umusitûlûle biiko kubyalwa kwa Yoane Mubatisha. Luka ûkonkomekile biiko kibalo kya lûlekelelo (misiko 3.3, 11. 4, 17.3-4, 23.34, 24.47) no milombelo (misiko 3.24, 5.16, 6.12, 11. 1-12, 22. 32). Mwalagalo: 1. Amusiko 1. 1-4 Luka ûlangêshe musahû gwage no kusintûlûla usintile kibalo kyage. 2. Kûwa usintile byonka kûbyalwa kwa Yesû no byabele mubêkêlwe djambûla mumingêlo 1.13) 3. Mukiba kikata kya musahû gusigale; 4.38), Luka walisamba bilongwa bya Yesû byalongile byesha byagwanininie mianda gya langile. 4. Nfulo mu misiko gya nghimba gibêlê (22-24), usintile byonka Yesû mwakyêlêle, no mwashêkêlwe no kûshûka kûbali.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwanda Gûsoga gusintilwe no Luka.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mwanda Gûsho gwimuno</para>
  <para style="io1">Mubambo gwa Mwanda Gûsoga</para>
  <para style="io1">Kûbyalwa kwa Yoane mubatisha no Yesû (1.5, 2.52)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mugêlo gwa Yoane Mubatisha</para>
  <para style="io1">Lûbatisho no bitompibwa bya Yesû (3.21, 4.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Busahuli bwa Yesû mu Galilaya (4.14, 9.50)</para>
  <para style="io1">Djênga lya nfulo kûbwêê no Yelusalema (19.28, 23.56)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kûshûka, kûmoneka no kûsela mwigulû kwa Kolo Yesû <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24.1-53</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kitwelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Munyemekwa Teofilo, bantû bangê balianinina kusinta ma bûkû kibalo kya mianda gilya gilongekile abûkata bwetû. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Basintile monka mwatûlombwelwe no balya bamwene mianda gigyo kûmeso gabo kuikêla mubambo batûmbêshe musahû gûgo. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nene nonene, nghimba gya kusitêkêkya mianda gyogyonse, kûbambêla mubambo, mwene kisoga kukusintêla musahû gwa mianda gino, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />kibalo ûnyonghone kûmanya sitê lya mianda gilya gyolangilwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masalagûlû wasaûla kûbyalwa kwa Yoane mubatisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Miab 24.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kyaba Helode lwabele Mubêkali wa mu Yuda gûno mwanda gwa kwê djûkania mwalo gonse gwa Palesitina kûbele no mulambwili gûmo sina lyage Sakalia, wa bûmbû lya mulambwili Abiya; mukashage ûbele wagitwa Elisabeti, noge ûbele wa bûmbû lya mulambwili Haloni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bonse babêlê Sakalia no Elisabeti babele balûmbûlûke kûgêbwa kwa Kabesha Mpûngû bekene kwakûlonda bisila no milago gyonse gya Kolo kûbûla nsadjê. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Mone hababele no baana kibalo Elisabeti ûbele nghumba, nobo bonse babêlê babele bakote biiko.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Sigi limo kibele kyaba kya kwêmena kibûngo kya bûlambwili Sakalia gee ûbele mukwêngêla mu Kitotelo, kûgêbwa kwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Sakalia ûsolwelwe kwa bûbale kûlondana no kisela, kya bûlambwili kûtwela mu Kitotelo. Kya Kolo kûba asigye nange, <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />bantû kibûngo kikata, babele babûngakane andje kûlomba kyaba kilya Sakalia abele mukusigya nange.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Masalagûlû ga Kolo gamwimine mumo munda, gemene mugela gwa kûlûme kwa kadjaba ka kusigêsha nange. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Kyaba Sakalia lwamumwene gûdjo masalagûlû, ûdjembile biiko kyobi kimutwelile. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Mone Masalagûlû ûmulombwele, “Sakalia, no katudjuki kibalo milombelo gyobe gyategelesibwa no Elisabeti! Mukashobe sha akûbyalêle, mwana wa mwanamulûme. Nogwe saumwinike sina Yoano. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Saûbe no mulogo gûkata no bantû bangê sabalogelelwe, kibalo kya kûbyalwa kwage! <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Lûb 6.3</ref></char></note>Kibalo wêkaba mukûlû kûgêbwa kwa Kolo. Hekekubili Bihênde no kintû kyokyonse kilya kikamukosha noge wakadjusibwa. Mutêma gûlûmbûlûke kûbambêla munda gya nyage, <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />wakebebwêlêsha bantû bangê ba Isilaeli kwê Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû wabo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:5-6">Malk 4.5-6</ref></char></note>Noge wêkatangêla kûgêbwa kwa Kolo, wêkaba no mutêma nagwe gwa Elia no bûkome. Kûba kwêgyalabûla mitema gya batata; kwêbwêlêlêla baana babo no balya basi bakokele bebwêlêle mu lweni lwa beno sitê; kûba kûbêka djambûla bantû babikilwe djambûla kwê Kolo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sakalia umubulishe gûdjo masalagûlû: “Nikamanyantê mianda gino? Nene ni mukote, no mukashane swa mukote biiko.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Ndan 8.16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9.21</ref></char>
    </note>“Masalagûlû umuêndwêle, nene ni Gabulieli,” wêkwêmana kûgêbwa. “Kwa Kabesha Mpûngû, nene natumwa nisambe nogwe nkûlombole gûgû musahû gûsoga. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Tegelela, saûbe kameme kibalo hawêmwitabêshe gino mianda gyane gya kagwanina kwa kyaba kyage. Wê kanyonghona kwêsamba, kuikêla gigyo gya nkûlombwele; agilê kagwanina.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Kyaba kikyo balya bantû babele bamuempa Sakalia kûno begalankenie kibalo kya kwêsha kwage mu Kitotelo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Kyaba Sakalia lwaimine andje, hanyonghwene kwêsamba nabo, basingûlwêle kwana ûbele wamona bimonwa munda gya Kitotelo. Kibalo ûbele walibalanga kwa malengania kûmaboko, mwanda ûbele kameme.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Kyaba kyage kya mugêlo akigwanine, wêbwêlêle kû nsese gyage. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Nghimba gyage Elisabeti mukashage wimitile limi wibisikile mu nsese gyage kyaba kya miesi gitano wêsambile. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Nansino ûbyo byanongele Kolo,” ûndwele no kunsindwêla nsoni. “Gya mbele nagyo kûmeso ga bantû!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masagûlû ga sahûla kûbyalwa kwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Elisabeti lwabele no limi lya miese mutanda Masalagûlû Gabulieli utuminwe no Kabesha Mpûngû abagale kukibûndê kya kwêtwa nasaleti kûko kû Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mt 1.18</ref></char></note> kwa nsongwa kasi gûmo musike wakwêtwa Malia musongwe wa muntû gûmo sina lyage Yosefu, wa musoo gwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Noge Masalagûlû gamugêlêle Malia gamulombwele, “Lwimu gwe ûwelwe kya buntû! No Kabesha Mpûngû Kolo wêamo nobe!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mone Malia lwategelele mianda gigyo ûdjembile biiko mu mutêma gwage, wibulishe mianda gino gyalangêsha kêê. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Hûao Masalagûlû umulombwele, “Malia, Nokatudjuki; kibalo watambûla kya bûntû kya Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mt 1.21</ref></char></note>Lola ûsawimite limi no wakabyala mwana wa mwana mulûme, wêkamwinika sina lyage Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7.12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 13">13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isay 9.7</ref></char></note>Mwana gûdjo wêkaba mukûlû no wêketwa mwana wa wêmwigûlû biiko. Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû sha amuwe kikanwa, kya bûkolo bwa Tata nkûlû wage Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />kwanansho wêkabêkala nsese gya Yakobo milemba mbagala; no bûkolo bwage habûkabi no nfulo!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia umubulishe masalagulu, “Sagûbe ntêê. Mwanda gûno, Kûba nene, ni musike?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Masalagûlû umuêndwêle, “Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke, gwêkakûtûkêla no bûkome bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwêkakuikêla nagwe kinsinsha. Kibalo kikyo mwana wêkabyalwa wêkaba Mulûmbûlûke no wêketwa Mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Manya swaa kwana no Elisabeti. Mbyalwa nobe, noge wagimita limi lya mwana wa mwana mulûme nanso ntêê mukote, no gûno mwesi gwage gwa kûlongolo gee bantû basingûlwêle kwana ni nghumba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Mub 18.14</ref></char></note>Kibalo hakûle mwanda gusinyonghokeli kwê Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />“Malia wêndwêle lola nene,” ni mwingili wa Kolo nongelwe monka; “molisambêle kûwa galya masalagûlû.” Gagêle lwege.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malia umutambêle Elisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Masigi gabalwa nghimba Malia ûsemukile ûgêle bûkêlê kuikêla kibûndê kimo kibele kûngûlû gya Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Kûko ûtwelile mu nsese gya Sakalia umwimwine Elisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Kyaba Elisabeti lwa tegelele lwimu lwa Malia, mwana ûbele mulûsho lwage Elisabeti uninghine. Noge Elisabeti udjusibwe Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />wêsambile djûwê likata, “Wagisêlwa malyese kûlêmba bana bakasi bonse, noge olê ka byala wagisêlwa malyese! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Kibalo kyakê nene na nkampikibwa nansino, no nyage wa Kolo wane haike kwandê? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Na nkulombola kyonka kilya kyaba kya ntegelele djûwê lya lwimu lobe alitwelile mu matwê gane, mwana witinginie kwa mulogo munda gya lusho lwane. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Kya lyese kolê gwe wa gitabêsha kwana; gwa kaikêla kolê gûlya Kolo gwa kûlombwele.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwêmbo lwa ntûmbo lwimbile Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam 2.1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Noge Malia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Wêsambile; mutêma gwane gwa mu tûmbêka Kolo<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />No mutêma gwane gwa lo gelelwa biiko kibalo kya Kabesha Mpûngû muandia wane,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kwa kûba wamulola kwa lûsa mwingili wage mwitûkêshe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Nansho kûbambêla ano bantû bonse be kangita wa malyese,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Mone Kabesha Mpûngû wêno bûkome wanongela bintû bikata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">No sina lyage lilûmbûlûke;<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />No lûsa lwege kû bantû bakumutûdjûka lwa kûgêlêlêla mbialo no mbialo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">Kûbalya bakumutûdjûka kabesha Mungû.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Walonga bintû bikata kwa kûboko kwage walibasangalêka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Beno munsimbwe mumaninga ga mitêma gyabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Yob 5.11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12.19</ref></char>
    </note> Walibagwêsha babêkali kuima mu bikanwa byabo bya bûkolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">mone walibasesha balya betûkêshe.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Beno ndjala walibekûtia bisoga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">mone bampeta walibasindûla minie samba.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Washa kumukwasha Isilaeli mwingili wage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">kûba edjûkane lûsa lwege.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Mub 17.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nansilya biali balagêlêle ba Tata nkûlû betû, Bûlaimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">no lûbyalo lwege!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia wêkene no Elisabeti kilêko kya miesi gisatû, nfulo wêbwêlêle kû nsese gyage.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûbyalwa kwa Yoano mubatisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Kyaba kya kûbyala kwa Elisabeti kûgwanine, ûbyalile mwana wa mwana mulûme. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bakuminkani bage no bantû bamusoo gwage lwabategelele musahû kwana Kolo wamumwena lûsa lûkata, balogelelwe amo nage.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.59: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Benlf 12.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwana aikêshe kilêko kya masigi muganda baikile kumukala mwana balê, bakebile kumwinika sina lya shage Sakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Mone nyage wêsamba: “Hanansho! Sina lyage saetwe Yoano.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bamulombwele: “Mwanda gwakê hakûlê gegense mu musoo gwage wêno sina lilyo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Nfulo, bamubulishe shage mubûmeme, bakebe kûmanya mwanage saebwe sina kê.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Noge ûlombile kibalê kya kusintêla, usintile nansino: “Yoano ûlyo sina lyage.” Begalakenie bonse. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Onka hao Sakalia kania kaûtwêlwe no lulimi lûlekelelwe ûbambile kûbanga no kûtûmbêka Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Kahaga kebatwelile bakuminkani bonse, no musahû gûgo gonse gûgwanine kûntû konse mungûlû gya mu yuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bantû bonse bategelele mianda gigyo, bebulishe mumitêma gyabo banine, “Mwana gûdjû saabe wamuswelo kê?” Kibalo, bûkome bwa Kolo bûbele amo nage.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwêmbo lwa ntumbo lwimbile Sakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sakalia shage wa Yoano udjulilwe no Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke, ûsawêle bûmoni bûbo:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Atûmbêkwe Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû wa Isilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Kwakûba walibashêla no kwêbahandia bantû bage.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Walitûêla muikuli ntwasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">mbyalwa gya Daudi mwingili wage.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Monka mwalagêlêle ao akala kûndjêla gya bamoni bage balûmbûlûke,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kwana wêketûhandia kuima mumaboko gamangi gyetû,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">no kuima mumaboko ga bonse betusikwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Wêsambile wakebalekelela bakûlû betû,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">no kwêdjûkana kilageno kyage kilûmbulûke.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73-74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73-74" />Kilageno kikyo kadjêgo kemulagêlêle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">tata nkûlû wetû Bûlaimu, kwana: waketûa betwe tûandibwe mumaboko ga bamagi gyetû,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">Tûmone kumwingêlêla kûbûla kahaga,<verse eid="LUK 1:73-74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Tûbe balûmbûlûke no sitê kûgêbwa gwage</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">Masigi gonse gangikeno gyetû.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.76: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Nogwe, mwanane, wêketwa mumoni wa Kabesha Mpûngû mukûlû wimwigûlû.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Wakamutangêlêla Kolo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">no kumubêkêla djambûla madjêla gage,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Kwêbasawêla bantû kwana bekandibwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">Kwakwimibwa mubûbê bwabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kabesha Mpûngû wetû wêno bûkampwe no lûsa lûngê.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Wêketuiminia mugenge gwa djûba kuima mwigûlû,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.79: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isay 9.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>mwanda wêbamunkêshe bonse bekane mu kidjo kikûlû kya luki abishe tankuko lyetû,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">Alongamanie tankuko lyetû mu ndjêla gya angalê.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Gûlya mwana ukulile ûmwene bûkome mumutêma gwage. Wêkene mukihanya kuikêla sigi lilya lyalimwenie hûtû kûbantû ba Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kûbyalwa kwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayo 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Musigi lilya kûtelwe mbêla giimine kwê Kaisali Ogisito mubêkali muk-ûlû kwêbakeba bantû bonse bamûmwalo gonse gwa baloma babalwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kûbalêkwa kûko kûbele lûkwe lûtangi, kyaba Kolenio abele mubêkali wa mwalo gwa Sulia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Nfulo, bonse bategelele bagêle kûbalêkwa muntû gense mu kibûndê kyage.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Byonka nansho Yosefu noge ûselile mukibûndê kya Nasaleti mwalo gwa Galilaya, ûgêle mukibûndê kya Daudi kya kwêtwa Betelehemu mwalo gwa Daudi, no kwanansho ûbele walûbyalo lwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ûgêle kûbalwa amo no musongwe wage Malia, kwana ûbele no limi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Lua babele kûko kû Betelehemu, kyaba kyage kya kûbyala kigwanine, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />ûbyalile mwanage wabûbelê, mwana mulûme. Umushikile kishandê kya bwanike, umulalikile mu kisakyê kya banghombe kibalo babulilwe antû mu nsese gya baika.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masalagûlû walibaimina baempi bamikoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Kûntû kûko kû Betelehemu kûbele baempi bamikoko bakelilwe busigi mukitûntû kûempa bimunanwa byabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Masalagûlû ga Kolo gebaiminine kimpûlû mpandja, no ntûmbo gya Kolo gibamunkêshe mugela gonse. Batudjukile biiko. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Mone Masalagûlû ga Kolo wêbalombwele: “Namukatudjuki! Na nimihêla musahû gûsoga, gwa mulogo gûkata gwêkebamona bantû bonse. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Kibalo lêno lili mukibûndê kya Daudi, mwabyalwa muandia kibalo kyenyu, ûge Kilisitu Kolo. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Nokano kekaba kabandêlêlo kwenyu, mwikamu sangana mwana wa lûkeke mushêkwe kishandê kya bwanike, mulalêkwe mukisakyê.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Onkao kibûngo kikata kya basilêkale ba mwigûlû kikuminkene no gudjo Masalagûlû, gamutumbikile Kabesha Mpûngû:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Ntûmbo kwê Kabesha Mpûngû wê mwigûlû,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">no angalê akandje kû bantû balya bakumunengesha!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Nghimba gya masalagûlû kûsemuka kwêbwêlêla mwigûlû, balya baempi bamikoko belombolene: “Tûgye lûmo kwa lûmo kuikêla Betelehemu tûkamone kya gêlêka, Kolo kyalitwanine.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Nfulo, bagêlê lûbêlo, bamusangene Malia no Yosefu no gûdjo mwana wa lûkeke mulalêkwe mukisakye. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Babo baempi bamikoko lwabamumwene gûdjo mwana bebanine bonse musahû gwabategelele kibalo kyage, <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />bonse bategelele gûgo mwanda begalagenie kibalo kya musahû gwa balombwelwe no baempi bamikoko. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mone Malia ûkwatêlêshe mianda gyonse gigyo mumutêma gwage. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Balya baempi bamikoko bebwêlêle kwabo kûno mukûtûmbêsha no kumutota Kabesha Mpûngû kûbyonse byababele bategelela no kûmona byonse bibele monka mwa balombwelwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana waginikwa sina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Benlf 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lk 1.31</ref></char>
    </note> Masigi muganda, nghimba gya kûkalwa balê mwana agaikile, umwinikile sina lyage Yesû, sina kwana ûbelemuebwe no Masalagûlû nghimba enelitwalêlwe limi.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walangisibwa mu kitotelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Benlf 12.6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>kyaba kya kumunkibwa kwa Yosefu no Malia, byabibele bilagêlêle bisila bya Musa, babyali babo batwalile Mwana baselile nage Yelusalema kûba bamulangêshe kûgêbwa kwa Kolo, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kuim 13.2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12">12</ref></char></note>mubisila bya Kolo musintwe: “Mbyalwa gense mubelê wa mwana mulûme shabêkwe djambûla kwê Kolo.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />no bagêle kuimia mulambû: “Nkûnda gibêlê no byana bibêlê bya djêba, monka mwisambêle bisila bya Kolo.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Kyaba kikyo kûko Yelusalema kûbele no muntû gûmo musoga no mutûdjûke Kabesha Mpûngû, sina lyage Simo. Gee ûbele walwegelela kwakiwêwê bûempuli bwa Isilaeli. Mutêma gûlûmbûlûke gûbele amo nage. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke gûbele gwamusitêkêkya kwana haso kûkya ntê onolimone Kilisitu wa Kolo. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Nfulo ûlûbûlwêlwe no Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke, Simo ûtwelile mu Kitotelo. No babyali ba Yesû lwaba musilishe mu Kitotelo Mwana wabo kûba bamulongele monka mukebelwe no kisila, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />simo umutambwêle mwana yesû mumaboko gage kûno wakumutûmbêsha Kabesha Mpûngû, no kûnenghena:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Onkano Kolo ntakêshe, nene mwingili obe nkye kwa angalê kwa kûba wagwania mulago gobe. <verse eid="LUK 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kibalo meso gane gamona lûhandêlo lobe,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />kwana lobikile djambûla kûmeso ga bantû bonse:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isay 42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52.10</ref></char>
    </note> Mugenge kibalo kya mpûtûlo kû bantû basibetabeshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">no kibalo kya ntûmbo kûbantû bobe Isilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Shage no nyage wa Yesû babele baligalagania mianda gisambile Simo kibalo kya mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Kûwa Simo wêbesele malyese, umulombwele Malia, nyage wa Yesû: “Mwana gûdjû wêkaba kibalo kya kûgwêsha no kûbyûla kwa bantû bangê mu Isilaeli. Noge wakaba byesha byakabengwa no bantû; <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />kibalo maninga ga bantû bangê gekaûtûlwa hûtû hûtû. No mugela gobe gwe mwine, misa gikakukinka nagwe lûpanga lwabûgê lwê kakukinka Mutêma gobe.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36-37" />Byonka ûbele mu Kitotelo mumoni gûmo mwana mukasi, Sina lyage Ana, musike wa Fanueli, wa musoo gwa Asheli, ûbele mukote biiko; wêkene no mulûme miaka kiloba yaa, Kûwa mulûme wage ukile. Noge ûbele mukyêlêlwe no mulûme, ûbele no miaka makumi muganda no gina. Kyaba kyonse wêkene mukitotelo wa kwigima no kûlomba busigi no djûba. <verse eid="LUK 2:36-37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Kyaba kyonka kikyo, Ana usile no kûbamba kumutûmbêsha Kabesha Mpûngû, no kwêsamba musahû gwa gûdjo mwana kûbantû bonse babele bakûempa buikuli bwa Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwêbwêlêla kû Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mt 2.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kyaba Yosefu no Malia, babyali ba Yesû lwabawêle kûlonga byonse bitakisibwe no bisila bya Kolo, bebwêlêle kwabo Nasaleti mwalo gwa Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />No gûlya mwana ukulile ûgêlêlêle kûmona bûkome, udjulile lweni, no kyabûntû kya Kabesha Mpûngû kibele amo nage.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû mukitotelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />41 <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kuim 12.1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Ngib 16.1-8</ref></char></note>Yosefu no Malia babyali ba Yesû; babele no kisela kya kûgya Yelusalema mumwaka gonse kyaba kya sigi likata lya Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesû lwabele no kilêko kya miaka kumi no gibêle, bonse baselile kûgya Yelusalema musigi likata lilyo monka mubelele kisela. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Nghimba gya kikwe kûwa, Yosefu no Malia babambile kwêbwêlêla kwabo, noge Yesû usigile Yelusalema, mone babyali bage habasingûlwêle. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Baningile ûbele nabo mumulongo gûmo, bagêle lwendo lwa sigi ligima, babambile kumukeba mu musoo gwage no kû balûnda. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Kwa kûba abamumwene, baselile byonka Yelusalema kûmukeba. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Nghimba gya masigi gasatû bamumwene mukitotelo, wiki mubûkata bwa balangi babisila, wakwêbategelela no kwêbabûsha. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />No bonse bategelele mianda gyage begalagenie lweni lwege no mahêndwe gage. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Babyali bage lwabamumwene begalagenie. Malia nyage umubulishe: “Mwanane, mwanda gwa kêê walitûlongela nansho? tata obe no nene twaba twakûkeba kwa kininga.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesû wêbabulishe: “Kibalo kyakê mwakûnkeba? Amwidjê kwana kimpyenene kûba mu nsese gya Tata wane?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Mone babyali bage abasingûlwê nsintwe gya mianda gyalibalombwele.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Nfulo utukile nabo Nasaleti, ûbele walibakokela. Mone nyage ûbêkêlêshe mianda gigyo gyonse mumutêma gwage. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam 2.26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Nkd 3.4</ref></char></note>Noge Yesû ûkulile mu lweni no kêmo, ûkampilwe no Kabesha Mpûngû no bantû bonse.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Musahû gwa Yoane mubatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoano 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mwaka gwa kumi no bûtano gwa bûbêkali bwa Kaisali Tibelio; kyaba Pontio Pilato ûbele mubêkali wa Yuda, Helode ûbele mubêkali wa Galilaya, no mulûnda wage Filipo ûbele mubêkali wa Itulea no Talakoniti; no Lusania ûbele mubêkali wa Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />kyaba Anasi no Kayafa babele balambwili bakûlû. Kyaba kikyo mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû gumuikêle Yoano mwana wa Sakalia kû kianya. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Nfulo, Yoane ugêle mugela gonse no kûkondo gya lûdjê Yolodani, mu kûsawêla, “Bantû balekelelwe bûbê bwabo, no kûbatisibwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isay 40.3-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>mwa gusintêlwe mubûkû lya mumoni Isaya lisambile:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Djûwê lya muntû wa kûbûlûla mu kianya:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mulongolole ndjêla gya Kolo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Mulûlêke maêto gage!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Mena gonse ga sûhêlwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">lûgûlû no ngûlû gyonse bisangalêkwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Ndjêla gitontamane gilûlêkwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ndjêla gino mena gisenenenibwe.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />No bantû bonse bekamona lûhandêlo lwa Kabesha Mpûngû.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23.33</ref></char>
    </note> Nfulo kibûngo kya bantû bangê kiikile kwê Yoane. “Kûba ebabatishe!” Lwênywe lobyalo lwa ndjonka nani wimilêngêle mutêne nsûngû gya kûsha? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yoa 8.33</ref></char></note>Mulangêshe kwa bilongwa kwana mwalisasa. Namukabambi onka kwêganina: “Shetû wetû û Bûlaimu. Nanimilombola sitê Kabesha Mpûngû wêbûnyonghona kwêgalonga mabwe gano gabe baana ba Bûlaimu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mt 7.19</ref></char></note>No onkano, temo lyawa kûbekwa djambûla akisina kya mutê; nansho mutê gogonse gusi gûbyale bihelo bisoga gwa kakalwa no kûtebwa mukaya.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Hûao bantû babo bumubulishe Yoano: “Kintû kiyenene tûlonge ntêê?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Wêbaêndwele: “Wêno bishandê bibêlê amuhe gûlya usile no kishandê; wêno byakûlya alonge byonka nansho.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:29">Lk 7.29</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Basonkya misonko nobo basile swa kûba babatisibwe, bamubulishe Yoano, “Mulangi, tûlonge kêê?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />“Noge wêbaêndwêle: namu kasonkya musonko kûlêmba,” kilêko kibikilwe.<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Nobo basilêkale bamubulishe, “No betwe? tûlonge ntêê?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Noge wêbaêndwêle, “Namukatwali bintû bya muntû gegense kwabumu no kumusongela gegense kwa bumpi. Mugwaninine no katolwa kenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Bonse babele balwegelela kwalûkûdjagêlo lûkata; nfulo, babambile kwêbûsha mu mitêma gyabo kibalo kya Yoano, kûba ange gee u Kilisitu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yoano wêbaêndwele: “Nene na nimibatisha kwa madjê, mone wakûsha nghimba gyane wêno bûkome kûnêmbêla nene, kwana nsimuyenene nokwêne kûsokona migosi gya bikwabêlo byage. Gee wakemibatisha kwa mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke no kwa kaya. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Gee wên alo mumaboko gage lûhe lwakûelela bilêbwa aelele bilêbwa byage, akonge ngano mukaombo, no makaha egasigye mukaya kasikusimika.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Amo no malêngê gangê ga Yoano wêbesasile bantû no kwêbasawêla mwanda gûsoga. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Mt 14.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Malk 6.17-18</ref></char></note>Mone Yoane umulwêshe mu bêkali Helode, kibalo umusongwele Helodia, mukasi wa mwanabo wage, no ku mulonga mu kashage, no kibalo kya bûbê bonse bwabele walonga. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Kûwa Helode ubilishe bûbê bwage no kumubêka Yoano mukikûtû.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûbatisho lwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Bantû bonse lwa bawêle kûbatisibwa, Yesû noge ubatisibwe. No Yesû abele mukûlomba gûlû liutukile, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Mub 22.2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Nghib 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isay 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Malk 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Lk 9.35</ref></char></note> no Mutêma gûlûmbûlûke gutukile egûlû lyage kwa kyelekesho nagwe ni nkûnda. No djûwê litegelelwe kuima mwegûlû lisambile, “Gwe ûge mwanane mukampibwe. None nandogelelwa nogwe biiko.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musoo gwa Kolo Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayo 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesû ûbambile mugêlo gwage ûbele no kilêko kya miaka makumi gasatû, no bantû baningile gee mwana wa Yosefu ûbele mwana wa Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Matati, Matati ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Lefi, Lefi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Meleki, Meleki ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yanai, Yanai ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yosefu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Matatia, Matatia ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Amosi, Amosi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Nahumu, Nahumu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Esili, Esili ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Maati, Maati ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Matatia, Matatia ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Semei, Semei ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yoseki, Yoseki ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yohanani, Yohanani ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Lesa, Lesa ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Selubabeli, Selubabeli ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Salatieli, Salatieli ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûle wa Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Meleki, Meleki ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Adi, Adi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Kosamu, Kosamu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Elimadamu, Elimadamu ûbele mwana wawa mwana mulûme wa Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eli ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yosûwa, Yosûwa ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Elieseli, Elieseli ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yolimu, Yolimu ûbeli mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Matati, Matati ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Lefi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lefi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Simo, Simo ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yuda, Yuda ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yosefu, Yosefu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yonamu, Yonamu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Eliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakimu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Melea, Malea ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Mena, Mena ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Matata, Matata ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Natani, Natani ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Daudi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yese, Yese ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Obedi, Obedi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Boasi, Boasi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Salumoni, Salumoni ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Nasoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nasoni ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Aminadabu, Aminadabu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Alamu, Alamu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Hesiloni, Hesiloni ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Pelesi, Pelesi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yakobo, Yakobo ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Isaka, Isaka ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Bulaimu, Bûlaimu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Tela, Tela ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Naoli, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naoli ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Selugi, Selugi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Leu, Leu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Pelegi, Pelegi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Ebeli, Ebeli ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Kenani, Kenani ûbele mwana wa mwanamulûme wa Alufakisadi, Alufakisadi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Shemu, Semu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Noa, Noa ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Metusela, Metusela ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Enoke, Enoke ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Yaledi, Yaledi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Mahalaleli, Mahalaleki ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Kenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenani ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Enosi, Enosi ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Seti, Seti ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Adamu, Adamu ûbele mwana wa mwana mulûme wa Kabesha Mpûngû.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kûtompibwa kwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maluko 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesû, ûbele mudjûlwe Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke, wimine mulûdjê Yolodani. Ûlûbûlwêlwe no Mutêma kuika mu kyanya. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Kûko ûtompilwe no lyabola masigi makumi gana. Kyaba kikyo kyonse halêle kyo kyonse, no nghimba gya masigi gago ûtegelele ndjala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Lyabola umulombwele, “Ntê gwee wê mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû, takêsha bwee lili libe mukate.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Ngib 8.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû umuêndwêle, “Lusintwe mulûpapûlo lûlûmbûlûke: ‘Muntû ekani kwa mukate yaa.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Kûwa lyabola umutwalile umuselishe egûlû, no umulangêshe bûkolo bonse bwa kandje mukyaba kisho. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Gûdjo lyabola umulombwele: “Nshakûwe bûkome kibalo kya bûkolo bonse bûbû no bûsoga bwage, Kibalo nimuebwe bibi byonse; no nene nibûnyonghona kumuwa muntû bintû byonse byandêmukampwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Bibi byonse bikaba bûeta bobe, ntê gwe kûntota.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Ngib 6.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû umuêndwêle: “Bisintwe mu lusinto lûlûmbûlûke: ‘Mutote Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû obe, no kumwingêlêla gee bugima bwage!’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Lyabola umutwalile kuika Yelusalema, ku kilêngo kila kya Kitotelo, umulombwele: “Ntê gwee wê mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû, wête ansê kuima ano, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Nghib 91.11</ref></char></note>kibalo kisintwe mulusinto lûlûmbûlûke: ‘Wêkatakêsha Masalagûlû gage kibalo kyobe mwanda gakûempe.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:12">Nghib 91.12</ref></char></note>No byonka: ‘Bekakûtwala mumaboko gabo, nokasi kwikukala kûgûlû kobe kwê bwee.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Ngib 6.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mone Yesû umuêndwêle: “Kisintwe mulusinto lûlûmbûlûke, ‘Nokamutompi Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû obe.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Kyaba lyabola lwawêle kumutompa Yesû kûndjêla gyonse, umulekele Yesû mu kyaba kiyenene.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wabamba mugêlo gwage kû Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayo 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maluko 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Kûwa Yesu wêbwêlele kuika Galilaya udjusibwe bûkome bwa Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke, no mwanda gwage gûgwanine mu mpenga gyonse gya bakuminkani. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Noge ûbele walibalanga bantû kûmasese ga milombelo gya Bayuda, utumbikilwe no bantû bonse.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wabengwa kû Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Nfulo, Yesû ûgêle Nasaleti, kûntû kwalelilwe, no sigi lya kwêtûsha ûtwelile mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda monka mubelele kidjibisi kyage. Wêmene kûba asome lusinto lûlûmbûlûke kwadjûwê, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Noge ûwelwe bûkû lya mumoni Isaya, wiliûtwêle no kûtana antû abale asintwe:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isay 61.1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> “Mutêma gwa Kolo gwê egûlû lyane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Kibalo ûnsolwele no kunsiga makita kûba nibaêle balanda musahû gûsoga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Untumine mbasawêle bakwêkwe bwanaabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">No bampoki bakaebwa kûmo byonka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Untumine kwêbahandia bakûmwenenekibwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />No kûtûmbia mwaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">Gwa kyabûntû kya Kolo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Nghimba gya kûsoma, Yesû uhutile lilya bûkû, umuele mwingili, kûwa wêkene; bantû bonse babele mulia mu sense gya milombelo gya Bayuda, bamulwele soo. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Hûao ûbambile kwibalombola: “Lûno lusinto lwa gwanina lêno lwamulê mukûtegelela.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bonse babele mumo bamutumbikile biiko, begalagenie mianda gisoga giimine mukania kage. Bebûsenie: “Gûdjû uhusi mwana wa Yosefu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Sitê samunombole lûkêndê lûno: ‘Muhundahi, eandie gee mwine,’ byonka samwisambe: ‘Gyonse gya tûtegelele wagilonga kûlya Kapelenaumu, wigilonge swa ano akibûndê kyobe.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoa 4.44</ref></char></note>Yesû ûgêlêlêle kwêsamba,” Sitê sitê nanimilombola mumoni hekwêtabisibwa mu kibûndê kyage. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Mub 17.1</ref></char></note> “Mone, mutegelele: sitê kûbele no bakyêlwe bangê mu Isilaeli kyaba kya Elia, kyaba kilya gûlû alikwikilwe kwa miaka gisatû no mwesi mutanda; kûbele no ndjala giingê mu mwalo gonse. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Mub 17.8-16</ref></char></note>No nansho Elia hatuminwe no kwêne kwa gûmo wabo, nambo kwa mukyêlwe gûmo wa Selefati, mumwalo gwa Sidona. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Mub 5.1-14</ref></char></note> no nansho kûbele bantû mu mwalo gwa Isilaeli mu kyaba kya Elisha no kûbele ba bûsûngû bangê. Nansho hakûlê gegense umunkibwe nambo Namani yaa wamu Sulia.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bantû bonse babele musense gya milombelo gya Bayuda, lwabategelele nansho, basumininwe biiko. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Bemene bamuiminie andje gya kibûmdê kyabo, kibele kiimpwe egûlû lya Lûgûlû, bamuilile kuikêla ku kilêngo kya Lûgûlû lûlo mwanda bamulundêle mulûonga. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Mone Yesû witile mubûkata bwa kibûngo, ûgêle lwege.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muntû wêno minyaga gibê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maluko 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Kûwa Yesû utukile kûgya Kapelenaumu, mu kibûnde kya Galilaya, ûbele wa libalanga bantû sigi lya kwêtûsha.<verse eid="LUK 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mt 7.28-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Begalagenie biiko kwa milango gyage, kibalo mianda gyage gibele no bûkome. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />No mugilya nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda, mubele no muntû ûbele no minyaga gibê, ûtele kahûndû ka kusika matwê wêsambile: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Wênokê netû, gwee Yesû mu Nasaleti? Washa kwêtûtobesha? Nankusingûlûla gwe wini. Gwee umulûmbûlûke wa Kabesha Mpûngû!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesû wêgûkankêle gûgo munyaga gûbê, wêsambile “Talala pii ima munda gya muntû gûdjû!” nfulo gûgo munyaga gûbe gumugwilishe gûlya muntû ansê kûgêbwa kwa bantû bonse gumuimine no akumukoma noene asho.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bantû bonse begalagenie: “Ola, mianda gyamuswelo kêê gigi! wigitakêshe minyaga gibe kwa kitenta no bumu nogyo gya muima!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Musahû gwa Yesû gûgwanine kûntû konse mumwalo gûlya.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibahandia batongi bangê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesû uimine mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda, ûgele kû nsese gya Simo. Madjû gûmo, muko wa Simo, ûbele no kisûngû kikole; bamulombile amuhandie. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Nasho Yesû ûkotamine, no ûkankêle kilya kisûngû, nokyo kimulekele. Lûkwe lûmo gûlya madjû ubyukile, no ûbambile kwêbakebela kya kûlya.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Djûba alibele amukasi kilûbê, bantû bamusilêshe Yesû batongi babo halahala; noge ubikile maboko gage kwêgûlû lya gûmo gûmo wabo, nobo baandile bonse. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Minyaga gibe gibaimine bantû bangê, nogyo agibele gyaima gitele kahûndû gyanine: “Gwee wê Mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Mone Yesû wigikankêle no kwêgilombola nagikesambi, kibalo bamumanyine kwana gee û Kilisitu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wasahûla mu masese gamilombelo gya ba Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maluko 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Djo lyage akûkendûlûka kwa bûsigi, Yesû ûsemukile kûgyata antû asibele bantû. Bantû bangê babele bamukeba. Lwabamumwene, batompile kumusibêla kûba nakasemuki ababele. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Mone Yesû wêbalombwele: “Nimuyenene kusahûla mwanda gûsoga gwa Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû mu bibûndê binge swa, ntuminwe mwanda gwa bibyo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Noge ûgêlêlêle kûsahûla mu masese ga milombelo gya Bayuda.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibeta baana babûganga batangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Mt 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Malk 3.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4.1</ref></char>
    </note>Sigi limo, Yesû ûbele mwimane kûnkondo gya siba Genesaleti, no bantû bangê babele bamwalagale bamwininikile mukûtegelela mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Yesû ûmwene maato gabêlê kûnkondo gya kisiba; balobi babele baima kû kûlûmbûlûla malabo gabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Nghimba gya Yesû kûbanda mu bwato bûmo, bûbele bwa Simo, ûkampilwe Simo ebûlûndêle kûmadjê, kûla bisho no kikêngo kya siba. Kûwa wêkene no kûlanga bantû walê mu bwato.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Lwabidjile kûlanga, umulombwele Simo: “Gêsha bwato kuikêla kûtokile, mulabe malabo genyu mumone kwela misha.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:3">Yoa 21.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Simo umwindwêle: Mulangi,” Twalikankamika kwela misha busigi bugima, “no atwêbamone nkantû. Mone kwa kûba walisamba, sandabe malabo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Yoa 21.6</ref></char></note>Nghimba gya kûlonga nansho, belile misha gingê, no malabo gabo gabele abûsho kwatêka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Banyakwêle balobi benabo babele mu maato gange, bashe bebakwashe, nobo basile, badjulishe maato gonse gabêlê misha, no agabele gakeba kûshama. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Kyaba Simo Petelo lwemwene bibyo biimine, ukutamine kûgêbwa kwê Yesû, no kumulombola: “Kolo, Sindûka kûgêbwa kwane, kwakûba nene ni wa bûbê!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simo amo no balobi nage bonse, begalagenie biiko kwa kûmona misha gingê gya balobile. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Byonka nansho benage no Simo, kwana Yakobo no Yoane, baana ba Sebedayo, be galagenie biiko. kûwa Yesû umulombwele Simo: “No katudjuki, kûbambêla onka ano sahûbe mulobi wa bantû.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Nfulo, nghimba gya kusisha galya maato ku kikêngo kya siba basigile byonse, no ba mulondile Yesû.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wamunkya wêno bûsûngû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Kyaba kimo Yesû lwabele mu kibûndê kimo kya bilya bibûnde. Kuimine muntû gûmo ûbele no bûsûngû mubêlê gugima lwa mumwene Yesû, muntû gûdjo ukutamine kitwe nsimika umwisasile wêsambile, “Kolo, gwe kûkampwa!” Wê bûnyonghona: Kumunkya.<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesû holwele kûboko, umukumine no kwêsamba: “Nankampwa munkibwa!” Lûkwelûmo bûsûngû bumuwêle.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Benlf 14.1-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû umutakêshe: “Nokalomboli muntû gegense, nambo gyata wêlangêshe kwê Mulambwili; uwimie mulambû kibalo kya kumukibwa kobe, monka mwetakêshe Musa basitêkêkye bantû kûba wahanda.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Mone musahû gwa Yesû gûsangalele ko konse. Bantû bibûmgo bingê babûngakene kûba bamutegelele no kûhandibwa mitongo gyabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Mone gee ûgêle lwege hantû asibele bantû ûbele walomba kûko.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandia muntû wa bûlebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Sigi limo, Yesû ûbele walanga bantû bonse, mubûkata bwabo mubele Mafalisayo no Balangi ba bisila kuima mubibûndê byonse bya Galilaya, Yuda no Yelusalema, babele bekane ao. Bûkome bwa Kolo bûbele amo nage, noge wandishe batongi kwa bûkome bwa Kolo. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Onkao banabalûme basile, balêbatwale muntû gûmo wabûlebe, ûbêdjê mu kisalo; batompile kumutwesha munda gya nsese, bamubêke kûgêbwa kwê Yesû. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Mone kibalo kya bûngê bwa bantû, habanyonghwene kûtwela munda. Nfulo, baselile egûlû lya nsese, basamwine sansagûlû, bamutukishe gûlya ûbele no bûlebe amo no kisalo kyage, bamubikile kûgêbwa kwê Yesû. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Kyaba Yesû lwamwene lwêtabêsho lwabo, umulombwele gûlya mutongi: “Mulûnda, bûbê bobe bwalekelelwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Balangi babisila no Mafalisayo babambile kwêbûsha: “Mwingili kêê gûdjû wakwêsamba mianda gya kûbedja? Nani wêbûnyogona kûlekelela bûbê nambo Kabesha Mpûngû bugima bwage?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesû umanyine maninga gabo, wêbabûlishe, kibalo kyakê mwakuninga mianda gigi mu Mitêma gyenyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Kikêê kilya kiele mbeela kwêsamba, ‘Walekelelwa bûbê bobe,’ ao kwêsamba: ‘Gimana, ûtambe?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Mone, nankeba mumanye kwana, Mwana wa Muntû wêno bûkome bwa kûlekelela bantû bûbê mukandje. Kwanasho, umulombwele gûlya muntû wa bûlebe nangana: “Gimana, twala kisalo kyobe, wêbwêlêle kû nsese gyobe!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Onkao gûlya mutû wa bûlebe wêmene kûgêbwa kwabo bonse, ûtwalile bûtanda gwage, wêbwêlêle kû nsese gyage, mukumutûmbêsha Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bonse begalagenie no kumutûmbêsha Kabesha Mpûngû, badjulilwe no kyobi, banine: “Lêno, twamona biesha!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wamwita Lefi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Nghimba gya mianda gigyo, Yesû wimine andje, umumwene musonkya musonko gûmo witilwe Lefi, mwikane akûsonkesha. Yesû umulombwele: “Nonde.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Noge Lefi wêmene, kusiga byonse, umulondile.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Kûwa Lefi umulongeshe Yesû kikwe kikata kû nsese gyage. No kibûngo kikata kya basonkya mu sonko no bantû bange babele balya amo nabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Lk 15.1-2</ref></char></note>Mone Mafalisayo no balangi babisila, babele ba ntotelo gyabo bebatompwelele baana babûganga ba Yesû, banine: “Kibalo kyakê mwakûlya no kwêkûbêla amo no basonkya musonko no beno bûbê?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Balya bepoo abekûkeba mutembi, nambo batongi. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nsimushe kwêbeta bantû beno sitêê, nambo banonga bibê, bamone kumulêlêla.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûsho kibalo kya kwisilêka kyakûlya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bantû bange bamulombwele Yesû: “Bana babûganga ba Yoano mubatisha bakwisilêka no kûlomba nghendo no nghendo; no baana babûganga ba Mafalisayo, bakûlonga byonka nasho. Mone baana babûganga bobe bakûlya no kwikûbêla.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Mwaninga kwana mwibûnyonghona kwêbasibêla bemeni bamulûme wa bûlûgo kûlya kyakûlya kya kikwe kyaba mulûme wa bûlûgo uki amo nabo? Ubisibyo! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Mone kyaba kikaika kwana mulûme wabûlûgo enekaimibwa abûkata bwabo; kyaba kikyo ûabalê kesilêka.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesû wêbalombwele lûkêndê lûlû: “Bantu habakali kilêba kya kishandê kiya no kwikibêka ku kishalanwa kikûlûkûlû; ntê bokûlonga nansho, shababe balikikala kikyo kishalanwa kiya, no kikyo kilêba hakigûlani no kikyo kishalanwa kikûlûkûlû. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Byonka nansho hakûlê muntû wêbûbêka difai liya mubibêndê bikûlûkûlû. Ntê gee kûlonga nansho, lilyo difai liya likata bilya bibêndê bya kala, difai likesêka, no bibêndê bikoneka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Difai liya lyabêkwa, mubibêndê biya <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />No hakûlê muntû mukampwe difai liya, nghimba gya kwêkûbêla kala, kibalo wakesamba, ‘Lilya lya kala,’ lisoga mbeela.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû ni Kolo wasigi lya kwêtûsha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Ngib 23.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sigi limo lya kwêtûsha, Yesû ûbele waêta mu mabala ga ngano, baana bage babûganga babambile kutimuna miewe gya ngano, babambile kutikiminia no maboko gabo no kûlya ndje. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mone bamo Bama falisayo bebabulishe: “Mwanda gwakêê mwalonga mianda gikandwe kûlonga sigi lya kwêtûsha?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21.1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>wêbaêndwêle: “Hamwalisome mianda gilongile Daudi, amo no benage kyaba kyabele no ndjala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Benlf 24.9</ref></char></note>Daudi ûtwelile mu nsese gya Kabesha Mpûngû, ûtwalile gilya mikate gibikilwe kûgêbwa kwa Kabesha Mpûngû, ûlêle no kwêbaa benage. Hakitakisibwe muntû kûlya mikate gigyo nambo balambwili ba Kabesha Mpûngû yaa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Mone Yesû wê balombwele: “Mwana wa Muntû ûge Kolo wa kwêtûsha.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muntû wêno kûboko kwa bûlebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Kûbele sigi linge lya kwêtûsha Yesû ûtwelile mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda no ubambile kûlanga. Mulya munda mubele muntû kûboko kwage kûlûme kûbele kûlebele. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />No balangi babisila no bafalisayo babele bakeba akumusongelela Yesû. No nansho, babele bamulwegelela ntê swa ahandie sigi lya kwêtûsha. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Mone Yesû umanyine maninga gabo umwanine gûlya wa kûboko kwabûlebe: “Tûlûka no wêmane kûgêbwa.” Gûlya muntû ûgêle kwêmana kûgêbwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Hûao Yesû wêbalombwele balangi babisila no bafalisayo, nanimibûsha benywe, kikê kiyenene sigi lya kwêtûsha: “Kûlonga kilongwa kisoga ao kûlonga kilongwa kibê? Kûhandia ngikeno ao kwigitobesha?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesû wêbalwele bantû bonse mugela gonse; umulombwele gûlya muntû golola kûboko; kobe, “Olwele. Kûboko kwage.” No ûhandibwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Mone balangi babisila no bafalisayo basumininwe biiko, no babambile kwêbûsenia kintû kêê kyatûlê bumulongela Yesû.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wasolola bikûla kumi no bibêlê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Sigi limo Yesû ûgêle kûlûgûlû kûlomba ûkelishe kûko busigi bugima mukûlomba Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Akûkendûlûka kwa bûsigi, Yesû wêbetile baana babûganga bage, noge wêbasolwele bantû kumi no babêlê, mubûbakata bwabo, kwana wêbetile babikûla: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simo (kwana Yesû umuele sina lya Petelo) no Andele mwanabo, Yakobo no Yoano, no Filipo, Batolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo, Toma, Yakobo wa Alufayo, Simo (witilwe selote muntû ûbele wakeba angalê gya nsê gyabo), <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda mwana wa Yakobo no Yuda Eskaliota, gûlya ûbele kasongakania kalwêsha.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walanga no kûandia batongi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayo 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Nghimba gya ao, Yesû utukile kûlûgûlû amo no baana ba bûganga bage, wêmene akibandabanda, hao abele no kibûngo kikata kya baana babûganga bage no bûngê bwa bantû baimine mpenga gyonse gya Bayuda, Yelusalema no kûnkondo gya Tilo no Sidona bonse baikile kumutegelela Yesû no kûhandibwa mitongo gyabo, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />bantû bonse babele no bûbê basile kumutegelela no kûhandibwa mitongo gyabo. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Bantû bonse babele bakeba kumukuma, kibalo bûkome bwakûhandia bûbele bwaima munda gyage no wêbahandishe bonse.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lyese no musibo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayo 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesû wêbalwele baana babûganga bage, wêsambile:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mwisêlwe malyese benywe bananda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Kibalo Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwenyu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Lyese benywe beno ndjala ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Kibalo samwikutisibwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Lyese benywe bakûlêla ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Kibalo samuseke kwamulogo!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Lyese lyenyu benywe basikibwe no bantû, bekemibeka kûkondo no kwi mitûka, no kwilibenga sina lyenyu kwana libê, kibalo kya Mwana wa Muntû! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Miab 36.16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Bilb 7.52</ref></char></note>Mulogelelwe sigi lilyo no kûtûmbûka kwa nsankê, kibalo kya bûntû kyenyu kikata mwigûlû. Mwanda ba tata nkûlû benyu bebalongele bamoni byonka nansho.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Mone musibo gwenyu benywe bampenta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">Kibalo muêle kûempûlwa!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Musibo gwenyu benywe bagikûta ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Nghimba gya ao samutegelele ndjala!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Musibo gwenyu benywe bakûseka kwa mulogo ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Nghimba gya ao mwa kûlêla no kûempûla!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Musibo gwenyu benywe bantû bonse bakwimitûmbêka; kibalo ba tata nkûlû babo bebalongele bamoni ba bumpi byonka nansho.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukampwe ba mangi gyenyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayo 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Mone nanimilombola benywe bakûtegelela, mwibakampwe bamangi benyu, mwibalongele bûntû balya bemisikwe, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />mwibesele malyese balya ba kwêmita mulago, mwibalombelele balya bakwimilongela bibê. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ntê Muntû ge kûkûûla kwêtama limo, mwalabwêle no lya bûbêlê; muntû ge kûkûswinia koti lyobe, musigêle no simisi. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Gegense wakûlomba mwabêle, no gûlya wakuswinia bintû byobe no kakampwa akwêbwêlêlêshe. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mt 7.12</ref></char></note>Monka mwamutokele bantû bemilongele benywe mwibalongele byonka nansho.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“No ntê mwalibakampwa yaa balya bemikampwe benywe, mwakamona kyabûntû kê? No beno bûbê bebakampwe balya bebakampwe boo! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Byonka ntê mwalibalongela bisoga balya bakwimilongela bisoga, mwakamona kya bûntû kê? No bangêlabibê bakûlonga byonka nansho! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />No ntê mwalibasendeka balya yaa bamulê bakûdjagêle kwimibwêlêlêsha, mwakamona kyabûntû kê? No beno bûbê bakwêbasendeka beno bûbê benabo, mukûkûdjagêla kwêbwêlisibwa lûheto lwabo lonse! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Mone mwibakampwe bamangi benyu no kwêbalongela bisoga, mwibasendeke no namukakûdjagili kwêbwilisibwa kyokyonse. Mone kyabûntû kyenyu kikaba kikata, no benywe mwikaba baana ba Kabesha Mpûngû wamwigûlû biiko, kibalo gee wa bûntû kûbalya ba kufwisha no balya babûbê. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mube no lûsa, nagwe ni Shenyu byalê no lûsa<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwêbaa bûkalabale baange</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayo 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Namukebai bûkalabale bange, no benywe namukasi kûebwa bûkalabale, namukasadji bange, no benywe hamukasandjwa; mulekelele bange, no benywe mwikalekelelwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mwibae bange no benywe mwikaebwa, mwikatambûla mumaboko genyu kilêko kidjûle, kyakûkonkomekwa no kûotaota no kwêsêka, kibalo kilêko kyonka kilya kyamwakwêla kûbange, ûkyonka kyene kemilêla Kabesha Mpûngû kwamulê.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mt 15.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû wêbalombwele lûkêndê lûlû wêsambile: Mpoki wê bûnyonghona kûkûnkûsha mpoki nage? Ubisibyo, bonse babêlê nantê shabagwêlêle mukyêna. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Mt 10.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoa 13.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15.20</ref></char></note>Mulangwa anyonghoni kûêta mulangi wage, mone mulangwa gense wakûkwatêsha milango gyage, wêkaba nagwe mulangi wage.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Mwanda gwakê wamona komba muliso lya mulûnda obe, no ono kwêmona kiûta kimuliso lyobe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Hao wê bûnyonghona ntê kûmulombola mbyalwa nobe: ‘Mbyalwa nane, mpempe nkuimie kibalê muliso lyobe,’ no kûno onokwêmona komba limuliso lyobe gwe mwine? Watûmbêkêlêsha gwee! Imia bêlê kibalê ki muliso lyobe, no hao saûmone binebishe kwisibêla kûnyonghona kuimia kibalê ki muliso lya mbyalwa nobe.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutê no bihelo byage</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayo 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Hakûlê mutê gûsoga gwêkûbyala bihelo bibê, no mutê gûbê gwêkûbyala bihelo bisoga. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mt 12.33</ref></char></note>Mutê gogonse gwakûmanyikana kwa bihelo byage, kibalo bantû abasoboli bihelo bya kikûdjû ku mutê gwa miba no amunyonghoni kûsobola bihelo bya misabibu kû mitê gya migûnga. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12.34</ref></char></note>Byonka nasho muntû musoga wakuimia bilongwa bisoga, kuima mubûkûsa bûsoga bwê mumutêma gwage, no muntû mubê wakuimia bilongwa bibê kuima mumutêma gwage. Kibalo muntû wakwêsamba kûkania kage bilya ku mutêma gwage.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baimpi babêlê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayo 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Kibalo kyakê mwakungita: ‘Kolo, Kolo,’ no kûno hamwakûgwania gilya gyana nkwêsamba? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Shanimie lûkêndê lûyenene kûlangêsha byalê gegense gûlya wakûsha kwandê ûtegelele mianda gyane no kwigigwania: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />gûdjû mwigûlane no muntû muimpe nsese, kwana ûdjabile ansê biiko, no kûbêka nsûlo gyage kûtandalwala. Kyaba mabêmbê agaimine, madjê gaûmpile nsese gilya, mone hagitingine kibalo gibele giimpwe bisoga. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Mone gegense wategelela mianda gyane no akwigilonga, mwigûlane no muntû uimpile nsese kwêgûlû lya musenga akûdjaba nsûlo. Mabêmbêmbê agaûmpile nsese gilya, lwendo lûmo nsese gilya gigwilile no koneka mbeela.<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa Muhandia mwingili wamukûlû wabasilêkale Muloma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayo 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Kyaba Yesû lwabidjile kwêsamba gyonse gya kampilwe bantû kûtegelela, ûgêle Kapelenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Kûko kûbele mukûlû wabasilêkale gûmo kwana ûbele no mwingili wage wabele mukampwe biiko; gûdjo mwingili ûbele mutongi kûbwêhê kûkya. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Gûlya mukûlû wabasilêkale lwategelele musahû gwa Yesû, wêbatumine bakote kansangwa bayuda bagye bamulombole ashe amuhandie mwingili wage. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Kyaba balya bakote lwabaikile kwê Yesû, bamwisasile biiko amukwashe gûlya mukûlû wabasilêkale, besambile: “Mulongele muntû gûdjû monka nwene kûlombela, muyenene kûlongelwa nasino. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Kibalo gee mwigûkampwe musoo gwetû, no ûge wêtuimpêle nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Hûao Yesû ûgêle amo nabo, lwabele kûbwêhê no kuika kû nsese gya gûlya mukûlû wabasilêkale utumine balûnda nage bamulombole Yesû: “Kolo, no kedjembya mbeela, kibalo gwe awêmuyenene kûtwela mu nsese gyane. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ukibalo kyanimwene kwana nsimuyenene kûsha kolê. Mone wêsambe mwanda yaa, no mwingili wane swahande. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kibalo, nene mwine ni muntû wêno bantû beno kitenta kûnêmba, no nino basilêkale kûnsê gyane. Namulombola gûmo: ‘Gyata,’ noge wagyata; namulombola gûnge: ‘Ndjûû,’ noge washaa; nanombola mwingili wane: ‘Longa nansino,’ noge walonga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Kyaba Yesû lwategelele mianda gigyo, wêgalagenie no gûdjo muntû, nfulo wêkyalabûkêle kilya kibûngo kya bantû kibele kya mulonda wêbalombwele: “Shalimone wêno lwêtabêsho lûkata bilûlû no mu Isilaeli!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Nobalya bantû batuminwe kwê Yesû, lwabebwêlêle kû nsese bamutanine gûlya mwingili wawakûwanda mbeela.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wamushûla musongwa mulûme wa madjû mukyêlwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Djoo lyage nghimba gya mianda gino; Yesû ûgêle mu kibûndê kimo kiitilwe Naini no baana babûganga bage. No kibûngo kikata kya bantû, kilondene nage. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Nfulo, lwabaikile kûbwêhê no lêmbwa lya kibûndê, ukuminkene no bantû babele batwale lukii mu kuima andje gya kibûnde. Gûdjû ukile ûbele nsongwa lûme wa madjû mukyêlwe, bantû bangê ba kibûndê kilya babele amo no gûdjo madjû mukyêlwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Kyaba Kolo lwamumwene madjû gûdjo mukyêlwe, mutêma gwage gudjulile lûsa, umulombwele: “Nokalili.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Kûwa, ûshenine kûgêbwa no kukuma bûlya bûtanda bwabaki, no kyaba balya babele bebûtwale bemene. Nfulo wêsambile: “Nsongwa lûme! Nanisamba, gimana!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Gûlya ûbele mukye ubyukile no kûbamba kûbanga, no Yesû umwêbwêlêshe kwê nyage.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bantû bonse batwelilwe no mwenyo babambile kumutûmbêka Kabesha Mpûngû, banine: “Mumoni mukata waimina abûkata bwetû! Kabesha Mpûngû; washa kwêbakwasha bantû bage!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Musahû gûgo gûlongile Yesû, gûgwanine mu Yudeya no mubibûndê byonse bya kûmakondo.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bikûla kuima kwê Yoano Mubatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayo 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Baana babûganga ba Yoano mubatisha, bamusilêshe Yoano kibalo kya mianda gigyo gyonse, noge Yoano wêbetile babêlê abûkata bwabo baana babûganga bage, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />wêbatumine kwê Kolo, bamubûshe: “Gwe ûgûlwa wakasha, ao tumwempe gûnge?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Kyaba balya bantû lwabamuikêle Yesû, bamulombwele: “Yoano mubatisha wa litutuma kolê tûkûbûshe: ‘Gwe ûgûlya wakasha ao tumuempe gûnge.’”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Kyaba kyonka kikyo Yesû ûbele walibahandia bantû bangê, babele no mitongo hala hala no babale no minyaga gibê, no byonka kwêbaûtûla bampoki bangê meso. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isay 35.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61.1</ref></char></note>nansho Yesû wêbaêndwêle balya bamikendi ba Yoane: “Mwibwêlêle mumulombole Yoane, bilya bya mumwene no kûtegelela ba mpoki bamona bisheti byatamba, beno bûsûngû bamunkibwa, bampokoto bategelela; baki bashûlwa, no balanda basawêlwa, musahû gûsoga. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Lyese muntû gûlya hûsha kûkolesibwa no nene!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Baana ba bûganga ba Yoano lwabawêle lwendo, Yesû ûbambile kûlombola kibûngo kibalo kya Yoano mubatisha, wêbalombwele: “Lwamugêle kûlya kû kyanya, mugêle kûlola kee? Mukebile kûmona lûlenge lwa kuninghinibwa no munyaga? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ntê anansho mugêle kûmona kintû kêê? Muntû mushale bishandê bya kitûngo kikata? Ubisibyo! Bantû bashale bishandê bya kitungo kikata no kwêkana ngikeno gisoga, bakwêkana mu masese ga babêkali. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Mone mugêle kûmona kê? Mugêle kumumona mumoni? Ûbyo, mone nanimilombola gee mumulêmbêle mumoni. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>Gudjû Yoane ûge wakwanwa mulusinto lûlûmbûlûke: ‘Lola, namutuma mukendi wane aête kûgêbwa kobe abedjambûla kûkûlongela ndjêla gyobe.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Nanimilombola, abûkata bwa bantû bonse hakûlê mukûlû mbela kûlêmba Yoano Mubatisha: “Mone gûlya mwanike mbeela mu Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû mu kûlû kûlêmba Yoano.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mt 21.32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lk 3.12</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">7.29 </char>
    </note> Bantû bonse no basonkya misonko lwabategelele mianda gya Yesû, no batumbikile kwana ndjêla gya Kabesha Mpûngû gya sitê; kibalo babele babatisibwa no Yoano. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Mone, bafalisayo no balangi babisila, babengile têgê lya Kabesha Mpûngû, kibalo habakampilwe kûbatisibwa no Yoano.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesû ûgêlêlêle kwêsamba, wêsambile: “Nfulo sanibegûshe bantû ba lûbyalo lûlû no kintû kê? Begûlane no kê? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Boo ninagwe baanike bekane mwilambo, bakwigitena bobene kwa bobene no kwêsamba: ‘Twali bombela kikasa, mone hamwibakênde! Twalimimbêla nghimbo gya kûempûla mone hamulilile!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Kibalo Yoano Mubatisha usile, habele walya kyakûlya kyokyonse no kwêne kwêkûbêla difai, no benywe mwisambile: ‘Ge elê no minyaga gibe!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwaana wa Muntû washa, wa kûlya, no kwêkûbêla, no benywe mwalisamba: ‘Mulole wamulyoko, no nkolwa, mulûnda wa basokya misonko no beno bûbê.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Mone, lweni lwasitêtêkibwa kûba lwa sitê no bonse balya bagitabêsha.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû mu nsese gya Simo Mufalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Sigi limo, mufalisayo umwitile Yesû kûlya kyakûlya mu nsese gyage. Onkao Yesû utwelile musense gya gûlya mufalisayo, wêkene amutalako kûlya kyakûlya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mt 26.7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Malk 14.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoa 12.3</ref></char></note> Nfulo, mukibûndê kilya kûbele no madjû gûmo kwana ûbele no bûbê. Lwamanyine kwana Yesû wakûlya kyakûlya kû nsese gya gûlya mufalisayo, ûtwalile kyasa kya makita gaembwe lisoga. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Usile kwêmana kûnkondo gya magûlû ga Yesû, ûbambile kûlêla, no miholo gyage gigwêlêle kûmagûlû ga Yesû. Gûdjo mwana mukasi, ukumwine magûlû ga Yesû no nywene gyage, nfulo, wigiele lwimu lwa kûtomo na umusingile galya makita gaembwe lisoga. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Kyaba gûlya mufalisayo umwitile Yesû, lwamwene nansho, uningile mumutêma gwage: “Ntê muntû gûdjû walê mumoni, waswa kûmanya muntû kê wamukuma, no mwana mukasi wamuswelo kê, kibalo gee ni nonga bibê.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesû umuêndwêle gûdjo mufalisayo: “Simo, nino mwanda gwa kûkûlombola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Noge Simo umuêndwêle: “Eyo! Mulangi nombole.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesû wêsambile: “Kûbele muntû gûmo usendekile bantû babêlê lûeto, mutangi ûtwalile leni lya lûmea mia gitano lwa kitûngo, nowa bûbêlê ûtwalile leni lya lûmea makumi gatano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Mone lwabandilwe kwêbwêlêsha lilyo leni lyabo, gûdjo muntû wêbalekelele bonse babêlê. Onka, nani abûkata bwababo babêlê, wa kamukampwa, gûdjo mpeta mbeela?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simo wêndwêle: “Naninga gûlya ûlekelelwe leni likata mbeela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesû umulombwele, “Wakalûlûla bisoga.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Kûwa, ûmwalabûkêle gûlya mwana mukasi, no umulombwele Simo: “Wamumona gûdjû mwana mukasi? Lwantwelile musense gyobe, ûmpele madjê gakoga kûmagûlû gane, mone gûdjû mwana mukasi wangogya magûlû gane no miholo gyage, no kunkumuna no nywene gyage. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Gwee awimungimune lwimu lwa kûntomona, mone gûdjû mwana mukasi kyaba kya twelile mu nsese gyobe, hamuleke kûtomona magûlû gane. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Gwee hawêmunsinge makita kwêtwe lyane, mone gûdjû mwanamukasi ûlongile nansho kwakunsinga makita ga embwe kû magûlû gane. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kwa nansho, nankûlombola, walekelelwa bûbê bwage bûngê kwakûba wa langêsha bûkampwe bûngê. Mone gûlya ûlekelelwe bisho, mukampwe bisho.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Nfulo Yesû umulombwele gûlya mwana mukasi: “Bûbê bobe bwalekelelwa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Hûao babele amo nage kumutalako babambile kwêbûsenia: “Muntû wa muswelo kê gûdjû wêbûlekelela bûbê?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesû umulombwele mwana mukasi: “Lwêtabêsho lobe lwa kûandia; gyata kwa angalê.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Baana bakasi babele bamukwasha Yesû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Nghimba gya ao, Yesû ûbele waêta mu bibûndê no tûbibêndê, mu kûsahûla musahû gûsoga gwa Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû. No balya baana ba bûgnaga kumi no babêlê babele amo nage,<verse eid="LUK 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mt 27.55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-41">Malk 15.40-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Lk 23.49</ref></char>
    </note>no baana bakasi bamo, kwana ûbele wabaimia minyaga gibe no mitongo gingê abûkata bwa balya baana bakasi kûbele Malia (ûbele wakû Mandelena) ûbele mwimibwe minyaga kiloba; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yaono mukasha Kusa, kwana umwimeni wa bantû bamunsese gya Helode; Susana, no bange bangê babele bamwingêlêla Yesû no baana ba bûganga bage, kwa lûeto lwabo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa mukusi wa nkunwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Kibûngo kikata kyabantû akibûngakane kwê Yesû no balya baimine bibûndê hala hala bamushêlêle; noge wêbalombwele lûkêndê lûno:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mukusi ûgêle kukusa nkunwa gyage. Noge abele wakusa nkunwa, ginge gigwêlêle mundjêla, ginyantilwe no baêtandjêla, no toni twêgilêle. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />No ginge gigwêlêle alwala, agibambile kûmena giumine kibalo kya kûbûla kieo. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />No ginge gigwilile mubukata bwa mitê gya miiba, gilya mitê gya miiba agimenine gihininikile. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ginge gigwilile mu musenga gusoga; gimenine, lûdje lûmo lûbyalile nghendo mia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">No awêle kwesamba nansho, Yesû ûtûlwêle djûwê no kwêsamba: “Wêno matwê gakûtegelela no ategelele!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walisamba kibalo kya kûlanga kûnkêndê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Baana babuganga bage bamubulishe nsitwe gya lûkêndê lûlo, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isay 6.9-10</ref> </char></note> noge wêndwêle: “Benywe mwaebwa kûmanya kibiso kya Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû, mone kûbange nakûlanga kûnkêndê, kibalo; kyokûba bekamona biiko, habakamoni kyokûba bakûtegelela mone habakasingululi.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa sintûla lûkêndê lwa mukusi wa nkunwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Nfulo, gino ûnsitwe gya lûkêndê lûno: ndjee mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Gilya gigwêlêle mu ndjêla gyamonia bantû bakûtegelela gûlya mwanda, nfulo, mubembani washa kwigusindûla mumitêma gyabo, kûba nabakasi kwêtabêsha no kûhanda. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Nogilya ndje gigwêlêle kûlwala balya bakûtambûla mwanda kwa mulogo abalê mukwêgûtegelela, mone habalê misi, kibalo bakwêtabêsha kwakyaba kisho yaa, mone bitompanwa abilê mukwêbaikêla balekela lwêtabêsho. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Gilya gigwêlêle kumitê gya miba lûkênde lwa balya bakûtegelela mwanda, mone lwabalê mukûgêlêlêla bakwininikwa no mudjembo gwa ngikeno gino gya tûlê nagyo, bûeta no mulogo gwa kandje, nobo bagandwa kuimia ndje gikome. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />No gilya ndje gigwêlêle mumusenga gûsonga, lûkêndê lwa bantû balya bakwêgûtegelela gûlya mwanda no kwêgûkwatêsha kwa mutêma gûsoga no gwa bûkokesi babo ûbakûbyala ndje gikome.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa kimuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maluko 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lk 11.33</ref></char>
    </note> “Hakûle muntû wakûkwamia kimuni kyage kwikihuta no kwikibêka munda gya kibêndê. Mone wêkekibêka egûlû lya lwagê, kûba balya bakûtwela mu nsese bamone mugenge.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mt 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lk 12.2</ref></char>
    </note> “Mone hakûle kintû kibisêkwe kisikabisikûlûlwa, no kwênghe kibiso kyokyonse kisikamanyinkani kikabêkwa hepe.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mt 25.29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lk 19.26</ref></char>
    </note>“Kwanansho, mulimuke bya mulê mukûtegelela. Kibalo gûlya wêno kintû shabamubilêshe, mone gûlya usi nokintû swaswinibwe nokine kyalê mukuningêla kûba nakyo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Madjû no bambyalwa nage no Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Kyaba kimo nyage no Yesû no bambyalwa nage basile kumumona, mone habanyonghwene kumushena kibalo kya bûngê bwa bantû. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Muntû gûmo umulombwele Yesû: “Nyobe no bambyalwa nobe bemane andje bakûkeba kûkûmona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesû ûmuêndwêle: “Madjû no bambyalwa nane balya bonse bakûtegelela mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû no kwêgwêngêlêla.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû watalasha mulûla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Sigi limo Yesû wêbalombwele baana babuganga bage, wêsambile: “Tûdjabûke bwala bwa siba.” Nobo babandile mu bwato badjabukile. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Nobo lwababele badjabûka siba, Yesû ûlalile tûlo. Lûkwe lûmo munyaga gwa mulûla gwimine mwisiba, bwato bubambile kûdjûla madje, nobo hababele mukinkukumia kya kûshama. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Hûao baana babûganga bage bamuikêle no kumubyûla, banine: “Kolo, Kolo twatobela!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesû ubyukile, ûkankêle munyaga no gûlya mulûla; no mabêmbê gatalele kusigele talala. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Kûwa Yesû wêbabulishe baana babûganga bage, “Lûkûdjagêlo lwenyu lwêkwê?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Kwa mwenyo no kwêgalagania bebulishe, “Gûdjû muntû wamuswelo kê? Kuana watakesha munyaga no madje nobyo byamukokela!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandia muntû wêno munyaga gûbê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage baikile kûmwalo gwa ba Gelasi kwana gwimugela gwa bûbêlê gwa siba lya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesû lwatukile kuima mubwato, no kûnyanta kûntala ukuminkene no muntû gûmo mwana mulûme wamukibûndê kilya ûbele muhûkêlwe no munyaga gûbê. Noge kwakyaba kila muntû gûdjo habele washitê bishandê, no habele wagikana mu nsese nambo kubilêbû. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Kyaba kyamumwene Yesû, ûtele kahûndû, no kwêta ansê kûgêbwa kwage, no wangwêle djûwê likata, “Gwe Yesû, mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû wêhegûlû biiko, wêno kê no nene? Nankwêsasa no kanyembya!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kyaba kikyo Yesû ûbele watakêsha munyaga gûgo, gumuime muntû gûdjo. Gûgo munyaga gûbê gûbele gwamuhûkêla muntû gûdjo nghendo gingê, no abele wakwêkwa minyololo kû maboko no kû magûlû, no kûbêkwa mu kikûtû, ûkalile gigyo minyololo no kuilwa no gûgo munyaga gûbe mu kianya.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesû umubulishe: “Sina lyobe wini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Noge wêndwêle: “Sina lyane ni kibûngo kya basilêkale.” Kibalo ûbele muhûkêlwe no minyaga gingê. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Gilya minyaga gibê gimwisasile biiko Yesû, nekebatakêsha kûgya kûkalûnga nyembo.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Hantû ao abele no kibûngo kikata kya ngûlûbe, mukûlisibwa mu matelo ga Lûgûlû, gigyo minyaga gibe gimwisasile Yesû ebatakêshe gibatwele ba ngûlûbe noge wêbatakêshe gibatwele. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Kyaba gilya minyaga gibê, lwagimuimine gûdjo muntû gibatwelile balya ba ngûlûbe. No kibûngo kyonse kyangûlûbe kitukile lûbêlo mulûonga, gigwêlêle mumadjê no kûshama mwisiba.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Balya bantû babele baempa kilya kibûngo kya ngûlûbe lwabamwene bilya bilongekile, batinine lûbêlo, bagwaninie musahû mukibûndê no kûmakondo. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Nobo bantû bagêle kwêmwena bilongekile, kyaba byabaikile abale Kolo Yesû, bamusangene gûlya muntû mwana mulûme uhiminwe no minyaga gibe mwikane kûmagûlû ga Yesû, walê mushale kishandê no wêno ngeni gigwane; nfulo bantû babo batudjukile. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Balya bamwene mianda gigyo balombwele bantû bange nansilya gûlya muntû byabele muhûkêlwe no gûlya munyaga gûbe no mweandêle. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Hûao bantû ba mu mwalo gwa Bagelasi bakwatilwe no mwenyo gûngê, bamulombwele Yesû asemuke kwabalê abagale lwege. Nfulo Yesû ûbandile mubwato wêbwêlêle lwege. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Gûlya muntû uiminwe no minyaga gibe umwisasile amulonde Yesû, “Agye amo nage.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Mone Yesû umulagile, no kumulombola, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Gibwêla kû nsese gyobe wêbalombole bantû byonse Kabesha Mpûngû byenekûlongela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Nfulo gûlya muntû wêbwêlêle, mukûtûmbia mubibûndê mianda gyonse Yesû gyamulongele.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsongwa kasi wa Yailo no mwana mukasi ukumine kishandê kya Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesû lwagibwêlêle bwala bwabûbêlê bwasiba, kibûngo kyabantû kimukunkile kwa mulogo, kibalo babele bamuempela. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Kûwa muntû gûmo usile sina lyage Yailo; ûbele mwimeni mukûlû wa nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda. Ûgwêlêle kû magûlû ga Yesû, no kumwisasa agye kû nsese gyage, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Kwakûba nsongwa kasi wage wabugima, wakilêko kya miaka kumi no gibêlê, ûbele mukye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesû lwabele mulwendo, kibûngo kya bantû kibele kimuininikile mugela gonse. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Nfulo mukibûngo kikyo mubele mwana mukasi gûmo ûbele wasûswa no mudjamba sûsa kilêko kya miaka kumi no gibêlê; no ûbele wawakusiminia lûeto lwege, kûbaûndai hamwene muntû wa kumuandia. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Gûdjo mwanamukasi umulondile Yesû nghimba, ukumine hêndo lya kishandê kyage lûkwe lûmo wandile mutongo gwa mudjamba sûsa. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesû ubulishe, “Nani wankûma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Bantû bonse lwababengile, Petelo wêsambile: “Kolo, bûngê bwa bantû bwakukwininika.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Mone Yesu wêsambile: “Kwêno muntû wankuma, kibalo na mona kwana bûkome bwampima.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Gûlya mwana mukasi lwasingûlwêle kwana anyonghoni kwibisêka, wêsogolwele mukûkwaka kwa kahaga ugwilile kûgêbwa kwê Yesû. Hao wêsambile kûgêbwa kwa bantû bonse kibalo kyakê umukumine, no mwahandêle lwendo lûmo. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Nfulo Yesû umulombwele, “Nsongwa kasi lwêtabêsho lobe lwakûhandia. Gyata kwa angalê.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesû lwabele ûkyakûbanga, kusile mwingili gûmo kuima kû nsese. “Gya mukûlû wa nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda,” kumulombola; “Nsongwa kasi obe wa wakûkya. Noka gililili kumudjembya mulangi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesû lwategelele mwanda gûgo, umulombwele Yailo, “No katudjuki; gitabêsha ya, noge musike obe shahande.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Kyaba kyaikile mu nsese gya Yailo, hatakêshe muntû kûtwela amo nage nambo Petelo, Yoano, Yakobo, amo no tata no madjû wa gûlya nsongwa kasi. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Kyaba kyonka kikyo bantû bonse babele balêla no kûtompola kibalo kya gûdjo nsogwa kasi. Yesû wêbalombwele, “Namukalili kibalo gûdjû nsongwa kasi enelikye; nambo mulale!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Nobo bamusekile kwa kûbedja, bamanyine sitê kwana wa wakûkya. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Mone Yesû umukwatile gûlya nsongwa kasi kûkûboko wêsambile, “Nsongwa kasi, byûka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Muntêma gwage gumwibwêlêle, noge ubyukile lûkwe lûmo, Yesû ûtakêshe haebwe kyakûlya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Babyali bage begalagenie biiko, mone Yesû wêbatakêshe nabakamulomboli muntû gegense bilya bilongekile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibatuma balya kumi no babêle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Kyaba Yesû lwalibetile balya kumi no babêle wêbaele kitenta no bûkome bwa kûkûmba minyaga gibe gyonse no bwa kûandia mitongi gyonse, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />kûwa wêbatumine bagye basaûle Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû, no kûandia batongi, <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lk 10.4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Bilb 13.51</ref></char></note> Webalagile wêsambile: “Namukatwali kyokyonse mulwendo: ha nswii, no mutûngû, no kine kyakûlya, no lûheto, no namukatwali nkaso gya kwalabûla. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Nsese gyogyonse gya mulêkatwele no kûkûnkwa, mwikane mumo kuikêla amulê kasindûka mu kibûndê kikyo; <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />ntê bantû bokûbenga kwimikûnka, amulê kaima mukibûndê kikyo, mukekûnkûle lubimbi kû magûlû genyu kibalo kikabe kusitêkêkya kwabalê.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Nansho, balya baana ba bûganga babambile lwendo baitile mu bibûndê, mukûsahûla mwanda gûsoga no kûandia batongi kûntû konse.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Helode watubigana kibalo gya Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mt 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Malk 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lk 9.19</ref></char>
    </note>Nfulo mubêkali Helode, ûtegelele musahû gwa mianda gyonse gibele gyalongeka, ûbele mutubiganibwe, kibalo bantû bamo bagana, Yoano washûka kuima kû baki. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bange besambile kwana Elia waimina, no bange besambile kwana gûmo wa bamoni bakala washûka kûima kûbaki. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Mone Helode wêsambile: “Gûdjo Yoano mukalile twee; nani byonka gûdjû wanantegelela mianda gyage?” Ûbele no kiwewe kya kumumona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibaa kyakûlya Bantu elufu litano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoano 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Kyaba balya ba bikûla bage lwabebwêlêle, bamulombwele Yesû byonse bya balongile. Yesû wêbatwalile, bagêle hantû abugima ekûbwêhe no kibûndê kya Betesaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Mone balya bantû lwabamanyine kwagêle, bamulondile. Yesû wêbakunkile wêbabangêle kibalo kya Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû, wêbaandishe bakebile kûandibwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Djûba alibambile kûtûka balia ba bikûla kumi no babêlê bamuikêle Yesû bamulombwele: “Wêbalage bantû bagyate mubibûndê no kûmabala ge kûbwêhê, bakebe byakûlya no hantû akûlala kibalo ano atûlê akyanya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Mone Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Mwibae byakûlya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Nobo baêndwêle: “Hatûle kyokyonse nambo mikate gitano no misha gibêlê. Ao tûgyate twêbolêle byakulya bisabibagwane bantû baba bonse.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Babele alya baana balûme basangenwe 5,000.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Nfulo Yesû wêbalombwele baana babuganga bage: “Mwibalombole bantû bekane ansê bibûngo bya bantû makuni gatano gatano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Baana babûganga balongile nansho no muntû gense wêkene ansê, <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesû ûtwalile gilya mikate gitano no gilya misha gibêlê, ûlwele mwigûlû, no kufwisha, kûwa wêgyêsele malyese, wigisansûlwêle, wêbaele baana babûganga bage bebatange bantû. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bantû bonse balêle bekutile. No baana ba bûganga bakongile biendê bya mikate bisigele badjulishe bitala kumi no bibêlê.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wasitêkêkya kwana Yesû û Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayo 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maluko 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Sigi limo Yesû ûbele walomba bugima bwage, no baana babûganga bage babele amo nage. Nfolo wêbabulishe: “Bantû bakwêsamba nene nini?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mt 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Malk 6.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Lk 9.7-8</ref></char>
    </note>“Nobo bamuêndwêle Yesû Bange,” besambile gwee wê Yoano. “Mubatisha bange Elia, no bange balisamba kwana wêgûmo wa bamoni wa shûka kuima kûbaki.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Yoa 6.68-69</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kûwa Yesû wêbabulishe: “No benywe mwalisamba, nene nini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petelo ûwêndwêle: “Gwee ûge Kilisitu wa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walagûla kibalo kya kûsûsûlwa no luki lwege</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayo 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maluko 8.30—9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Hûao Yesû wêbatakêshe baana bûganga bage na bakalomboli muntû gegense mwanda gûgo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesû ûgêlêlêle kwêsamba kwana, “Kiyenene Mwana wa Muntû wêkamona masûsû gangê, no kûbengwa no baleli, balambwili bakûlû, no balangi babisila no muyenene kwêyagwa. No sigi lya bûsatû, wêkashûlwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14.27</ref></char>
    </note>Nfulo Yesû wêbalombwele bantû bonse: “Muntû gense gekûkeba kûba mwaana wabûganga wane, kiyenene ebenge kikûlê kyage, atwale mutê gwa mpênga mpêtya gwage masigi gonse, no anonde. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lk 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoa 12.25</ref></char></note>Kibalo muntû wakûkeba kûandia ngikeno gyage mwine, wakegitobesha, mone wêkatobesha ngikeno gyage kibalo kyane wêkegiandia. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Katolwa kê muntû gee kûkamona bûeta bonse bwa mukandje, mone asiminie no kûtobesha kikûlê kyage gee mwine? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Muntû gegense wêkamwena nsoni nene no mianda gyane, Mwana wa Muntû wa kamumwena nsoni muntû gûdjo, kyaba kyalêkasha mu ntumbo gyage no ntumbo gya Shage no gya masalagûlû galûmbûlûke. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Sitê sitê nanimilombola, bamo mubûkata bwa bemane ano abakatompi luki, ntê habalimone Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wagalabûka lûkebo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayo 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maluko 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Pet 1.17-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kilêko kya masigi muganda nghimba gya kwêsamba gigyo, Yesû wêbatwalile Petelo, Yoano no Yakobo, ûgêle kûlûgûlû kûlomba. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Abele walomba, lûkebo lwege lûmonekile nagwe lwagalabuka, no bishandê byage bikenkile bimugenge gwa nkûba. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Onkao bamonekile bantu babêlê Musa no Elia, babele bakûbanga nage. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bamonekile mu ntumbo, babangile no Yesû kibalo kya kûkya kwage kwana kwêkaimina kûko Yelusalema, mwanda agwanininie bisintilwe kibalo kyage. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petelo no benage babele bakomenwe no tûlo tûkole; mone kyaba kya babyukile, bamwene ntumbo gya Yesû, no balya bantû babêlê babele bemane amo nage. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Kyaba kikyo balya bantû babêlê lwababele balekenkana no Yesû, Petelo umulombwele Yesu: “Mulangi, bisoga twêkane ano! Nfulo tuimpe bitûla bisatû, kimo kyobe kimo kya Musa no kimo kya Elia.” Mone Petelo ûbele edjê byabele walisamba.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petelo lwabele walisamba nasho, lûkwe lûmo kile kibaimine no kwêbaûta, no kile akibaikêle balya baana babûganga batudjukile biiko. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Djûwê litegelelwe kuima mukikyo kile: “Gûdjû ûge mwanane wansolwele, mumutegelele gee.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Nghimba gya djûwê lya Kabesha Mpûngû kwêsamba, bamutanine Yesû elê bugima bwage. Baana babûganga baempele mianda gigyo kwa kibiso no abalombwele muntû gegense gilya gyonse gya bamwene.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandia nsongwa lûme wêno minyaga gibê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayo 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maluko 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Djoo lyage, Yesû no balya baana babûganga basatû, Petelo, Yoano no Yakobo, lwabatûkile kuima kûlûgûlû, kibûngo kikata kyabantû kikuminkene nabo. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Muntû gûmo mukilya kibûngo ûwangwêle djûwê, kwêsamba: “Mulangi! Nankwêsasa mukwashe nsongwa lûme wane wabugima! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Nghendo kwa nghendo munyaga gûbe gwamuhûkêla, no kumulonga angûle djûwê, kûwa gwakumugwêsha bisila ngoga no kuimwa no nfulu kûkania. Gûgo munyaga gûbe gwa kumudjembia biiko no hagwakumuleka no ene asho! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nibalombile baana babûganga bobe baimie gûgo munyaga gûbe, nobo habanyonghwene.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Lwênywe lûbyalo lûbê lusi no lwêtabêsho, ngikane nenyu no kwimilêndêla kwikêla kyaba kê? Musishe nsongwa lûme obe ano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Kyaba mwana gûdjo lwabele washa kwê Yesû, gûlia munyaga gûbe gumugwilishe ansê no kumubêka bisila ngoga. Mone Yesû wêgûkankêle gûlya munyaga gûbê gumuime, ûmwandishe gûlya nsongwa lûme no umwibwêle kwê shage. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Bantû bonse begalagenie biiko, kwakûmona bûkome bûkata bwa Kabesha Mpûngû.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesû walagûla byonka kibalo kya luki lwege</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Nobo bantû bonse lwababele mukwêgalagania, kibalo kya mianda gyonse Yesû gilongekile, gee wêbalombwele baana babûnganga bage: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mutegelele bisoga mianda gyandê kemilombola, Mwana wa Muntû wakaimibwa mumaboko ga bantû.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Mone boo habasingûlwêle mianda gya lisambile. Kibalo mianda gigyo gibele gibisêkwe kwabalê kûba nabakasingululi; nobo batinine kumubûsha nsintwe gya mianda gigyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani mukûlû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kuimine mpaka abûkata bwa balya baana babûganga kibalo kya nani wêkaba mukûlû kûbonse. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Mone Yesû usingûlwêle maninga gabo, noge umutwalile mwana mushoo umubikile kûgêbwa kwabo,<verse eid="LUK 9:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoa 13.20</ref></char>
    </note>kûwa wêbalombwele: “Muntû gegense wêkamutambûla mwana gûdjo mukemuke ku sina lyane wantambûla nene; no gegense wakûntambûla nene, wamutambûla gûlia untumine. Kibalo gûlia mukemuke kûlêmba bonse abûkata bwenyu ûge wêko mukûlû kûlêmba bonse.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Husimangi gyenyu wêmugela gwenyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maluko 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yoano umulombwele: “Mulangi, tûmwene muntû gûmo wakuimia minyaga gibê ku sina lyobe, tûtompile kumukanda kwakûba gee hagûmo wetû.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesû umulombwele: “Namukamukandi, kibalo gûlya usimangi gyenyu wêmugela gwenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basamalia babengile kumukûnka Yesû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Kyaba akigwanine kya Yesû kûtwalwa mwigûlû, gee ûkampilwe kûgya Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Utumine bikûla bamutagêlêle, nobo bagêle mukibûndê kimo kiaba Samalia kûba bamubêkêle djambûla kintû kyonse. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Mone bantû ba kibûndê kilia habebakunkile kibalo ûbele mwelekele Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.54: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Mub 1.9-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kyaba baana babûganga bage, Yakobo no Yoano, lwabamwene nansho, besambile: “Kolo, wakeba tûtakêshe kaya katûke kuima mwigûlû kebatobeshe?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Mone “Yesû wêbalabûkêle kwêbakankêla biiko.” <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Nobo bagêle ku kibûndê kinge.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûlûlê bwa kumulonda Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayo 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Lwababele bagya mundjêla, muntû gûmo umulombwele Yesû: “Nsankûlonde kokonse konokagya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesû umuêndwêle: “Mibwabwa gino mekano mumena, no toni twagûlû twêno binswa, mone Mwana wa Muntû halê hantû akûbêka kwa twe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesû umulombwele muntû gûnge: “Nonde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Mone muntû gûlya umuêndwêle: “Kolo, ntakêshe bêlê ngyate munshêke tata.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesû wêndwêle, “Wêbaleke baki bashêke baki babo. Mone gwee gyata ûkatûmbye Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.61: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Mub 19.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>No muntû gûnge umulombwele: “Kolo, nshakûlonde; mone nanomba ngyate ndage belê ba mbyalwa nane.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesû wêndwêle: “Muntû gense wakwata mwini gwa lûkasû mukûlêma, kûno wakwalabuka nghimba, hamuyenene kwêngêla mu Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû utumine bikûla makumi kiloba no babêlê</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Nghimba gya hao, Kolo wêbasolwele baange makumi kiloba no babêlê wêbatumine babêle babêlê mu kibûndê byonse, no hantû onse akampilwe lwendo. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mt 9.37-38</ref></char></note>Yesû wêbalombwele, “Bimbûlwa bingê, mone bengili ûbake. Kwanansho, mulombe mwine bala, kibalo atume bembuli mwibala lyage. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mt 10.16</ref></char></note>Mubagale! Nanimituma benywe mube nagwe bana bamikoko mubûkata bwa tulambo. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mt 10.7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Malk 6.8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Lk 9.3-5</ref></char></note>Namukatwali mutûngû gwa lûheto, kasiba no bikwabêlo; na mukemuni muntû gegense mu ndjêla. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />“Kyaba kyamwatwela mu nsese gyogyonse, bêlê mwibemune nansino: ‘Angalê libe mu nsese gino!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ntêê kwê bantû bakwêkana mu nsese gigyo, mukampwe angalê; nfulo angalê lyenyu salikane noge, ntê anashio, angalê likemibwêlêlêla. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Bakl 9.14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tem 5.18</ref></char></note>Mwikane mu nsese gikampwe angalê, mulye no kwêkûbêla byobyonse kyabalê kemia kibalo mulongi wa mugêlo muyenene kûhebwa katolwa kage. Namukatundi kuima mu gigi nsese no kûgya kuginge nsese. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Kyaba kyamulê mukûgya mukibûndê kyokyonse no bantû kwimikûnka, mulye byakûlya byabalêkemia, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />muhandie batongi bekane mu nsese gikyo, mwibalombole bantû: ‘Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwashena kwa mulê.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Bilb 13.51</ref></char></note>Mone benywe kûtwela mukibûndê bo hakwimikûnka, mugye mumienda gyage no mwisambe: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Nolwêne lubimbi lwa mumwalo gwenyu lwêtûkwatile kûmagûlû getû, twalilûkûnkûla kwa mulê. Mone mumanye kwana Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwashena!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Mub 19.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mt 11.24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">10.15</ref></char></note>Nanimilombola sitê sigi lilya mwalo gûgo gwêkamona bûkalabale bûkata kûlêmbêla bûlya bwa bantû ba Sodoma.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musibo kwa mwalo gûsi gwêsase</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayo 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isay 23.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Esek 26.1—28.26</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Sak 9.2-4</ref></char>
    </note>“Musibo gobe Kolasini! Musibo gobe, Betesaida! Bibûndê bibyo byalê bisase kaala, kwakûshala nyambê no kwêgalamuna mu bûto! <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mone kikaba kiele biiko kwa Tilo no Sidona, abakaebwa bûkalabale biiko byamulê kaebwa benywe. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isay 14.13-15</ref></char></note>Nobenywe bantû, ba Kapelenaumu! Mwikatûlûlwa kuika mwigûlû ntêê? Ubisibyo, Mwikatukibwa kûkalûnga nyembo!” <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Malk 9.37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lk 9.48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoa 13.20</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char></note> “Gegense wêkemitegelela benywe wantegelela nene; gegense wêkemibenga benywe, wamenga nene; mone wakamenga nene wamubenga gûlya utumine.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwêbwêlêla kwa balya makumi kiloba no babêlê</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />nghimba balya makumi kiloba no babêlê abebwêlêle babele no mulogo banine: “Kolo, nogine minyaga gibê gyalitûkokela, kibalo kya sina lyobe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Mumwene lyabola kûgwêla lûbêlo kuima mwigûlû nagwe kûlyema kwa nkûba. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Nghib 91.13</ref></char></note>Mulole nanimia bûkome bwa kunyata ndjoka no nkelegendje, kibalo kya bûkome bonse bwa gûlya mangi, hakûlê kyokyonse kikemialalasha. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Mone; namukalogelelwa kibalo minyaga gibê gya limikokela nambo mulogelelwe kibalo masina genyu gasintwa mwigûlû.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulogo gwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayo 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Kyaba kyonka kilya, Yesû ûlogelelwe kwa bûkome bwa Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke, wêsambile, “Nankûtûmbêka Tata, Kolo wa gûlû no kandje, kibalo walibabisêka mianda gino beno ngeni no beno lango; nogwe wêbahûtwêle baana bakebake; ûbyo, Tata, kwakûba ûbyo byabikûnengeshe.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoa 3.35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10.15</ref></char>
    </note> “Tata wane wantanga bintû byonse, hakûle mumanye Mwana nambo Tata, no mumunye Tata nambo Mwana, no gegense gûlya kwana Mwana saakampwe kumuhûtwêla.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Nfulo Yesû wêbalabûkêle baana babûganga bage ubangile naabo bugima: “Lyese meso gakumona bilya bya mwakûmona benywe! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Sitê nanimilombola bamoni no bamakolo bange, bakampilwe kûmona bilya byamulê mukûmona mone habakûmona, no kûtegelela bilya byamwakûtegelela, mone habategelele.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa Musamalia musoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mt 22.35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Malk 12.28-34</ref></char>
    </note>Sigi limo mulangi gûmo wabisila wêmene mwanda amutompe Yesû, umubumlishe: “Mulangi, nonge ntêê kûba mone kûyana bûkome bwa miaka?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesû umuêndwêle: “Musintwe nte mu bisila bya musa, wategelela ntêê?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.27: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 6:5">Benlf 6.5</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:18">Ngib 19.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Umwêndwêle, “‘Mukampwe Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû obe kwa kikûlê kyobe kyonse, kwa mutêma gobe gonse, kwa bûkome bobe bonse, no kwa lango lyobe lyonse’; no ‘Mukampwe mukuminkani nobe monka molê mwikampêlwe mwine.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Benlf 18.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Yesû umulombwele,” Bisoga, longa nansho; “Nogwe sowêkane.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Mone gûlya mulangi wabisila ûkebile kwêmonia kûba wasitê, umubulishe Yesu: “Mukuminkani nane nani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesû umuêndwêle, wêsambile, “Muntû gûmo utukile kuima Yelusalema kûgya Yeliko, ûsûmbêlêlwe no binyanga nyanga, bamushûlile bishandê, bamuswininie lûheto lwege no kumuhûla bamusigile sabaga abûsho kûkya. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Nansi kyonka kikyo kyaba mulambwili gûmo ûbele wahêta mundjela gilya, lwamumwene muntû gûdjo uwitile kûnkondo. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Byonka nansho, Mwinalefi gûmo lwaikile antû hao umumwene, witile mugela gûnge. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Miab 28.15</ref></char></note>Mone, Musamalia gûmo ûbele mulwendo uwikile alya abele muntû gûlya, noge lwamumwene umukyêlêle lûsa. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Umugêlêle umundaile biloho byage, kwakumubêka difai, no makita no kumuomba kiûto; nfulo umubandishe kwêgûlû lya mpûnda gyage, umwilile mu nsese gimo gya bageni no kûmuundaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Djoo lyage, gûlya Musamalia uhiminie lûmea lûbêlê lwakitûngo umuele gûlya mwine nsese wêsambile: ‘Mundae gûdjû no kyokyonse kyonokengêla nene anankebwêla, nikakûwa.’<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />No Yesû ubulishe: “Mubûkata mwababo basatû, nani ûlangêshe kûba mukuminkani wagûlya ûsûmbêlêlwe no binyanga nyanga?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Gûlya mulangi wabisila umwuêndwêle, “Gûlya umumwenene lûsa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Huao Yesû umulombwele, “Gyatalobe nogwe ûkalonge byonka nansho.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa mutambêla Malata no Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yoa 11.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10.38 </char>
    </note>Yesû no baana babûganga bage lwabagêlele nolwendo Yesû ûtwelile mu kibûndê kimo, mwana mukasi gûmo witilwe Malata umukunkile kû nsese gyage. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Malata ûbele no nkasi byala gyage witilwe Malia, gûdjû wêkene kûbwêhê no Yesû, walituga milango gyage gyabele walisamba. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Mone Malata ûbele mulole mianda gyage, nfulo, umwikêle Yesû umulombwele: “Kolo, nansino onokwagamwa kwana nkasi byala gyane wansiga nyembe bugima bwane? Nfulo mulombole ankwashe!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Mone Kolo umuêndwêle, “Malata, Malata, wakûsûsûka no kûdjemba kibalo kya bintû biingê, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />mone kyakebwa kintû kimo ya kiyenene. Mone Malia wasobola kintû kisoga, kwana hakaswinibwa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû walanga kibalo kya milombelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayo 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Sigi limo Yesû ûbele hantû amo mukûlomba, lwabidjile kûlomba, gûmo mu baana babûganga bage umulombwele: “Kolo, wêtûlange kûlomba, na gwe ni Yoano mubatisha byelangile baana babûganga bage.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Kyaba kyamulê mukûlomba, mwisambe nansino:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tata wêtû:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Sina lyobe litûmbêkwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Bûkolo bobe bûshe,<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Wêtûwe mbeela kyakûlya kyetû. Kya masigi gonse.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Wêtûlekelele bûbê bwetû,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Nagwe nansilya byatûlê mukwêbalekelela balya bakwêtûlongele bibê.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">No ketubiki mubitompanwa.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Kûwa Yesû wêbalombwele, “Nani abûkata bwenyu ûgêle kwê mulûnda mandê ga busigi, umulombwele: ‘Mulûnda, nsendeke kyakûlya, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Kwakûba mulûnda nane waêtêla kwane wêmulwendo, no nene silê kyakumuwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />No wêmunda gya nsese umwindwêle: ‘Nokanyembya! Nampwa kubigala kilêmba. Nene no banaa bane twawa kûlala, nsinyonghoni kûbyûka nkwabêle kyokyonse.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Sitê nanimilombola kwana, no ntêê aso kûbyûka amutange kyakûlwa, kibalo gee mulûnda wage, mone kibalo kya kûgêlêlêla kumulomba asaabyûke amutange kyokyonse kyene kûkeba.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Kwanansho nanimilombola: Mulombe no benywe musamuebwe; mukebe no benywe musa mumone; mukokole mushango, no benywe musa mubigwêlwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kibalo gegense wakûlomba wakûebwa, no gûlya wakûkeba saamone, no wakûkokola mushango saabigwêlwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />“Nani mubûkata bwa tata, nsongwalûme wage kumulomba musha, amutange ndjoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Nontê wamulomba usi, shamwabêle nkelegendje? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nfulo ntê benywe mwibabê, mwibamanye kwêbaa bana benyu bintû bisoga, sitê Tata wenyu wa mwigûlû salonge biête. Shaebae Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke balya bakumulomba!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû no Belesebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maluko 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Sigi limo Yesû ûbele waimia minyaga gibê gimulongile muntû gûmo kûba kameme; kyaba gigyo minyaga gibê agimwimine gûlya muntû ûbele kameme, ûnyonghwene kûbanga. No bûngê bwa bantû bwalankene, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mt 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref></char></note>mone bamo mubukata bwabo besambile: “Waligikûmba minyaga gibê, kûbûnyonghoni bwa Belesebuli, mukûlû wa minyaga gyonse gibe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bange bamutompile Yesû, bakebile alonge byesha kuima mwigûlû. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Mone Yesû ûbele mumanye maninga gabo, wêbalombwele: “Bantû ba bûkolo bobonse bokûlwa bobene kwa bobene, bûkolo bûbo bwêkagwêla, no bantû ba musoo gûmo bokûlwa bobene kwa bobene musoo gûgo gwêkagwêla. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ntê Liabola gee kwêsansûlûla gee mwine, bûbêkali bwage bwêbwêmana ntêê? Nanisamba nansino kibalo benywe mwakwana nankûkûmba minyaga gibê kwabûkome bwa Belisebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Ntê nankûkûmba minyaga gibê kwabûkome bwa Belesebuli, bengili benyu bakûkûmba kwabûkome bwani? Kwanansho babo ûbekemia bûkalabale! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Mone, ntê nene nankûkûmba minyaga gibê no bûkome bwa munie gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, nfulo, Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwawa kuika kwamulê.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Kyaba muntû wêno bûkome, mwikwêke byabulwi byage byonse, alêmukûempa nsese gyage bintû byage byonse bimuangalê. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Mone kyaba muntû mumulêmbêle buumu, gee kumusûmbêlêla no kumunyonghona, gee shamuswinye bya bulwi byage byonse byalê mukûdjagêle no kwibinsansûlûlûla.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Malk 9.40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Muntû gegense usi amo nane, maangi gyane; no gegense hûsha kukuminkania amo nane, wasangalêka.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwêbwêla kwa minyaga gibê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Kyaba munyaga gûbê agwakumuima muntû, gwakûêtaêta kûntû kusi madjê gwakûkeba hantû akwêtûsha, mone akûmona, hûao gwalisamba: ‘Swangibwêlêle mu nsese gyane gyampimine.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Kyaba kya gwêbwêlêle no kûsangana gilya nsese giyangêlwe no kûlengûlwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Hûao gûgêle kûtwala minyaga ginge kiloba gibê biiko kûmulêmbela gee, nogyo shagitwele kwêkana mumo. Nansho, ngikeno gya muntû gûlya shagyalabûke kûba gibê kûlêmba ngikeno gitangi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulogo gwa sitêê</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesû lwabele walisamba mianda gigyo, mwana mukasi gûmo mukilya kibûngo kya bantû wangwêle djûê likata no kumulombola: “Lyese mwana mukasi gûlya ûkûbyalile no kûkonkya!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Mone Yesû wêndwêle: “Lyese biiko kûbalya bakûtegelela mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû no kwêgûkokela!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantû bakeba kabandêlelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mt 16.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Malk 8.12</ref></char>
    </note>Bwêngê bwa bantû abagêlêlêle kubila, Yesû wêbalombwele: “Lûbyalo lûlû lûbyalo lûbê! Lwakeba kabandêlêlo, mone alûso kûebwa nambo kabandêlêlo ka Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:4">Yoa 3.4</ref></char></note>Kibalo nagwe ni Yona byabele kabandêlêlo kûbantû ba Ninawi, ûbimwana wa Muntû byelêkaba kabandêlêlo kû lûbyalo lûlû. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Mub 10.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Miab 9.1-12</ref></char></note>Kolo mwana mukasi wa kahênda kalûngû wêkemana kyaba kya bûkalabale no kwêbaa bûkalabale bantû ba lûbyalo lûlû kwa kûba gee usile kuima nfulo gya kandje kûtegelela ngeni gya Solomomo. No hao emukûlû kûlêmba Solomono. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon 3.5</ref></char></note>Bantû ba Ninawi bekaimina kyaba kya bûkalabale nobo bekelûwa bûkalabale lûbyalo lûlû kwana lwêno bûbê, kibalo ba Ninawi besasile kibalo kya bûsahuli bwa Yona; no nansi hano eno kintû kikûlû kûlêmba Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mugenge gwa mubêlê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayo 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Malk 4.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lk 8.16</ref></char>
    </note> “Hakûle muntû wakûkwamia kimuni kyage kwikihuta no kwikibeka munsê gya kibêndê; mone wêkekibêka egûlû lya lwagê, kûba balya bakûtwela mu nsese bamone mugenge. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Kyaba liso lyobe alilê poo, mubêlê gobe gonse sagûbe gûdjûlwe mugenge; mone ntê liso lyobe lyokûba litunyike, no mubêlê gobe swa, sagûbe mu mudjo. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ûbe meso, mugenge gwê munda gyobe, na gûkasi gûbe mudjo. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Nfulo, ntê mubêlê gobe gonse, gwimumugenge kûbûla kûba no kiba kyokyonse kimudjo, mubêlê gobe gonse gwêkakenka, sitê nagwe nansilya kimuni byakilê mukûkenka kwa mugenge gwage.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malêngê kibalo kya Bafalisayo no Balangi babisila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesû lwabele wabanga, Mufalisayo gûmo umukunkile kû kyakûlya mu nsese gyage; Yesû ûgêle kwêkana kumutalako kûlya kyakûlya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Gûdjo Mufalisayo walankene kûmona Yesû walya hakoga kuminie. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Hûao Kolo umulombwele: “Benywe Bafalisayo mwakukila lûhêndê no lûbadje andje, mone munda gyenyu mudjûle bûswinania no bûbê. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Babidje benywe, hamwidjê kwana ûlongishe bya andje, ûge ulongishe bya munda? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Nfulo mwimie milambû gya bilya byamulê nabyo mwibae balanda, no lola, bintû byonse sabibe bimunke kwamulê.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Benlf 27.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Mone musibo gwenyu Bafalisayo! Kibalo mwa kumulambwêla Kabesha Mpûngû milambu gya ntobo gya minyanyi, no byakûlya hala hala no miswelo hala hala gya minyani, mone mwahûmbûlûla sitê no bûkampwe bwa Kabesha Mpûngû. Kimiyenene mube bakwatêshe, kûbûla kwêbêlêla binge.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Musibo gwenyu Bafalisayo! Kibalo mwibakampwe kwêkana kûgêbwa antû anyeme mu masese ga milombelo gya Bayuda no kwimunwa kwabûnyeme mwibûlû.” <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />“Musibo gwenyu! Kibalo mwinagwe bilêbû bisi no kabandêlêlo, kwana bantû bakûnyanta egûlû lyabyo kûbûla kûmanya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Gûmo wabalangi babisila umulombwele: “Mulangi, ono kwêsamba gigyo mianda walitûtûka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesû umuêndwêle: “No benywe balangi babisila, musibo gwenyu, kibalo mwa kwêbatwêka bantû bitûndû binyeme byabasi nyonghoni kûtwala, mone benywe bene hamwakûtûlûla no gwêne munie gûmo kwêbakwasha. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Musibo gwenyu, kwakûba mwakuhimpa bilûbû bya bamoni, kwana batata nkûlû benyu babeyagile. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kwanansho, mwasitêkêkya no kwêtabêsania no bilongwa bya batata nkûlû benyu; kibalo babo bebeyagile bamoni, no benywe mwalibaimpêla bilêbû byabo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kibalo kya lweni lûlû Kabesha Mpûngû wêsambile nansino: ‘Nikebaêlêla bamoni no bikûla; bekeyaga bange nabo no kwêbadjembya bange.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Kwanansho lûbyalo lûlû lwêkaebwa bûkalabale kibalo kyamasi ga bamoni bonse gesikile mubambo gwa kandje, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Mub 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2 Miab 24.20-21</ref></char></note>kûbamba kwêsêlwa masi ga Ebeli kuhikêla galya ga Sakalia, kwana bamwiyagile abûkata bwa tûdjaba no hantû alûmbûlûke. Sitê, nanimilombola lûbyalo lûlû, lwêkaebwa bûkalabale mu mianda gino gyonse!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Musibo gwenyu benywe Balangi babisila! Kibalo mwabisêka mpûtûlo gya mushango gwa lweni; benywe bene hamwibatwele, mwibasibêle babele batwela na bakatweli.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Kyaba Yesû kyaimine kûko kû nsese gya gûlya Mufalisayo no Balangi babisila babambile kumusûmbêlêla bikole no kûmubûsha mianda gingê, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />kûba bamone kumukwata kwa mianda gyage.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Malêngê kibalo kya kasomenkania kalwêsha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayo 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mt 16.6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Malk 8.15</ref></char>
    </note>Kyaba kyonka kilya, bantû maelufu lwa babele babûngakana, no ababele banyantana, Yesû ûbambile kûbanga bêlê no baana babûganga bage no kwêbalombola: “Mbelê gya byonse mwiempe no kidjusho kya Bafalisayo kwana ba kasongakania kalwêsha. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Malk 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lk 8.17</ref></char></note>Hakûlê kyokyonse kiutilwe kikabûla kûhûtûlwa hûtû, no hakûle kyokyonse kibisikilwe kikabûla kûsogololwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kwanansho, byonse byamwisambile mu kidjo, bantû bekebitegelela mu mugenge, byonse bya munenghene mumatwê mwalê mu nsese bilêmba bibigale bikasaûlwa egûlû lya kigûlû.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muyenene kûtûdjûkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayo 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Na nimilombola benywe balûnda, namu kebatudjuki balya bakwêyaga mubêlê yaa, mone habanyonghoni kûlonga kintû kinge mbeela. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nshanimilombole gûlya muyenene kumutûdjûka; mumutûdjûke gûlya nghimba gya kwêyaga mubêle, wêno bûkome bwa kumuta muntû mukaya kakalûnga nyembo. Mumutûdjûke gûdjo!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Kimanyinkane lûsêgê lûtano lwakûlwa lûmea lûbêlê? Mone kûgêbwa kwa Kabesha Mpûngû alwêbêlêlwa lûsêgê no lwêne lûmo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ûbyo, nogine nywene gyatwe lyenyu gibalwe gyonse. Nansho na mukatudjuki; kibalo benywe mwibanyemekwe kûlêmba lûsêgê lûngê!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumwisasa no kumubenga Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayo 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Namilombola kwana, gegense wêkangitabêsha kûgêbwa kwa bantû, mwana wa Muntû noge wêkamwitabêsha kûgêbwa kwa masalagûlû ga Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Mone gee wêkamenga kûgêbwa kwa bantû, no mwana wa Muntû wa kamubenga kûgêbwa kwa masalagûlû ga Kabesha Mpûngû.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mt 12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Malk 3.29</ref></char>
    </note> “Noge wakwêsamba mwanda gwakumuakania mwana wa Muntû wêkalekelelwa, mone gûlya wakûbedja Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke hakalekelelwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Mt 10.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Malk 13.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14-15">Lk 21.14-15</ref></char>
    </note>“Kyaba kyabalê kemiila benywe kûgêbwa kwa nsese gya milombolo gya Bayuda nokû bakûlû no babêkali, namukabi no kahaga kibalo kya kûbanga bilya byamulê kesamba, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kibalo Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke gwêkemilanga onkao kilya kya mulê bayenene kwêsamba.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">1 Lûkendê lwa mpeta mubidje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Muntû gûmo mubûngê bwa balya bantû umulombwele Yesû: “Mulangi, mulombole mwanetû atange bûyana bwêtûsigêle Tata.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Mone Yesû umûêndwêle: “Mpyana, nani umbikile nene kûba mukali wa nsambû no mutangani abûkata bwenyu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Nfulo wêbalombwele: “Mwiempe no muswelo gwa bwêma bwa mutêma; kibalo ngikeno gya muntû hagikûdjagili bûngê bwa bintû byalê nabyo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Kûwa Yesû wêbalombwele lûkêndê lûlû: “Kûbele mpeta gûmo kwana bala lyage libele no bimbûlwa bingê. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Mpeta gûdjo uningile mu mutêma gwage: Nshanonge ntêê. Nonene nsilê antû akûbêka bimbûlwa byane. <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Gûdjo mpeta wêsambile shanonge nansino: ‘Nsansambûle tûombo twane no kuimpa lûkaombo mukata mbeela, none nikabêka mumo bimbûlwa byane byonse no lûheto lwane. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Kûwa nikesamba nansino kibalo kya nene mwine: Wêno lûheto lûngê lobikile mu bûkûsa bobe, gikana wêtûshe, ûlye wêkûbêle no kûlogelelwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Mone Kabesha Mpûngû umulombwele: ‘Mubidje gwee! Lêno busigi mutêma gobe sagûlombwe no bintû bilya byonse byolibêkêle bûkûsa; sabibe byani?’”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />“Ûbyo bibele kwê muntû mpeta wêbêkêle lûheto kibalo kyage mwine mone ha mpeta gibalwe kûgêbwa kwa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumukûdjagêla Kabesha Mpûngû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Kûwa Yesû wêbalombwele bana babûganga bage: Kwanansho nanimilombola, namukadjembi ngikeno gyenyu kwana samulye kêê, no mudjembelele mibelê gyenyu kwana samushale kêe. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kibalo bûkome bûsoga kûlêmba byakûlya, no mubêlê gûsoga kûlêmba bishalanwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mutwale lûkêndê lwa kibombo bombo; hakyakukuna, hakyakwêmbûla no binghe tûombo noene akûbêkêla bimbûlwa; Mone Kabesha Mpûngû wakwêbilêsha! Benywe mwibakitûngo kikata kûlêmbêla toni. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nani abûkata bwenyu kwana kwakwêdjembia kwage wêbûnyonghona kwibilêsha no kine kyaba kimo mu ngikeno gyage? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Nfulo ntêê hamunyonghoni kûlonga kilongwa kisho nagwe kikyo biiko, kwakê kûba no kahaga kibalo kyakê kûdjembelela bilya binge? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Mub 10.4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Miab 9.3-6</ref></char></note>Mulole bûlûba byabûlê mukûsanuna; habwakûlonga mingêlo no habwakûotola. Mone nanimilombola, no mwine Solomono mu bûkolo bwage hamushale bisoga nagwe gûmo wagaga malûba. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Nansho ntê Kabesha Mpûngû wakûshêka maani ga mwibala, kwana lêno ûkwagalê no djoo gatebwa mukaya, nantê wakemishêka no benywe bisoga? Benywe bantû balwêtabêsho lûke!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“No namukadjembi mu mitêma gyenyu kwana samulye kêê no samwikûbêle kêê; namukabi no mpewa mpewa kibalo kya bibyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kibalo bibyo byonse bya kûdjembelelwa no bantû basibamumanye Kabesha Mpûngû. Shenyu mumanye kwana mwakûkeba bintû bibyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Nfulo mukebe bêlê Bûkolo bwa kabesha Mpûngû no bibi byonse wêkemitanga.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûeta bwa Mwigûlû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Namukatudjuki kinywe kibûngo kisho, kibalo Shenyu wamona bisoga kwimia benywe bûkolo. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Muushe bintû byonse byamulê nabyo mukebae balanda. Mwilongele mitûngû gisikatuni, mukebêkêle bûkûsa mwigûlû, kwana abusimini kûko, antû ngibi hagisheni ao muswa hagoni. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kibalo alya ebûkûsa bobe ûekaba mutêma gobe.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bengili bemeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mt 25.1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mube djambûla mwikwêke kikadja mulûbûnda, no kimuni kyenyu kibe kyakûnka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Malk 13.34-36</ref></char></note>nagwe bengili bakumuempela Kolo lyabo ebwêlêle kuima kukikwe kya bûlûgo, kûba kyaba kyelê kaika no kûkûkûla mushango lwendo lûmo bamubêgwêle. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Kikaba kya lyese kûbalya bengili kwana Kolo wabo enekasha wêkebatana bemeso saka. Sitê sitê nanimilombola, wêkekwêka kikadja kyage mulûbûnda, nokwêbekêka kûba balye, noge asaashe no kwêbengêlêla. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Kikaba kya lyese kûbengili babo, kyokûba mulûme wabo enekasha wêkebatana bemeso, nontê wêkasha mu mbêlêlê gyabusigi ao kûkûkendûlûka kwa busigi. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mt 24.43-44</ref></char></note>Mone musingûlûle mwanda gûno: “Ntê mwine nsese walêmumanye kyaba ngibi kyelê kasha, haswele kusiga nsese gyage kubungulwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Benywe byonka nansho mwibayenene mube djambûla, kibalo Mwana wa Muntû wakasha kyaba kilya kyamusi bamanye.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwingili mulûmbûlûke no usi mulûmbûlûke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayo 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Huao Petelo umubulishe Yesû: “Kolo, lûkêndê lûno lonotûlombola betwe yaa, no kibalo kya bantû bonse?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Kolo wêndwêle: “Nani wêko mwimeni mulûmbûlûke no wêno lweni, kwana Kolo lyage wakamubêke egûlû lya bengeli bage boonse, kûba ebae byakûlya kyaba kigwane. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kikaba kya lyese kwa mwingili gûlya, kwana Kolo lyage enekebwêla wêkamusangana wakûlonga nansho. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Sitê sitê nanimilombola, wêkamubêka mwingili gûdjo kûba mwimeni wa bûheta bwage bonse. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Mone ntê gûlya mwingili saesambe mumutêma gwage: ‘Kolo lyane wagisha biiko enekwêbwêlêla,’ kûwa ûbambile kwêbaûla bengili nage baana balûme no banabakasi no kûlya, kwêkûbêla no kûkolwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Nfulo, kolo wa mwingili gûdjo wêkasha sigi lyasikaningili no kyaba kya sikamanyi. Wêkamuûla; no kumukoma mwingili gûdjo bibê. no kumubêka kifulu kimo amo no basi betabêshe.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Gûlya mwigili musingûlûle bisoga bikampwe kolo wage, no henekwêbêka djambûla no henekûlonga bikampwe kolo wage, shaaûlwe kwa nswii biiko. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Mone gegense usidjê, nogee kulonga bilya biyenene kûûlwa, wakaûlwa bisho. Gegense ûelwe bingê wêkakendwa bingê, no gegense ûelwe bingê biiko wêkakendwa bingê biiko.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantû basalênkana kibalo kya Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Nansha kûkwamia kaya mukandje, nankampwa kaswakûba djambûla kawa kûkwamibwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 10:38">Malk 10.38</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ninalo lûbatisho kwana lûyenene mbatisibwe, no ninomasûsû gakata kuikêla lûbatisho lûlû lûgwaninine. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mwaninga kwana nansisha angalê mukandje? No heneasho, ulisi angalê, nambo kûsalênkana. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kûbambêla onkano, kwêkaba muuso gwa bantû batano, basatû ku babêlê no babêlê nghimba gya basatû. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7.6</ref></char></note>Bekalankana, Tata wêkaba nghimba gya mwana mulûme no mwana mulûme nghimba gya shage, madjû nghimba gya musongwa kasi wage; musongwa kasi nghimba gya nyage wage, madjû bûko nghimba gya mukasi wa mwanage no gûdjo nghimba gya madjû bûko wage.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusingûlûla byaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayo 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesû wikilombwele byonka kibûngo kya bantû: “Amulê mukûmona kile kyakuimina mugela gwa mugya djûba lwêndo lûmo mwalisamba: “Mbila gisaginoke no sitê gya noka.” <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Amwakûmona munyaga gwa kahênda kalûngû kûlûme gwa kumpa mwalisamba, kûsakûbe kyûdja no ûbyo byabilê kaba. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Benywe beno nfika! Mwidjê kûsahûla hantû elweo kwa kûlola hantû ansê no egûlû, kibalo kyakê hamunyonghoni kûmanya kibalo kyakûsintûlûla kyaba kino?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wana no mangi giobe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayo 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Mwanda gwakê hamunyonghoni kwêsolwela benywe bene mwanda gûsoga gwa kûlonga? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Kyaba kyamulê mukûgya kûbangabanga no wakûsongela mubembeleshe mutegelesanie mukimundjela. Ntê anansho shakwile kwi nsusi, no nsusi shakwile kwêmusilêkale, no musilêkale shakûbêke mukikûtû. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nankûlombola: Haûkaimi mumo ntê onolimie no lwêne lûmea lwa nfulo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Mwalabûke kuima mubûbê bwenyu ao samukye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Kyaba kyonka kikyo, kûbele bantû bamo bamulombwele Yesû musahû gwa bantû ba Galilaya kwana Pilato wê beyagile, no masi ga bantû wêgasangêlêle no mulambû gwabo gwababele baimia. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Noge Yesû wêbahendwêle: “Mwaninga kwana ba Galilaya babo bakile luki lwamuswelo gûgo, babele no bûbê kûlêmba ba Galilaya boonse? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Namilombola sitê, ubisibyo! Mone no benywe ntê amwibesase, musha mutobele nagwe nibo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />No balya kumi no muganda, bagwêlêlwe no kilêngo kûko Siloamu, mwaninga kwana babele babê kûlêmba bantû bonse bekene mu Yelusalema? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nanimilombola, ubisibyo! Mone ntê amwakûkeba kwalabûka kûima mubûbê benywe bonse, shamutobele nagwe nibo bonse.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa mutê gusi gûwe bihelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kûwa Yesû wêbalombwele lûkêndê lûlû: “Muntû gûmo ûbele no mutê gwakikûdjû gûbele gukunwe mwibala lyamisabibu. Muntû gûdjo ûgêle akebe kûsobola bihelo byage mone hamwene kintû. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Kûwa umulombwele mwingili wabala wabala gyage lya misabibu: ‘Lola, mukyaba kya miaka gisatû namba nasha kûsobola bihelo bya mutê gûgû gwa kikûdju, nsimumone kyokyonse. Wêgûkale! Mwanda gwakê sagûgêlêlêle kona nsê sile?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Mone gee mwingili wabala umuwêndwêle: ‘Kolo, wêgûleke byonka gûno mwaka, sanigûseleshe musenga no kwêgûbêkêla kikûngya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ntê gokûwa bihelo mwaka gwakûsha, kiyenene! Mone ntê anasho, ûolê kegûkala.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandia mwana mukasi wa katumba sigi lya kwêtûsha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Sisi limo lya kwêtûsha, Yesû ûbele walanga mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />No hao abele mwanamukasi gûmo ûbele mutongi wa miaka kumi no muganda; hûkêlwe no munyaga gûbe gwa katumba, noge habele wanyonghona koloka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesû lwamumwene, umwitile umulombwele: “Mwana mukasi, ûbe angalê wahandibwa mutongo gobe!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kûwa Yesû umutentekile maboko gage, lûkwe lûmo holokile nsûnga no kûbamba kumutûmbêsha Kabesha Mpûngû.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Kuim 20.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Ngib 5.13-14</ref></char>
    </note>Mone mukûlû wa nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda usumininwe kibalo Yesû wandishe gûdjo mwana mukasi sigi lya kwêtûsha. Gûlya mukûlû wansese gya milombelo gya Bayuda ûlombwele kilya kibûngo kya bantû: “Kwêmasigi mutanda gayenene bantû kûlonga mingêlo. Mumasigi gago mushe mwahandibwe lilyo, mone ha sigi lya kwêtûsha!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Mone Kolo umwêndwêle: “Benywe beno nfika! Nani mubûkata bwenyu usisokoni nghombe gyage ao pûnda gyage kuima mukianfu egiile kwêkûbêla madjê musigi lya kwêtûsha? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Onka mwana mukasi walûbyalo lwa Bûlaimu, kwana ubikilwe bûlema no lyabola miaka kumi no muganda; hakiswele kûba kisoga kumuhandya sigi lya kwêtûsha?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yesû lwabidjile kwêsamba nansho, baakanani nage bamwene nsoni mone bantû bange bonse bamwene mulogo kibalo kya mianda gyonse gyalongile.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa ndjee gya Kilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesû ubulishe: “Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwêgûlane no kêê? Sanibwêgûshe nokêê? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Bwênagwe nindjee gya kilanga. Gitwalile muntû gûmo wigikunine mulûbanda lwege gimenine no kûkûla kûba mutê gûkata, no toni twa egûlû tuimpile binswa kûmatabe gage.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkûnde lwa kidjûsho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayo 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesû ubulishe byonka: “Ni bwêgûshe Bûkolo bwa Mwigûlû nokêê? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ninagwe kidjûsho kitwalile mwana mukasi gûmo no kutubula mubûnga bwêngê bitala bisatu kûwa bûnga bonse bûtantile.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mushango gûkeane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayo 7.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">7.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Kûwa Yesû ûgêlêlêle kûeta mu bibûndê no tubibûndê mukulanga kyaba kyagêle Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Muntû gûmo umubulishe: “Mulangi bantû banshompe bekahandibwa?” <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle, “Mwikankamike kûtwela kwa kwêtêla mushango gûke; kibalo nanimilombola bangê bekatompa kûtwela mone habakanyonghoni kûtwela. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Kyaba kyakûsha, kwana mwine nsese wakemana no kubigala kilêmba; benywe mwakemana andje no kûbamba kûkokola mushango no kwana: ‘Kolo tubigwêle mushango!’ Mone gee wakebaêndûla: ‘Nsimidjê benywe, byonka sindje kwamwaimina!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Kûwa mwikabamba kumulombola: ‘Betwe ûbalya balêle no kwêkûbêla amo nobe; no gwee ûlangile mubibûndê byetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Nghib 6.8</ref></char></note>Mone gee wakesamba: ‘Nsimidjê benywe byonka nsindje kwamwaimina. Musemuke kûgêbwa gyane, benywe bonse bangêla bibê!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mt 22.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25.30</ref></char></note>Hao kwakaba kûlêla no kwêsenkemia meno kyaba kyamulê kamumona Bûlaimu, Isaka, no Yakobo, no bamoni bonse mu Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû, mone benywe bene mwatebwa andje! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bantû bekasha kuima kumusha djûba no kumugya djûba no kuima kaênda kalûngû kûkasi no kûlûme, nobo bekekana hantû ababêkwêlwe djambûla kukikwe kya Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mt 19.30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Malk 10.31</ref></char></note>Lola, balya babele banfulo bekaba batangi, no balya batangi bekaba ba nfulo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûkampwe bwa Yesû kû Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayo 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Kyaba kyonka kikyo bafalisayo no bantû bange bamuikêle Yesû bamulombwele: “Ima ano ûgye hantû ange, kibalo Helode wakeba kûkwêyaga.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Mugye mumulombole gûdjo mubwabwa nansino, ‘Lêno no djo nshankûmbe minyaga no kûandia batongi, no sigi lya bûsatû nika gwanininia mugêlo gwane.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Nonansho, kwa lêno no djo lyage, kiyenene ngêlêlêle no lwendo lwane kibalo hakiyenene mumoni eyagwe andje gya Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yelusalema, Yelusalema! Wakwêbeyaga bamoni no kwêbasa mabwe balya batuminwe kolê. Nkoo giinga nkebile kwêbabûngakania baana bobe amo nogwe ninkoko byele kûbûngakania mausi gege munse gya byûbê byage, mone ûkampilwe! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Nghib 118.26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Yelem 22.5</ref></char></note>Lola nsese gyobe gyasigwa nghee kintû. Nankûlombola haûmoni byonka kuikêla kyaba kyolê kesamba: ‘Esêlwe malyese gûdjo wakûsha musina lya Kolo.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandia muntû mudjûlwe mubêlê</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Sigi limo lya kwêtûsha, Yesû ûgêle kûlya kyakûlya mu nsese gya mukûlû gûmo wa Bafalisayo no bantû babele hao babele bamulwelekekya. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Kûgêbwa kwage Yesû kûbele no muntû gûmo ûbele mutongi wa kûdjûlwa mubêlê. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesû wêbabulishe Bafalisayo no Balangi babisila: “Kibûba kiyenene hao hakiyenene kûandia muntû sigi lya kwêtûsha?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Mone boo bekene talala. Huao Yesû umukwatile gûdjo mutongi, ûmwandishe, umulekele agye lwege. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mt 12.11</ref></char></note>Kûwa wêbabulishe: “Nani mubukata bwenyu, ntêê mwana wamwana mulûme no nghombe gyage gyokûgwêlêle mubwêna bwa madjê sigi lyakwêtûsha, hanyonghoni kwigiimia lwêndo lûmo?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Nobo habanyonghwene kumuêndûla bûsho lilyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûkokele no bûkunkani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesû lwamwene balya betilwe lwababele balisolwela hantû abûnyeme, wêbalombwele lûkêndê lûlû: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6-7">Nkd 25.6-7</ref></char></note>“Ntê muntû gee kûkwêta kûbûlûgo, no kekani hantû anyeme, kwêbûba wagitwa weno bûnyeme kûkûlêmba gwee. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ntê benywe kûlonga nansho, gûlya wimitile benywe babêlê shahashe nokûkûlombola: ‘Mutange gûdjû muntû kikanwa kyobe.’ Hao shaûmone nsoni kûgêbwa gyabonse no kwimibwa kûgya kwêkana kunfulo gyabonse. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Mone kyaba kyonogitwa kukikwe, gikana hantû asianyeme, kûba mwine enekasha no kukumona, wêkakûtwala no kukûlombole: ‘Mulûnda, gyata hantû anyeme.’ Kwanansho wêkaebwa bunyeme kûgêbwa kwa betilwe benobe bonse. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Lk 18.14</ref></char></note> Kibalo gegense wakwêsesha sha tukibwe no wakwêtûkya shasesibwe.” <verse eid="LUK 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Kûwa Yesû umulombwele gûlya wagitile: “Kyaba kyonokûlonga kikwe kya kûlya kya djûba no kya lêngolo, nokebeti balûnda nobe hûao bambyalwa nobe, no bakuminkani nobe bampeta. Onolonga nansho, nobo bebûnyonghona kûkwêta kwabo, nogwe shaûbe waebwa bilya byolongile, no kûtambûla kya bûntû kyobe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Mone kyaba kyolê mukûlonga kikwe, wêbete balanda, bilema, bisheti, bampoki, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />nogwe sowêselwe malyese, kibalo baba habanyonghoni kûkûlêpa. Kabesha Mpûngû wêkakûlêpa kyaba bantû basitê abalê kashûka.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkênde lwa kikwe kikata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayo 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Gûmo wabalya babele bekane amo amutalako no Yesû, lwetegelele nansho umulombwele Yesû: “Wêno lyese muntû gûlya wêkalya kyakûlya mu Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesû umuêndwêle: “Muntu gûmo ûlongile kikwe kikata, wetile bantû bangê. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Kyaba kya kikwe akigwanine utumine mwingili wage ebalombole balya betilwe: ‘Tûndû bageni bintû byonse bidjambûla!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Mone bonse, gûmo nghimba gya gûnge, besambile kûlomba lûsa. Mutangi umulombwele mwingili: ‘Nangûla bala, kûêkêla gyate nililole. Nonansho nimuyenene mbagale kwililola; nankûlomba nkyêle lûsa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Gûnge wêsambile: ‘Ngulile mahasa gatano ga nghombe gilûme gya kûlêma nagya nigi tompe kûlêma nankûlomba nkyêle lûsa’. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />No gûnge wêsambile: ‘Nankwela mukasi kwanansho, nsinyoghoni kûsha.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Kûwa mwingili gûdjo wêbwêlêle kumulombola Kolo wage mwanda gûgo. Gûlya mwine nsese usumininwe, umulagêlêle mwingili wage wêsambile: ‘Gyata bûkêlê mundjêla no kûnkondo gya kibûndê, wêbasishe muno munda balanda, bisheti, bampoki no bilema no wêbatweshe muno.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Gûlya mwingili umulombwele: ‘Kolo, bilya byondagile nanibilonga mone akwêkana ûakuki.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />“Huao gûlya Kolo umulombwele mwingili wage: ‘Gyata mundjêla ku bibûnde no kûnkondo gya mabala, wêbakonkeleshe bantû batwele, kûba nsese gyane gidjûle. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kibalo nanimilombola hakûlê no mwine gûmo mubalya betilwe wêkatompa kyakûlya kyane.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitûngo kya kûba mwana wabûganga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayo 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Hao bibûngo bingê bibele byatamba amo no Yesû, noge wêbalabûkêle bantû no kwêbalombolo: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mt 10.37</ref></char></note> “Muntû gegense gekûsha kwane gee akûsikwa tata no madjû, mukasi no baana, mulûnda no nkasibyala gyage; ûbyo, nogiine ngikeno gyage mwine, muntû gûno hanyoghoni kûba mwana wabûganga wane. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16.24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Malk 8.34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lk 9.23</ref></char></note>Muntû usimutwale mutê gwa mpênga mpêtya gwage no kûnonda, hanyoghoni kûba mwana wa bûganga wane. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Kibalo nani mubûkata bwenyu kwana gekûkeba kuimpa nsese gila saekane bêlê kûbala bwênge bwa lûheto lwege kûba amanye ntê wêno lûheto lûgwanine kubidja! <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ola ubisibyo! Kibalo gee kuimpa mubambo, no nghimba gee kwandwa kubidja nsese gigyo, bantû bonse bakûmona byalê mukûlonga bekamuseka, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Banine: ‘Muntû gûdju ûbambile kuimpa! Mone abele no bûkome bwakubidja.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Hao Kwêmubêkali kêê, wêkagya kûlwa lûgosi no Mubêkali gûnge, ekane bêlê no kuninga ntê swanyonghone, kûba wêno kibûngo kya basilêkale bage elufu kumi, shanyoghone kûlwa no gûlya wakûsha wêno kibûngo kya basilêkale elufu makumi gabêlê? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ntêê wamona hanyoghoni, shaebatume babikûla kûkeba kusisha angalê kyaba Mubêkali gûdjo gûnge ukikûla. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Byonka nansho: “Hakûlê no mwine gûmo wenyu wêkaba mwana wa bûganga wane ntê amuleke bintû byonse byalê nabyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukele gusi no ntobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayo 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Mukele gûsoga, mone ntê go kusiminia ntobo gyage, samubekwe kêê gûmone ntobo? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Hagûyenene byonka kintû no kwa musenga ao kwa kikûngya, mone bantû bakwêgûta andje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">“Wêno matwêê, gakûtegelela no ategelele!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa mukoko gusimine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Lk 5.29-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Sigi limo basonkya misonko no beno bûbê baangê babûngakene kumutegelela Yesû. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mone Bafalisayo no Balangi babisila, babambile kûtompola no kwêsamba: “Mulole muntû gûdjû! Walibakûnka beno bûbê, no byonka wakûlya nabo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Huao Yesû wêbalombwele lûkêndê lûlû: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Kokûba gûmo wenyu wêno mikoko lûkama, no gee kusiminia gûmo wabo, saûlonge ntê? Saegisige gilya makumi abûla no abûla mu kyanya, no kûgya kwêgûkeba gûlya gusimine kuikêla egûmone. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Kyaba kyalê kegûmona, saegûtwale amakombe kwamulogo <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />No kûgya kû nsese. Nfulo wêkebeta balûnda nage no bakuminkani nage amo no kwêbalombola, ‘Mulogelelwe amo nane, kibalo nanigûmona gûlya mukoko gwane gusimine.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Namilombola kwana, byonka nansho kwêkaba no ndoge mwigûlû kibalo kya wêno bûbe gûmo kumulêlêla, kûlêmbela beno sitêê makumi abûla no abûla bashakûkeba kumulêlêla.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa lûheto lwa kitû lusimine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Byonka nansho, mwanamukasi kêê wêno lûmea kumi lwa kitûngo, gee kusimininwa lûmo, ashalonge ntêê? Wêkakwamia kimuni, wêkayangêla nsese, no kwêlûkeba kwa mukanka kuikêla elûmone? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />No kyaba kyalê kelûmona, wêkebeta balûnda no bakuminkani nage, no kwêsamba: ‘Mulogelelwe amo no nene kibalo nanilûmona lûlya lûmea lwane lwakitûngo lusimine.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Byonka nansho namilombola, ûbyo byakalogelelwa masalagûlû ga Kabesha Mpûngû kibalo kya wêno bûbê gûmo gee kumulêlêla.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa mwana wa mwana mulûme musimine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesû ûgêlêlêle kwêsamba, “Kûbele muntû gûmo ûbele no baana babêlê babana balûme. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Gûlya munina umulombwele shage: ‘Tata, ntange bûyana bwane.’ Noge wêbatangile lûheto lwakitûngo lwege. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Nghimba gya masigi gasho, gûlya ûkuminkenye bintû byonse byabele nabyo, ûgêle nsêê gya kûla kûko wêngêle lûheto lwege mu nginkeno gibe. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Lwabidjile kwêla bintû byonse. Kuimine ndjala gikole mumwalo gûlya, noge ûbambile kûdjemba. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Kwanansho ugêle kûlomba mugêlo kwimwine mwalo gûmo, wakûko noge umwilile kwêbala lyage kûlêsha ngûlûbe. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ûkampilwe kûlya byakûlya bibele byalya ngûlûbe, mone hakûbele muntû umuele kintû kyokyonse. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Habambile kwisingûlûla, uningile: ‘Mwanda gwakê Tata wane wêno bengili baangê bakûlya biiko, mone nene ano nankûkya no ndjala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Sansemuke no kwêbwêlêla kwê Tata, no kumulombola: ‘Tata, nanonga bûbe kûgêbwa gya gûlû no gwee swaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Nsimuyenene byonka kwêtwa mwanobe; mbêke kûba nagwe gûmo wabengili bobe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Nfulo, ûsemukile wêbwêlêle kwê shage.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Lwabele ukikûla shage umumwene; kwa mutêma gwa lûsa, umunkukile kwa kumuhûkêla, no kumutomona. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwana wa mwana mulûme umulombwele: ‘Tata,’ nanongela gûlû bûbê, nogwe swaa. ‘Nsimuyenene kwêtwa mwanobe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Mone shage wêbalombwele bengili bage: ‘Bûkêle!’ Musishe kishandê kisoga mumushêke. ‘Mumushêke lûpete kumunie gwage no bikwabêlo kûmagûlû! <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Musishe kyana kya nghombe ginone no mukisêndje, no tûlogelelwe amo. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kibalo gûdjû mwanene wa mwana mulûme, ûbele mukye, noano gee mugima; ûbele musimine, noanogee wamoneka.’ Babambile kûlonga kikwe.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Kyaba kikyo, gûlya mukûlû ûbele kwêbala. Kyaba kyakwêbwêlêla kwage, lwashabele kûbwehê no nsese, ûtegelele ndjwê lya nghimbo no nghoma gya bantû mukûkenda. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Umwitile gûmo wabengili ubulishe, ‘Kwikintû kêê?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Gûdjo mwingili umuêndwêle: ‘Muninobe wagibwêla kû nsese no shobe wamusêndja mwana wa nghombe ginone, kwa kûba wagibwêlêla kû nsese mugima wêpo.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Gûlya mwana mukûlû usumininwe biiko, ûbengile kûtwela mu nsese; nfulo, shage wemine andje no kumwisasa atwele mu nsese. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Mone gee umuêdwêle shage: ‘Lola, miaka gyonse gyana nkwêlêla, no line sigi limo shalisilûle kisila kyobe, wimumpe kêê? Nomwine mwana wa mbusi gûmo honolimpe nonge kikwe amo no balûnda nane! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Mone mwanobe gûdjû ûlele lûheto lobe amo no babûseki, kûsha kwage wamusêndjêla gûlya mwana nghombe munone!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />“Shage umuêndwêle: ‘Mwanane, gwee wêamo nane masigi gonse, no kyonse kyandê nakyo kyobe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Kitûyenene, kûlonga kikwe no kûlogelelwa, kibalo muninobe ûbele mukye, nansi mugima; ûbele musimine, noge wamoneka.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">1 Lûkêndê lwa mwimeni gûmo mulimuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesû wêbalombwele baana babûganga bage: “Mpeta gûmo ûbele no mwimeni wage, gûdjo mwimeni ûsongelwe kwana wêngêlêshe bibê bûeta bwa mpeta wage. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Kwanansho gûlya mpeta umwitile no kumulombola: ‘Mianda kêê gyana ntegelela kibalo kyobe? Imia lûbalê lwa bwêmeni bobe, kibalo haûnyonghoni kûba mwimeni wane byonka.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Gûlya mwimeni uningile mumutêma gwage, ‘mpeta wankûmba kumingêlo gya bwêmeni, shanonge ntêê byonka? Nsilê bumu bwakûlêma, no ninonsoni gya kûlomba lomba. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Namanya byandê kalonga, kibalo anankakûmbwa mingêlo ano, nikaba no balûnda be kankûka kûmasese gabo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Nfulo, witile gegense ûbele no lêni lya mpeta wage. umubulishe mutangi: ‘Wêno leni linga kwê mpeta wane?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Umwêndwêle: ‘Biûmbû mia gibêlê bya makita ga Mpasi,’ gûlya mwimeni umlombwele; ‘gikana ansê, usinte biûbû lûkama ulisalibe leni lyobe.’<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Kûwa umubulishe gûnge: ‘Nogwee wêno leni lyalinga?’ Noge umuêndwêle: ‘Lûkama lwa ngano,’ gûlya mwimeni umulombwele; gikana ansê sinta, ‘Milêmba makumi muganda.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Nfulo gûlya mpeta umutumbikile gûdjo mwimeni usi no sitêê kwa kûba wêngêle lweni; kibalo bantû bakandje kano beno lweni biiko no mianda gyabo kûlêmba bantû ba mugenge.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Noge Yesû ûgêlêlêle kwêsamba: “Nanimilombola mwingêle lûheto lwakandje kano kwakwêlongela balûnda bobe gwe mwine, kûba kyaba lûheto alûlê kakûbidjêka, ûkakûnkwe mugikeno gya miaka. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Gegense mulûmbûlûke mu mianda gisho, wêkaba mulûmbûlûke mu mianda gikata, no gegense usi mulûmbûlûke mu mianda gisho, hakabi mulûmbûlûke mu mianda gikata. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Kyokûba ntê benywe, hamwibalûmbûlûke kibalo kya kûempa lûheto lwa kadje kano, nani wekemikûdjagela kwa kûempa lûheto lwa sitê? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />No benywe ntê hamwibalûmbûlûke kibalo kya lûheto lwa muntû gûûnge, nani wêkemiabêla lûheto lwenyu benywe bene?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mt 6.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Hakûlê mwingili webunyonghona kwengêla ba mpeta babêlê; kibalo shaamusikwe gûmo no kûkampwa gûûnge ao shaakwatane no gûmo no kumubedja gûnge. Hamunyonghoni kwêngêlêla Kabesha Mpûngû no lûheto amo.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Milango hala hala gya Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayo 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mone Bafalisayo, lwabategelele gigyo kibalo babele bakampwe lûheto biiko, bamubedjile Yesû. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Benywe mwakwêmonia kûba balûmbûlûke kûgêbwa gya bantû, mone Kabesha Mpûngû wêdjê mitêma gyenyu. Kibalo kilya kyakûmoneka kûba ntûmbo kûgêbwa gya bantû, kwa Kabesha Mpûngû byakûkolesha.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mt 11.12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Bisila bya Musa no lûnsinto lwa bamoni lûsawêlwe kibalo kya kûsha kwa Yoano Mubatisha. Kûbambêle kyaba kilya, musahu gûsoga gwa Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû gûsawêlwe, no muntû gense wakwêtwesha kwa bumu kûtwela. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mt 5.18</ref></char></note> Mone biele mbeela, gûlû no kandje kûêta, kûlêmba helufi limo lya bisila bya Musa kusimwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mt 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Bakl 7.10-11</ref></char></note> “Muntû gegense walekela mukashage no kûkwela gûnge walonga bûseki; no mwana mulûme wakûkwela mwana mukasi ukumbilwe walonga bûseki byonka nansilya.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa mpeta no Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Kûbele muntû gûmo mpeta, ûbele mwidjêbêle kûshala bishandê bibele bisoga no bya kitûngo kikata biiko, no wêkene mumulogo masigi gonse. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Amushango gwa gûdjo mpeta, abele no nanda gûmo sina lwege Lasalo, kwana ûbele no biene biingê, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lasalo ûkampilwe kûebwa bisigela bigwilile kuima amutalako gwa gûdjo mpeta. No nghimba gya ao mbwa gibele gyasha gyalamba biene byage.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Kyaba akiikile gûlya nanda ukile no Masalagûlû gamubûgwêle gamubikile mukyalê kya Bûlaimu. Gûlya mpeta noge ukile ushikilwe, <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Gûlya mpeta, ûbele no mudjembo gûkata kûko kûkalûnga nyembo ûtûlwêle meso gage. Ûmumwene Bûlaimu kûla no Lasalo ûbele kûbwêhê nage. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Nansho gûlya mpeta umwitile Bûlaimu kwa djwê: ‘Tata Bûlaimu, nkyêle lûsa, no mutume Lasalo akunye lwala lwa munie gwage mu madjê, aoshe lulimi lwane kibalo nansûsûka biiko mukaya kano!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Mone Bûlaimu umwindwêle: ‘Mwanane gidjûkana kwana ûtambwêle bisoga byobe mungikeno, noge Lasalo ûtambwêle bibê, mone ano gee waempûlwa, nogwe wêmumudjembo gûkata. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Nghimba gya ao, abûkata bwetû no benywe kûbêkwe bwêna bûkata, kibalo bakûkeba kûsha kwamulê kuima kûno habakûnyonghona no bakûkeba kuima kwamulê kûsha kwatûlê habakûnyonghona.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Gûdjo ûbele mpeta wêndwêle: ‘Nfulo, Tata Bûlaimu nankûlomba mutume Lasalo abagale kû nsese gya tata wane, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kwakûba nino baana nane ba baana balûme batano. Agye ebalêngele kibalo nabakasi nobo kuika hantu ano amudjembo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Mone Bûlaimu umulombwele: ‘Baana nobe beno lusinto lwa Musa no bamoni, wêbaleke bebategelele boo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Gûlya mpeta wêsambile: ‘Hakiyenene tata Bûlaimu, mone muntû kûshûka kuima kûbaki, no kwêbaikêla bekesasa.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Mone Bûlaimu wêbalombwele: ‘Ntêê abebategelele ba Musa no bamoni, habanyonghoni kûbembwa nomwine muntû wa shûka kuima kûbaki.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Milango kibalo kya bûbê no lûlekelelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayo 18.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">18.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maluko 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesû wêbalombwele baana babûganga bage: “Kiyenene mianda gya kumutakêsha muntû kûlonga bûbê buimine, mone musibo gwage muntû gûlya wakwibisisha! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Kya swakûba kiyenene kwê muntû gûdjo kûkwêkwa bwee likata munkingo lya kûelela no kûtebwa mwisiba kûbûla kumukukasha gûmo wabaanike bano kûlonga bûbê. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mt 18.15</ref></char></note> Kwanasho mwilame!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Ntêê mulûnda obe, ge kûkûlongela ubisibyo mulêngêle, no ntê gee kumulêlêla, mulekelele. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />No ntêê gee kûkûlongela bûbê nghendo kiloba musigi limo, no nghendo kiloba gee kwêbwêlêla kolê no kûnenghena: ‘Nanisasa,’ Kiyenene umulekelele.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Milango kibalo kya lwêtabêsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Bikûla bimulombwele Kolo: “Witubilêshe lwêtabêsho.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Noge Kolo wêndwêle: “Lwêtabêsho lwenyu lwalê lûke nagwe ni ndjee gisho gya kilanga, mwaswa kwêgûlombola mutê gûgû gûkata gwa kikûdjû: ‘Tukuka, ûkekune mwisiba!’ Nogo gwaswa kwimikokela.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngikeno gya bwingili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Twêsambe kwa lûkêndê, gûmo wenyu wêno mwingili kwana wakûlêma ao wakûempa mikoko, Ntêê wagibwêlêla kuima kwêbala shamulombole gûdjo mwingili, bûkêlê ndjûû ûlye kya kûlya? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ûwe! Hamulomboli mbêkêle djambûla kyakûlya: ‘Wêkwêke djambûla kungilêla, Kuikêla anankabidja kûlya no kwêkûbêla; ûao nogwe ûlye no kwêkûbêla?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ntêê wakamufwisha gûdjo mwingili, kibalo wagwania byelagêlêlwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Byonka nansho no benywe kûwa kûlonga byonse byamulagêlêlwe; mwisambe: ‘Betwe twê bengili basi no katolwa, twagwania yaa bilya byatûlagilwe kûlonga.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa libamunkya beno bûsûngû kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesû lwabele mukûgya ku Yelusalema, witile kûmbêmbê gya Samalia no Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Lwabele mukûtwela mu kibûndê kimo bantû kumi beno bûsûngû. Bakuminkene nege bemene kûla <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Batele bangwêle djwê banine: “Yesu! Mulangi! Wêtûkyêle lûsa!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Benlf 14.1-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Kyaba Yesû lwalibamwene, wêbalombwele, “Mugyate mukelangêshe kwê balambwili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Lwababele mulwendo bamunkibwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Gûmo wabo lwamwene kwana wahanda, wêbwêlêle kûno mukumutûmbêka Kabesha Mpûngû, kwa djwê likata. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Wêtele ansê kûgêbwa kûmagûlû ga Yesû umutumbikile. Muntû gûdjo ûbele Musamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Hûao Yesû ubulishe: “kûbêle bantû kumi bamukibwe, balya abûla be kwêê? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Hakûmonekile gûnge wêbwêlêle kumutûmbêka Kabesha Mpûngû nambo ya gûdjû mwika?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Hûao Yesû umulombwele gûdjo muntû: “Gimana gyata, lwêtabêsho lobe lwa kûandia.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûsha kwa Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayo 24.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">24.37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Kyaba kimo Bafalisayo bamubulishe Yesû Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwêkasha kyaba kêê. Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû abusi kwa kûmoneka hûtû. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />No kwênghe muntû wêkanyonghona kwêsamba: ‘Bwê ano’ ao ‘Bwê alya’, kibalo Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwê munda gyenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Hûao Yesû wêbalombwele baana bage ba bûganga, “Kyaba kya kasha ûkyamulê kakampwa kûmona sigi limo lya Mwana wa Muntû, mone hamukelimoni. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />No bantû bekemilombola: ‘Lola wêkûlya’, ao ‘Lola wêano’ Mone benywe namukasemuki kwêbalonda. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kibalo ntê nansilya mugenge gwa nkûba byagilêkaima kimpûlûmpandja no kûkenka kuima mugela gûmo kûgya mugela gûnge, ûbyo byabilê kaba kûmoneka mwana wa Muntû byalêkaba sigi lyage. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Mone bêlê, kikamuyenene kûsûsûka biiko mu mianda giingê no kûbengwa no lûbyalo lûlû. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Mub 6.5-8</ref></char></note>Ntêê byalibele sigi lya Nowa ûbyo byalilê kaba mu sigi lyage Mwana wa Muntû. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Mub 7.6-24</ref></char></note>Bantû bagêlêlêle kûlya no kwêkûbêla, kûkwela no kûlobola kuikêla kyaba kilya Nowa lwatwelile mubwato, ntende kalûnga giikile no kwêbatobesha bonse. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Mub 18.20—19.25</ref></char></note> “Bikaba nagwe bya kibele kyaba kya Loti, bantû bagêlêlêle kûlya no kwêkûbêla, kûla no kûsha kukuna ndje no kuimpa. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Mone sigi lilya Loti lwaimine mu Sodoma kûnokile mbila gya mabwe ga kaya kuima mwigûlû no kwêbatobesha bonse. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Byonka nansho, byalilêkaba sigi lilya Mwana wa Muntû alê kaûtwêlwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mt 24.17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Malk 13.15-16</ref></char>
    </note> “Sigi lilyo, muntû gense wêkaba egûlû lya nsese gyage, no bintû bibaka munda gya nsese gyage, hakatuki kûtwala bintû byage. Byonka nansho muntû wêkaba kwêbala hakebwilili kû nsese kûtwala kyokyonse. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Mub 19.26</ref></char></note> Mwidjûkane bimukumine mukasi wa Loti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16.25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Malk 8.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lk 9.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoa 12.25</ref></char></note> Gegense wakûkeba kahandya kikûle kyage; shaekisiminie no gegense wakusiminia wêkegiandia. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nanimilombola, sigi lilya busigi, bantû babêlê bekaba balale amo, gûmo wêkatwalwa, no gûnge wêkasingwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Baana bakasi babêlê bekaba mukûela ngano amo; gûmo wêkatwalwa, no gûûnge wêkasigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Baana balûme babêlê bekaba balonga mingêlo amo mwibala, gûmo wêkatwalwa, no gûnge wêkasigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Baana ba bûganga bamubulishe Yesû: “Kolo, mianda gino gikalongeka kwê?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Alya emubêlê gûkye, ûalya ekakuminkana makûbê.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Lûkûndê lwa mukyêlwe no mukali wa nsambû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Kûwa Yesû wêbalombwele baana ba bûganga bage lûkêndê, kibalo lûbalangêshe kwana kiyenene kûlomba hakûkema. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Wêbalombwele: “Mumwalo gûmo mubele mukali wa nsambû gûmo usibele mutûdjûke Kabesha Mpûngû no kwêne kwagamwa maninga ga bantû. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />No mumwalo gonka gûgo, mubele madjû gûmo mukyêlwe umwikêle gûdjo mukali wa nsambû nghendo gingê, umulombile amwisambêle: ‘Nankwêsasa tange sitê lyane kuima kwê mangi gyane!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kwakyaba kila gûdjo mukali wansambû ûbengile. Mone nfulo wêsambile mumutêma gwage: ‘Nanso ntê nene nsi mumutûdjûke Kabesha Mpûngû no nsimuagamwe muntû, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />mone, kwakûba gûdjû mukyêlwe wanyembya nyembya, sa nsitêkêkye wamona sitê lyage kibalo nakagililili kûnkêmia nghengo no nghendo no nsûmbêlêla.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Nfulo, Kolo ûgêlêlêle kwêsamba: “Mutegelele byalisambile gûdjo mukali wa nsambû mubê. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ntê ûbyo Kabesha Mpûngû wakebesambêla balya besolwele kwana bekamulêlêla busigi no djûba? No ntê wêkesha kwêbakwasha? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nanimilombola, wêkebaha sitê bûkêlê. Mone ntêê Mwana wa Muntû enekasha wêkatana lwêtabêsho mukandje?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa Mufalisayo no Musonkya Misonko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Byonka nansho Yesû wêbalombwele lûkêndê lûno, kibalo kya bantû bakwêmona kûba beno sitê no kûbedja bange: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Bantû babêlê bagêle mukitotelo kûlomba: Gûmo wabo ûbele Mufalisayo, no gûnge Musonkya Misonko.<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />“Gûlya Mufalisayo wêmene ankondo kwêlombelela gemwine wêsambile, ‘Ee Kabesha Mpûngû, na nkufwisha kwakûba nene sinagwe bantû bange ba mulyoko, baswinania, bangêla bûbê, babûseki. Nankufwisha kwana, nene nsi nagwe gûdjû, Musonkia Misonko. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nanigima nghendo gibêlê mwidjênga, na mpimia lûheto kiba kya kumi kya bûmoni bwane bonse.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Mone gûlya Musonkia Misonko ûbele mwimane kûla mpee, no hanyonghwene kûtûlûla meso gage mwigûlû, mone wêbikile kûboko mukyalê no kwêsamba: ‘Ee Kabesha Mpûngû, nkyêle lûsa nene wêno bûbê!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lk 14.11</ref></char></note> “Nanimilombola kwana muntû gûdjû, Musonkia Misonko wêbwêlêle kû nsese gyage, abele mulekelelwe gûlya gûnge halekelelwe, kibalo gense wakesesha. wakatukibwa, nogense waketûkya wakasesibwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wabesela malyese baana bakebake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bantû bamo bamuêlêle Yesû baana bakebake kûba ebatenteke maboko gage. Baana ba bûganga bage lwabamwene nansho, bebakankêle bantû babo, <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />mone Yesû wêbetile baana bakebake , wêsambile: “Mwibaleke babo bana bashe kwandê, namukebasibili kibalo Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwêna bantû bi baba. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Sitê sitê nanimilombola, muntû gegense usimwibûtambûle Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû nagwe mwana mukemuke hakatweli.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsongwa lûme mpeta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mwimeni gûmo umubulishe Yesû: “Mulagi musoga, nonge ntêê kûba nyonghone kûbêkala bûkome bwa milemba mbagala?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesû umulombwele, “mwanda gwakê wangita musoga?” Hakûlê wêko musoga: Nambo Kabesha Mpûngû bugima bwage. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kuim 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Ngib 5.16-20</ref></char></note>Wimwibimanye bisila byabile bisambe: ‘No kalongi buseki, no keyagi, no kebi, no kasitekekya wa bumpi, banyemeke bashobe no nyobe.’<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Gûlya muntû wêndwêle: “Bibyo byonse nimwi bikokele kûbambêla bwanike bwane.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Kyaba Yesû lwategelele gigyo, umulombwele: “Ukino kintû kimo kyolê mutaûkêlwe. Gyata ûshe bintû byonse byolê nabyo, wêbatange balanda, nogwe saûbe no bûkûsa mwigûlû, kûwa djûû ûnonde.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Mone gûdjo muntû lwategelele nansho, usumininwe biiko kibalo ûbele no bûeta bûngê.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesû lwemwene wasumininwa, nansho wêsambile: “Bûlûlê kêê byabilê lûma kwa bampeta kûtwela mu Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Sitê kiele mbela kwê ngamia kûhêta mulolo lya lusinge, kûlêmba mpeta kûtwela mu Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Balya bategelele nansho babulishe: “Nani wêkanyonghona kwandibwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesû wêndwêle: “Kishakunyonghokela kwê bantû, kyakûnghokela kwê Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Noge Petelo wendwêle: “Lola bêlê, twasiga bintû byonse no betwe kûkûlonda.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Sitê sitê nanimilombola, hakûle muntû usigile nsese gyage, mukasi, no bamwanabo, babyali, no baana kibalo kya Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />Kuana wêkaebwa nghendo giingê mbele mu ngikeno gya masigi gano, no mukyaba kikasha wêkaebwa bukome bwa milemba mbagala.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">1 Yesû walisamba lûkwe lwa bûsatû kibalo kya luki lwege</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesû wêbatwalile balya baana ba bûganga kumi no babêlê kûnkondo, wêbalombwele: “Twabagala Yelusalema nokûko kintû kyonse kisintilwe no bamoni kibalo kya Mwana wa Muntû kika gwaninibwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kibalo wêkabêkwa mu maboko ga bantû basibamwitabêshe Kabesha Mpûngû, nobo bekamusompwela, no kumutûka, no kumushêlêla mata. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bekamuhûla nswi no kumwiyaga, mone sigi lya kasatû wakashûka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Mone baana ba bûganga bage habasingûlwêle nsintwe gigi, kibalo nsintwe gyage gibele gibêsêkwe kwabalê, nobo habamanyine Yesû ûbele walisambêla kêê.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wamuhandia mpoki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Kyaba Yesû lwashenine Yeliko, kûbele muntû gûmo mpoki mwikane kûnkondo gya ndjêla, mukûlomba. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Lwategeleshe bibûngo bya bantû bya kûêta, ubulishe: “Kwê kêê?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bamulombwele: “Yesu munasaleti waêta.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Noge ûangwêlê djwê wêsambile: “Yesu, Mwana wa Daudi! Nkyêle lûsa!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Balya batangêle bamukankêle banine talala. Mone gee ûgêlêlêle kwangûla djwê: “Mwana wa Daudi! Nkyêle lûsa!” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesû wêmene ûtakêshe bamusishe kûgêbwa kwage. Gûlya muntû mpoki eikile kûbwêhê, Yesû umubulishe: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Wakeba nkûlongele kêê?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Noge umuêndwêle: “Kolo,” nankeba, “Mone.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesû umulombwele: “Lola, Lwêtabêsho lobe lwakû handia.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Onka ao gûdjo mpoki ûmwene, umulondile Yesû umutumbikile Kabesha Mpûngû. Bantû bonse lwabamwene bibyo, bamu tumbikile Kabesha Mpûngû.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû no Sakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesû ûtwelile mu kibûndê kya Yeliko, noge ûbele waêta mubûkata bwa kibûndê kikyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Mubele muntû gûmo mumo mukibûndê witilwe Sakayo kwana ûbele mukûlû wa Bansonkya misonko, no muntû mpeta swa. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ûkebile kumumona Yesû ntê muntû kê, mone kibalo kya bwêngê bwa bantû noge ûbele mwihê hanyonghwene kumumona. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Nansho, ûtangêle lûbelo kûgêbwa gya kibûngo kya bantû no kûbanda kumutê gwa kikûdju kibalo anyonghone kumumona, Yesû kibalo ûbele waêtêla hao. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Kyaba Yesu aikile hantû alya, ûlwele kwêgûlû umumwene umulombwele: “Sakayo, tûka bûkêlê. Kibalo lêno shambe mwika kû nsese gyobe.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Kwanansho, Sakayo utukile bûkêlê bûkêlê umukunkile Yesû kwa mulogo. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Bantû bonse lwabamwene nansho babambile kûtompola banine: “Wagya kûba mwika wa muntû wêno bûbê.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Mone Sakayo wêmene, umulombwele Yesû: “Tegelela, Kolo! Onkano namamba kwêbaa balanda kiba kya lûheto lwane, no ntê muswininie muntû gegense kintû, nika mwibwêlêlêsha nghendo gina.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesû umulombwele: “Lêno lûhandêlo lwaika mu nsese gyobe, kibalo gûdjû noge mwana wa Bûlaimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mt 18.10</ref></char></note> Kibalo Mwana wa Muntû usile kûkeba no kûandia balya basimine.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkendê lwa biêndê kumi bya nolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Kyaba bantû lwababele bategelela gigyo, Yesû wêbalombwele lûkêndê, kibalo ûbele kûbwêê kuika Yelusalemu, no bantû baningile kwana, Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bûbele bwaika kyaba kyonka kikyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Nansho wêbalombwele: “Kûbele muntû gûmo wa musoo gwa kibûkolo ûlongile kûgya kûmwalo gwa kûla kûba atambûle kitenta kya bûkolo, kûwa ebwêlêle. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Mbêlê gya kûsemuka, wêbetile bengili kumi mubûkata bwabo, no wêbaele gûmo gense biêndê kumi bya nolo wêbalombwele: ‘Musûlûshe no nolo gino kuikêla anankebwêla.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Mone bantû bansê gigyo bamusikilwe no kûtuma bikûla kwana mugye mwisambe, ‘Hatumuso muntû gûdjû abe kolo wêtû.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Nonansho wêbwêlêle wawakûtambûla kitenta kya bûkolo. Wêbetile balya bengili bage, balya besigêle nolo kibalo amanye bûngê bwa bûsangwe kêê gûmo gense bwamwene kûbusûlû bwage. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mwingili mutangi wikile wêsambile, ‘Kolo, mwene bûsangwe nghendo kumi gya nolo gyo mpele.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Noge umuêndwêle, ‘Walonga kisoga gwee mwingili! Kwakûba ûbele mulûmbûlûke mumwanda gûsho, nankûwa kitenta kya kûbêkala mialo kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Muntû wa bûbêlê usile, wêsambile, ‘Kolo, nolo gyo mpele nasisha bûsangwe nghendo gitano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Kolo wange umuêngdwêle, ‘Nankûwa kitenta kya kûbêkala mialo gitano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Mwingili gûnge usile kwêsamba, ‘Kolo, bûgûla nolo gyobe; mbisikile senene mukihûto. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nkutudjukile kibalo gwee wê muntû walûûma, wakûtwala lûheto kûntû kosi mubeke. No wakwêmbûla kûntû kosi mukune.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Kolo wage umûêndwêle, ‘Nankûwa bûkalabale kûlondana no kisambwa kyobe gwe mwine! Gwee mwingili mubê! Ûmanyine kwana nene ni muntû walûûma, nankûtwala nolo gyansi mubêke no kwagûla byansi mukune. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kibalo kyakêê, aubikile nolo gyane, mubûkûsa? Kibalo andê kebwêlêla nkatwale nolo gyane no bûsangwe bwage.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Hao wêbalombwele balya babele alya, ‘Mumuswinie gigyo nolo mukamutange gûlya ûmwene bûsangwe nghendo kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />“Mone bamulombwele, ‘Kolo, gûdjo elê no bitêta kumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mt 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Malk 4.25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lk 8.18</ref></char></note> ‘Noge wêbaêndwêle,’ gegense wêno kintû wêkahebwa, ‘No kumubilêsha, mone gûlya usi nakyo; no kilya kyalê nakyo, wakabûgûlwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Mone, balya bamangi basi bakampwe nene mbe mubêkali wabo, mwibasishe ano mwibeyage kûgêbwa kwane!’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû watwela Yelusalema nagwe ni Kolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoano 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Kûwa kwêsamba mianda gigyo, Yesû ûtangêle kûgebwa gya kibûngo kûsela Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Lwashenine kuika Betefage no Betania, kibûndê kibele mu Lûgûlû lwa Mpasi, wêbatumine baana ba bûganga bage babêlê <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />wêbalombwele: “Mugyate mukakibêndê kikûlwendo lwenyu; amulêkatwele mukakibûndê shamutane mwana mpûnda mukwêkwe, kwana ûshalibandwe no muntû. mumusokone mukamusishe ano. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ntêê muntû walimibûsha, mwanda gwakêê mwa musokona mumulombole, “Kolo waligikeba.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Nfulo balya batuminwe bagêle no kûtana kintû kyonse monka Yesû mwalibalombwelele. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Lwababele bamu sokona gûlya mwana mpûnda, bene kibûndê bebabulishe, “Kibalo kyakêê mwamu sokona mwana mpûnda?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />“Balya baana babûganga bebaêndwêle,” Kolo wamukeba, <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />nfulo bamuêlêle Yesu. Gûlya mwana mpûnda kûwa bandjile bishandê byabo egûlû lyage kûwa bamubandiishe Yesû egûlû lyage. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Kyaba Yesû lwegêlêlêle walê mumubande mwana mpûnda, bantû bandjile bishandê byabo mu ndjêla.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Kyaba kyashabele kûbwêhê no mutûkyo gwa Lûgûlû lwa Mpasi, kibûngo kyonse kya baana babûganga bage babambile kûsankêlêla no kûmutûmbêka Kabesha Mpûngû kwa djwê likata kibalo kya bilongwa no biesha bingê byabamwene, besambile: <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Nghib 118.26</ref></char></note> “Eselwe malyese Kolo wakûsha mu sina lya Kabesha Mpûngû!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Angalê mwigûlû no ntumbo mwigûlû biiko!<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Hao bange Bamafalisayo babele mukilya kibûngo kya bantû, bamulombwele Yesû. “Mulangi,” wêbakande, “baana ba bûganga bobe!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle, “Nanimilombola, ntê baba bokûtalala sitê gago mabwe shagate kahûndû.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walêlêla kibalo kya Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesû lwashenine kûbwêhe no Yelusalema, no lwamwene, ulilile, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />wêsambile, “Sitê walê mumanye lêno lili mianda gya kusisha angalê! Mone ano kintû kikyo kibisêkwê nogwe haûnyonghoni kwikimona kûmeso gobe! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Masigi ge kemiikêla kwana mangi gyobe gikaimpa nsendo, no kwêmyalagala, no kukwininika mugela gonse. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bekakûkenya kenya gwee amo no baana bobe munda gya lûbûgo lobe; bekakweyaga no habakakusigili no line bwe limo kwêgûlû lya bwe linge, kibalo aûkabandilili kyaba Kabesha Mpûngû elêkasha kûkûhandia!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wagya mukitotelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoano 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Nfulo Yesû lwegêle mukitotelo ubambile kwêbakûmba balya babele bagûsha bintû mumo, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isay 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yelem 7.11</ref></char></note> Noge wêbalombwele, “Kisintwe mulûsinto lûlûmbûlûke, nsese gyane shagibe nsese gya milombelo, ‘Mone benywe mwaligilonga kûba.’Lûsako lwa baswinania!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.47: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Lk 21.37</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yesû ûbele walanga masigi gonse mukitotelo. Balambwili bakûlû no Basinti ba Bisila, no bakûlû ba bantû, babele bakeba ndjêla gya kumwiyaga, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />mone habamwene, hantû akumwêyagêla, kibalo bantû bonse babele bamutegelesha bisoga.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bûshoo kibalo kya kitenta kya Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Sigi limo Yesû ûbele walibalanga bantû mukitotelo no kûsaûla mwanda gûsoga, Balambwili bakûlû, no Balangi babisila amo no bemeni babantû, baikile <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />bamubulishe: “Wêtûlombole, walonga mianda gino kwa kitenta kêê? Byonka nani ûkûele kitenta kino?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “No nene shanimibûshe bûsho. Munombole, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />kitenta kya Yoana kya kûbatisha kiimine kwê Kabesha Mpûngû ao kûbantû?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Mone boo bebûsenie bobene kwa bobene, “Besambile ntê betwe kwêsamba, ‘Luimine kwê Kabesha Mpûngû,’ Gee shaetûbûshe: ‘Mwanda gwakêê hamwibamwitabêshe?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Mone betwe kwêsamba, ‘Luimine kwê muntû,’ bantû bonse shabetwase mabwe, kibalo bonse betabêshe kwana Yoano ûbele mumoni.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Kwanansio bamuêndwêle, “Hatwêdjê kitenta kikyo ntê kiimine kwêê.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesû wêbalombwele, “No mwine nene nsimilomboli, nanonga mwianda gino, kwa kitenta kêê.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa balimi babê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isay 5.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû ûgêlêlêle kwêbalombola bantû lûkêndê lûlû: “Muntû gûmo ulimine bala lya misabibu, lwabawêle kûwana kûsigêlana no balimi bamo bekasigala munkûempa bala lyage, ûgêle kûnse giinge no kwêkana kûko kyaba kila. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Kyaba kya kwêmbûla akiikile, muntû gûdjo umutumine mwingili wage kûbalya balimi atwale kiba kya bimbûlwa bya bala lya misabibû. Mone balya balimi bamuhulile mwingili gûdjo bamukumbile wimine minie samba. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Gûlya mwine bala umutumine byonka mwingili gûnge; mone babo bamuhulile gûdjo byonka nansilya, bamulongele bintû bya nsoni, no kumwibwêlêsha minie samba. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Umutumine byonka wabûsatû; gûdjo noge, bamukomine, no kumukûmba minie samba. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Kûwa mwine bala lya misabibu wêsambile, ‘Sanonge ntêê? Samutume mwanane wamwana mulûme, ange sabamukokele gee!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Mone balimi lwabamumwene, besongenie, ‘Gûdjû umuyanii, nfulo. Tumwiyage kûba bûyana bwage bûbe bwetû!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Kwanansho bamutele andje gya lilya bala lya misabibu bamwiyagile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Yesû wêbabulishe, gûlya mwine bala, lya misabibu wêkebalonga ntê?” Balya balimi. <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />“Wakasha kwêbatobesha balimi babo, no kwêbaa balimi bange lilya bala lya misabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Bantû lwabategelele mianda gigyo, besambile, “Nagikaimini no eneasho!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Nghib 118.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mone Yesû wêbakwenenie meso no kwêbabûsha, “Lusinto, lûlû lûlûmbûlûke, lwêno nsintûlwe kê?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Bwe libengilwe no baimpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">Alibwe liyenene lya mubambo.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Muntû gegense kûgwêla egûlû lya bwee lilyo wakatimuka bihêndê bihêndê; nolyo kumugwêlêla muntû gegense, likamuhele.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûsho kibalo kya kuimia mulambû kwê Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Balangi babisila no Balambwili bakûlû bakebile kumukwata, onkao kibalo basingûlwêle kwana lûkêndê lûlo wêsambêle kibalo kyabo, mone batudjukile bantû.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Kwanasho babele bamukedja Yesû no kutuma bakedji. Belonge kûba basitê, kibalo bamutêgêle ku mianda gyalê mukwêsamba, kûba bamubêke ansê gya bûkome no kitenta kya babêkali. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Nansho babo bakedji bamubulishe, “Mulangi, twêdjê kwana wakwêsamba no kûlanga bya sitê. Twêdjê kwana gwee wênghe ndekeni, gwee walanga sitê kibalo kya ndjêla gya Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Wêtûlombole, ntê bisoga no habisoga kuimia mulambû, kwê Kaisali?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Mone Yesû ûsingûlwêle bulimuke bwabo wêbalombwele, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Munangêshe lûmea lûmo. Kûwa wêbabulishe lûkebo no sina lili byani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">“Nobo bamuêndwêle,” lwa Kaisali.<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Hûao Yesû wêbaendwêle, “Bya Kaisali, mumue Kaisali, no bya Kabesha Mpûngû, mumue Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Habanyonghwene kumusongela kwa mwanda gogonse alya kûgêbwa kwa bantû, no nansho begalagenie no bekene talala, kibalo kya mpêndwe gyage.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûshû kibalo kya kûshûka kwa baki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Bilb 23.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bamo ba basandukayo, ûbantû balya bakwêsamba kwana baki habakashuki, bamuikêle Yesû no kumubûsha, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Ngib 25.5</ref></char></note>“Mulangi, Musa wêtusintêle kwana: ‘Ntê mwanabo wakya no kumusiga mukasi alê mwana, nfulo, gûlya mwinage wasigala muyenene amuyane gudjo mukyêlwe, kûba amubyalêle mwanabo wage baana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Nfulo kûbele no balûnda kiloba. Gûlya mutangi ûkwelile mukasi; mone muntû gûdjo ukile akusiga mwaana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Gûlya mulûnda wabûbêlê umuyanine gûlya mukyêlwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />no mulûnda wa bûsatû byonka nansilya. Mianda gibele byonka nansho kûbonse kiloba bonse bakile kûbûla kusiga baana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Nfulo, gûlya mwana mukasi ukile byonka nansho. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Onka, sigi baki abalê kashûlwa, mwana mukasi gûlya wêkaba mukasi wa nii? Kibalo bonse kiloba babele bamukwele.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Mungikeno gya kyaba kino, bantû bakûkwela no kûkwelana, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />mone balya babalwe kûba no ngikeno mukyaba kyakasha no mukûshûka kwa baki habakakweli no kûkwelwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bekaba nagwe masalagûlû. Habakaki byonka no banaa ba Kabesha Mpûngû, kibalo bashukile kuima kûbaki. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:6">Esl 3.6</ref></char></note>Mone ku musahû gwa kihûdja kya kûnka kaya. No Musa ûlangêshe kwana bantû bakûshûka kibalo umuitile Kolo ‘Kabesha Mpûngû wa Bûlaimu, Kabesha Mpûngû wa Isaka, no Kabesha Mpûngû wa Yakobo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Nfulo gee ha Kabesha Mpûngû wabaki, nambo Kabesha Mpûngû kabalya bepoo, kibalo kwage bonse bepoo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bamo mubalya Balangi babisila: besambile, “Mulangi, waêndûla bisoga mbeela!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Nghimba gya hao hakûbele muntû wakumubûsha byonka mianda giinge.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûsho kibalo kya Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Kûwa Yesû wêbabulishe, “Kibalo kyakê gwa kwêsambwa kwana Kilisitu mwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nghib 110.1</ref></char></note>Daudi mwine wêsambile mubûkû lya lwêmbo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Kolo umulombwele Kolo wane:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Gikana kûboko kwane kwa kûlûme<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />kwikêla andêkegibêka mangi gyobe kûba kikanwa kya kûbêkêla magûlû gobe.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Kyokûba Daudi wamwita: ‘Kolo,’ bibûba ntê, byonka Kilisitu, abe mwana wa Daudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malêngê kibalo kya Balangi babisila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Kyaba bantû bonse lwababele bamutegelela Yesû, wêbalombwele baana babûganga bage, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mwiempe no Balangi babisila kwana bakûkampwa kûêta hêta bashale mankanso gala, no kûkampwa kwimunwa kwa bûnyeme ebûlû ebantu bengê; bakûkampwa kwêkana kubikanwa bya kûgêbwa mu masese ga milombelo gya Bayuda no kwêkana hantû anyeme kukikwe; <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />boo bakwêbaswinia bintû mu nsese ga bakyêlwe, mwanda bakwêmonia kwakûlonga milombelo gila! Bantû nagwe baba bekamona bûkalabale bûkata mbeela!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Sadaka lya madjû mukyêlwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maluko 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesû lwatûlwêle meso gage wêbamwene ba mpeta byababele babêka mulambû gwabo mukitala kya Kitotelo, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />umumwene byonka madjû gûmo mukyêlwe mulanda wakûbêka mukitala lûmea lûbêlê lûke lwamikûba. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Wêsambile, “Sitê sitê nanimilombola madjû gûdjû mukyêlwe nanda wabêka bingê biiko mu kitala kulêmba bonse. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kibalo bange bonse baiminie mulambû gwabo kûlondana no bûngê bwa lûmea lwabo; mone gûdjû madjû mukyêlwe waimia kûlonda no bûlanda bwage, byonse byabele nabyo, nokine kilya kyabele mukûdjagêle.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walagûla konwa kwa Kitotelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maluko 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bamo mubûkata bwa baana babûganga ba Yesû babele babanga kibalo kya Kitotelo, mwakibele kiimpêlwe no mabwe gasongwe no galengûlwe no milambû giimibwe kwê Kabesha Mpûngû. Mone Yesû wêbalombwele, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Gino gyonse gyamwakûmona ano hakûlê bwee likasigala egûlû lya linge; mone kintû kyonse kikonwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mudjembo no masûsû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />“Baana ba bûganga,” bamubulishe Yesû, “Mulangi mianda gigyo gya kaimina kyaba kê? Kabandêlêlo kê kekalangêsha kwana mianda gigyo agikûbwêhê kûlongeka?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle, “Mwilole namukasi mukebembe; kibalo bangê bekaimina. No kwêtûbêka musina lyan, nokwêsamba kwana, ‘Nene ûge!’ No kwêsamba, ‘Kuana kyaba kyashena!’ Mone benywe namukebalondi. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Nfulo amulê kategelela musahû gwa lûgosi no byakwimina na mukatudjuki; kibalo kiyenene biimine bêlê, mone nfulo gya byonse abyalike.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Nfulo ûgêlêlêle kwêsamba, “Musoo gûmo gwêkalwa no musoo gûnge; bûkolo bûmo bwêkalwa no bûkolo bûnge. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kûntû konse kwêkaba no anda likata lya nsê, no ndjala no mitongo gya kûsambûkelana, antu hala hala; kwêkaba byesha bikata bya kûtûdjûla no kabandêlêlo kuima mwigûlû. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Mone nghimba gya kuimina gigyo gyonse, bekemibêka bakwêkwe, bekemidjembya bekemibêka mumaboko ga bakûlû ba masese ga milombelo ga Bayuda no kwimibêka mubikûtû; mwikailwa kûgêbwa gya bamakolo ga babêkali; kibalo kya sina lyane. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Lino likaba lyese lyenyu kûsahûla musahu gûsoga. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Lk 12.11-12</ref></char></note>Nfulo namukedjembya mumitêma gyenyu, hakûlê kuninga nghimba gya kyaba kibalo kya kwênenghenena gwee mwine, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />kibalo Nene mwine nankemitanga lango no mianda no lweni no mangi gyenyu hagikanyonghoni kwimilêmba no kwimiakania. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Bange mubûkata bwenyû bekaimibwa no babyali babo, mbyalwa nenyu, bantû ba musoo gwenyu; amo no balûnda nenyu. Nobo bekeyaga bamo abûkata bwenyu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Bantû bonse bekemisikwa benywe kibalo kya sina lyane. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Mone nolwêne lûnywene lûmo lwa matwe genyu halûkasimini. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kwa bulindili bwenyu, mwikahandya ngikeno gyenyu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walagûla konwa kwa mwalo gwa Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayo 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maluko 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Amulê kamona mwalo gwa Yelusalema gwagalagalwa no basilêkale, nfulo mumanye kwana koonwa kwa gûgo mwalo kwaika. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Kyaba kikyo balya bekaba ku Yuda batinine kûngûlû; balya bemumwalo gwa Yelusalema baime mumo, no balya bekûmabala nabakebwilili mu mwalo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Osey 9.7</ref></char></note>Kibalo sigi lilyo ‘Nisigi lya kûebwa bûkalabale’, kûba gyonse gisintilwe mulusinto lûlûmbûlûke gigwanine. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Musibo gwabo beno limi no bakonkya sigi lilyo! Kibalo kwêkaba masûsû gangê mu mwalo, no nsûngû gya Kabesha Mpûngû gikebashêla bantû ba kandje kano. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Baangê bekeyagwa kwa bipanga, bange beka kwatwa kimakasa mu mwalo gonse; no mwalo gwa Yelusalema gwêkanyantwa no bantû ba misoo ginge kuikêla kyaba kyabo akilê kabidjêka.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûsha kwa Mwana wa muntû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isay 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Esek 32.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Mput 6.12-13</ref></char>
    </note>“Kwêkaba no kabandêlêlo kadjûba, kwesi, no tûmbalambala. Ano akandje misoo gikaba no masûsû, no kûkwatwa no kahaga kibalo kya nganingani kûlondana nonkugo gya mabêmbê ga siba. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bantû bekaûngêla mitêma kibalo kya mwenyo gûkata, bakûlwegelela mianda gikebakuma mukandje kibalo bûkome bwa mwigûlû bwêkaninghina. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Ndan 7.13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Mput 1.7</ref></char></note>Hûao bekamumona Mwana wa Muntû wakûsha mukile, wêno bûkome no ntumbo giingê. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Kyaba mianda gigyo agilê kabamba kuimina, mwimane no kûtûlûla matwe genyu egûlû, kibalo lûhandêlo lwenyu lwaikêla.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Milango kuima ku muntê gwa kikûdjû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Kûwa Yesû wêbalombwele baana ba bûganga bage lûkênde lûlû: “Mulole mutê gwa kikûdjû no mitê giinge gyonse. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Amwamona kwana gyabamba kuimia mani, musingûlûle kwana kyaba kya bûdjogo kyaikêla. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Byonka nansho, amwakamona mianda gigyo gya longeka, samusingûlûle kwana Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwaikêla.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Sitê sitê nanimilombola lûbyalo lûlû lwa ano mpe alukaiti ntê bibi byonse abyalilongeke. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Gûlû no kandje bya kuêta, mone mianda gyane agikaiti mbela.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiyenene kûba meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mube meso! Mitêma gyenyu nagikasi kûnyemenwa nokûlya lyala, bûkolwa no mudjembo gwa ngikeno gino ntê anansho, sigi lilya lya kûsha Yesû likemiikêla kimpûlû mpandja <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />kibalo kikemiikela nagwe kimpûlû mpandja kû bantu bonse bekane kokonse mukandje. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Nfulo, mukelwe no kûlomba kyaba kyonse, kibalo mumone bûkome bwa kûlega mianda gyonse gino gikaimina, no benywe mwikamona kûba benyonghone kwêmana kûgêbwa kwa Mwana wa muntû.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19.47</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Masigi gonse mugûndja Yesû ûbele walanga bantû mu Kitotelo, no masigi gonse lêngolo ûbele wagyata Kûlûgûlû lwakwêtwa lwa Mpasi no kwêkana kûko busigi bûgima mukûlomba. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Bantû bonse baikile lukindwe bwee mu Kitotelo kibalo bamutegelele.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Sondjelo lya Kumwiyaga Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoano 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kuim 12.1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sigi likata lya mikate gisigibêkwe kidjûsho lihitilwe sigi lya Pasaka, libele lishene. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Bakûlû ba balambwili no balangi Babisila babele bakeba ndjêla gya kumwiyaga Yesû mone bebatudjukile bantû.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wagitabêsha kumuana Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Nfulo lyabola umutwelile Yuda, wakwêtwa Isikaliota, gûmo wa balya babikûla kumi no babêlê. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />No Yuda ûgêle kûbakûlû ba Balambwili no kwê baempi ba kitotêlo, ubangile nabo byalê bûnyonghona kûlonga kibalo kya kumuana Yesû. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nobo balogelelwe nage kwêtabêsania kumua lûheto. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda wêtabêshe no ûbambile kûkeba kyaba kiyenene kya kwana Yesû kwabalê, kwana hantû asibantû.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibêka djambûla kûlya kyakûlya kya Pasaka no baana ba bûganga bage</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoano 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Nfulo, sigi lya mikate gisigibêkwe kidjûsho lihikile lilyo ûlyo sigi kwana mwana mukokoo gwa Pasaka kûsêndjwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Nansho, Yesû wêbatumine ba Petelo no Yoano, wêsambile: “Mugyate mwitûbêkêle djambûla Pasaka lya shatûlye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />“Bamubulishe wakampwa tûkûbekêle djambûla kwêê?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Wêbaendwele, “Mutegelele, amulê mukûgya mukibûndê. Mwikasanganwa no mwana mulûme gûmo ûtwête mulondo gwa madjê mumulonde kuikêla munda gya nsese gyene katwela, mumulombole mwine nsese, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />‘Mulangi wakûbûsha, kikwêê kyûmba kya bamwika kyashandêle Pasaka amo no baana babûganga bane?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Noge shaemilangêshe kyûmba kikata kya egûlû, kyalê kilengûlwe bisoga. Mulongolole mumo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Nfulo bagêle, nobo basangene bintû byonse monka Yesû mwelibalombwele, babikile djambûla kikwe kya Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kûeta egûlû</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikwe kya Kolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bakolinto 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Kyaba akigwanine, Yesû wêkene kûlya kyakûlya amo no babikûla. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Wêbalombwele babikûla, “Nankampwa biiko kûlya Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kûêta egûlû</char></note> lino amo nenyu nghimba gya kûsûsûka kwane! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kibalo nanimilombola nsikali byonka Pasaka, kuikêla abûlê kagwanibwa Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Kûwa Yesû ûbûgwêle lûhêndê lwa difai, gee kufwisha no kwêkisela malyese, wêsambile, “Mutambûle lûhêndê mwitangene mubûkata bwenyu. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kibalo nanimilombola nsikekûbili byonka difai lya misabibu, kuikêla Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû abûlêkasha.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Kûwa ûtwalile mukate gee kufwisha no kwêgwesela malyese, wigutimwine, no kwêbaa baana ba bûganga bage, wêsambile: “Gûgû ûmubêlê gwane, gwaimibwa kibalo kyenyu. Mulonge nansho kwakungidjûkana nene.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yelem 31.31-34</ref></char></note>Byonka nansho nghimba gya kyakûlya kya lêngolo, ûtwalile lûhêndê lwa difai, wêsambile: “Lûhêndê lûno kilageno kiya mumasi gane, gakwêsêka kibalo kyenyu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Nghib 41.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mone, kûboko! Kwagûlya wêkampana kwêano amo nane amutalako! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Kibalo Mwana wa muntû wakeyagwa monka mwelagêlêlwe no Kabesha Mpûngû. Mone musibo gwage muntû gûdjo wakamuana!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Baana ba bûganga bage babambile kwêbûsenia bobene kwa bobene, nani mubûkata bwêtû wêbunyonghona kûlonga mwanda bigûgo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpaka kibalo kya Bûkûlû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mt 18.1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Malk 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Lk 9.46</ref></char>
    </note>Kuimine mpaka abûkata bwa baana ba bûbanga, kwana nani ûmonekile kûba mukûlû kûlêmbêla baange. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mt 20.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Malk 10.42-44</ref></char></note>Yesû wêbalombwele, “Makolo ga bashantaila gakûbêkala bantû babo kwabumu; no balya beno kitenta ‘Ba kwigita balûmbûlûke.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mt 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Malk 9.35</ref></char></note>Mone benywe namukegûlani nabo; nambo, gûlya wêko mukûlû abûkata bwenyu, muyenene abe mwanike kûbonse, no wêko mwimeni muyenene abe nagwe mwingili. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Yoa 13.12-15</ref></char></note>Kibalo nani wêko mukûlû, gûlya mwikane kumutalako ao gûlya wakwêbakwasha? Hagûlya mwikane kumutalako, mone nene niabûkata bwenyu nagwe mwingili.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Benywe ûbo balya babele amo nonene mubitompibwa byane; <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />byonka nansilya Tata wane byempele bûkome bwa Bûkolo, byonka nansho nonene nankemiabêla bûkome bwa Bûkolo. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mt 19.28</ref></char></note>Kibalo mumone kûlya no kwêkûbêla kumutalako gwane mu kikwe kya bûkolo bwane, no mwikekana kubikanwa bya bûkolo, mukûtanga bûkalabale makabêla kumi no gabêlê ga Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walagûla kwana Petelo wêkamwituna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoano 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simo, Simo! Tegelela! Liabola walomba kwêmieya benywe bonse nagwe ni ngano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Mone nene nankûlombelela gwe Simo, kibalo lwêtabêsho lobe nalûkandwa. Nogwe kûwa kungibwêlêlêla wêbahe mutêma ba mbyalwa nobe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Noge Petelo umuêndwêle Yesû: “Kolo, ni djambûla kûgya amo nogwe mukikûtû no kûkya amo nobe!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />“Yesû umwindwêle nankûlombola gwe Petelo,” Nghimba gya kadjongwe henelibêlêkêle “busigi bwa lêno saunitune nghendo gisatû kwana aûngindjê nene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûtwala kasiba mutûngû no bikwabêlo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9-10">Mt 10.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-9">Malk 6.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Lk 9.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10.4</ref></char>
    </note>Kûwa Yesû wêbabulishe baana babûganga bage, “Kyaba kyanimitumine kûbûla kasiba, mutûngû, no bikwabêlo, mutaûkêlwe no kintû kyokyonse?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">“Bamuêndwêle ûwe,” hatûtaûkêlwe no kintû.<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />“Wêbalombwele,” Mone onka wêno kasiba ekatwale, no “wêno mutûngû byonka nansho; no gegense usino lûpanga, hoshe kishandê kyage hole kimo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isay 53.12</ref></char></note>Kwanansio nanimilombola kiyenene gigwanine kwandê mianda gilya gisintilwe mulusinto lûlûmbûlûke, ‘Ubalilwe amo no beno bûbê,’ Kwa sitê gilya gisintilwe kibalo kyane, gyaikêla kûgwanina.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Baana ba bûganga bage bamulombwele, “Kolo! Lola ano eno tûbembe tûbêlê,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">“Noge!” Wêbaêndwele nfulo kyagwanina.<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walomba kûlûgûlû lwa Mpasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoano 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesû uimine nagwe monka mubelele kisela kyage, ûgêle kûlûgûlû lwa Mpasi, baana ba bûganga bage; bamulondile. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Lwabaikile kûko wêbalombwele baana ba bûganga bage, “Mulombe namukasi mukatwele mubitompanwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kûwa Yesû wêtolile kûla naabo nokûgyata hantû ekûla kwamuntû kûta bwee ukutamine ulombile. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Wêsambile Tata,” ntê gwekûkampwa, “nsindwêle lûhêndê lûlû. Mone nakikabi kiswa mutêma kyane, naambo kiswa mutêma kyobe, kilongeke.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Hûao Masalagûlû kuima mwigûlû gamuimine no kumubêka buumu. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Noge lwabele mumisa gikole ûlombile kwa mukanka mbeela; no mataka gamwimine nagwe manoko ga masi gasululukile kuika ansêê.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Lwawêle kûlomba wêbwêlêle kwê baana babûganga bage, wêbasangene babêdjê, kwana bakimine kûlondana no maninga. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Wêbalombwêle: “Kibalo kyakê mubêdjê? Mubyûke mulombe na mukasi mukatwele mubitompanwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûkwatwa kwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoano 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesû lwabele ûkya kûbanga, kibûngo kikata kya bantû kisile, kibele kya lûbûlûlwa no Yuda, kwana ubele gûmo wabalya baana ba bûganga kumi no babêlê. Umushenine Yesû kibalo amutomone. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Mone Yesû umulombwele, “Yuda, wamuana Mwana wa muntû kwa kumutomona?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Kyaba baana babûganga bage, lwabamwene bilya byakeba kuimina, besambile, “Kolo, twêbasonye sonye bipanga byetû?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Gûmo wabo umukalile lûpanga mwingili wa mulambwili mukûlû umukalile kûtwê kwage kûlûme.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Mone Yesû wêsambile, “Mulekele kyagwana!” Ukumine kûtwê kwa gûdjo muntû umwandishe.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Kûwa Yesû wêbalombwele balambwili bakûlû no balwegeleli ba Kitotelo no baleli basile kumukwata: “Mwasha no bipanga no nkonko nagwe nansilya mwakûgya kûkwata mukûlû wa baswinania? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19.47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref></char></note>Lwambele amo nenyu masigi gonse mukitotelo, mwanda gwakê hamunkwatile. Mone kino ûkyaba kyenyu, kya bûbêkali bwa kolo wakidjo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wamwituna Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayo 26.57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maluko 14.53-54</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoano 18.12-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Nfulo, bamukwatile Yesû bamutwalile no kûgya nage kû nsese gya mulambwili mukûlû; mone Petelo ûbele wamulonda nghimba kwa kûla. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Lwabawêle kûkûnkya kaya mwibûlû, Petelo usile nkonta kaya amo nabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mwingili gûmo wa mwana mukasi lwamumwene Petelo mwikane kûbwêhê no kaya, umulwele soo, wêsambile: “Muntû gûdjû noge ûbele amo no Yesû!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Mone Petelo witunine, wêsambile, “Hola gwe mwana mukasi, nene nsimwidje!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Nghimba gya kyaba kisho muntû gûnge umumwene Petelo, wêsambile, “Gwee noge wêgûmo wabo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Mone Petelo wêndwêle, “Hemulû, nene nsi gûmo wabo!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ngimba gya kyaba kimo kûhêta, muntû gûnge usitêkêkye, “Sitê gûdjû muntû noge ûbele no Yesû, kibalo Mugalilaya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Mone Petelo wêsambile, “Hemulû, nsidjê byono kwêsamba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">No onkao, ûkyakûbanga, kadjongwe ûbêlêkêle. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Kolo Yesû wiugulukile, umulwele Petelo, soo no Petelo wêdjûkene gilya gyalombwelwe no Kolo: “Lêno kûgêbwa kwa kadjongwe henelibêlêkêle, wakanituna nghendo gisatû.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Hûao Petelo wimine andje no ulilile kwa lûsa biiko.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wasompwelwa no kûhûlwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayo 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maluko 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Balya bantû babele bamuempa Yesû bamulile no kumusompwela. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bamukwikile kaûba kûmeso no kumubûsha: “Lagûla tûmone, nani? Wakûûla!” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bamulombwele mianda gingê gya malûmbû.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû kûgêbwa kwa Kilye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoano 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Lwabûkendulukile kilye kya bemeni ba bantû, kwana bakûlû ba balambwili no Balangi babisila, bakuminkene amo, noge Yesû uililwe kûgêbwa kwabalê. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />“Nobo bamubulishe,” Ntêê gwee, “û Kilisitu?” Wêtûlombole</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Mone Yesû wêbaêndwêle, “No ntêê nene kwimilombola, hamuso kungitabêsha; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />no nene kwimibûsha bûsho, hamuso kûmpêndûla. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Mone kûbambêla ano Mwana wa Muntû, wêkaba mwikane koboko kûlûme kwa Kabesha Mpûngû wêno bûkome.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Hûao bonse bamubulishe, “Gwee ûge Mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Yesû wêbaêndwêle, “Benywe bene ûbalisamba, nene ûge.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Kûwa besambile: “Kibalo kyakê twakûkeba kusitêkêkya kûnge! Twategelela betwe bene byaima mukanya kage!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû wailwa kûgêbwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27.11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoano 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kûwa kibûngo kyonse kimene kimuilile Yesû kwi Pilato, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Nobo babambile kumusongela Yesû: “Nokumulombola Pilato twamukwata muntû gûdjû ûtompile kwêbabemba bantû ba musoo gwetû, walisamba natûkaimia milambû kwê Kaisali waligita Kilisitu, Mubêkali.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato umubulishe Yesû: “Gwee û mubêkali wa Bayuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesû wêndwêle: “Gwee ûwalisamba.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Kûwa Pilato wêbalombwele bakûlû ba balambwili no bantû: “Simumone bûbê bobonse kwê muntû gûdjû.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Mone bagêlêlêle kwêsamba: “Milango gyage gyasomenkania lûma mu Bayuda bonse. Ûbambêle Galilya no ano washa elê ano mu mwalo gonse gwa bayuda.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wailwa kwê Mubêkali Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato lwategelele nansho ubulishe: “Muntû gûdjû mu Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Kyaba kyasingûlwêle kwana Yesû wêansê gya kitenta kya Mubêkali Helode, umwilile kwê mubêkali Helode, kibalo sigi lilyo ûbele Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Kyaba Mubêkali Helode lwamumwene Yesû, ûlogelelwe biiko, kibalo kyaba kila ûbele wategelela mianda giinge kibalo kyage. Ûbele wakeba kukuminkana no Yesû. Helode ûkebile kûmona alonge byesha bibyo ûlwegelele kwana Yesû saalonge kyesha kimo. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Mubêkali Helode umubulishe Yesû mianda giingê, mone Yesû hamuêndwêle gogonse. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bakûlû babalambwili no basinti babisila kûgêbwa baiminie nsongesi gyabo kwa bumu biiko. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Nfulo, Helode amo no basilêkale bage bamusompwele Yesû no kumumonia nsoni; kûwa bamushikile kishandê kya bûkolo bamwibwêlêshe kwi Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Sigi lilyo Mubêkali Helode no Pilato kwana kûgêbwa babele bamangi; kûbamba sigi lilyo balabukile abe balûnda.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wakalêlwa nsambû gya luki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoano 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato witile kibûngo kya balambwili bakûlû, no bakûlû ba babantû, amo no bantû babo, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />wêbalombwele: “Mwamusisha muntû gûdjû kwandê mwagana kwana ûbele walibabemba bantû kûlonga bûntomboki. Onka, namubûsha kûgêbwa gyenyu kibalo kya mianda gilya, no nene namona hakûlê mubambo gogonse gwa masongesi genyu kibalo kyage. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />No ha nene yaa, mone nomwine Mubêkali Helode, hamwene bûbê bobonse. Ukibalo wa mwibwêlêsha kwatûlê, nansilya bya mwamona, muntû gûdjû hamulonge kyokyonse kiyenene masûsû galuki. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Nansho shantakêshe aûlwe nswii no mumulekelele.”<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kwakûba kibele kiyenene kwêbasokwena mukwêkwa gumo kyaba kya sigi likata lya Pasaka<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Mone bonse batele kaûndû amo: “Musindûle muntû gûdjo! Wêtûsokwene Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Balaba ûbele mukwêkwe mukikûtû kibalo kya kûbambya bûntombosi mukibûndê, no kibalo kya kwêyagana.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato ûkebile kumulekelela Yesû, nansho wêsambile nabo byonka. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Mone boo batele kahûndû: “Akonkomenwe! Akonkomenwe kumutê gwa mpênga mpêtia!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato wêbabulishe lûkwe lwa bûsatû: “Ûlongile bûbê kê muntû gûdjû? Nsimumone bûbê bobonse bûyenene kumuwa nsambû gya luki! Kwanansho shamwûle nswii no kûwa shamulekelele.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Mone boo bagêlêlêle kûta kahûndû kwabumu biiko balombile Yesû akomenenwe ku muntê gwa mpenga mpetia, no nfulo wandilwe kibalo kya mugo gwabo. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Kwanansho, Pilato ukalile nsambû kwana kiswa mutêma kyabo kigwanine. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Umusokwene Balaba muntû wababele bakampilwe, ûbele mukwikilwe mwanda gwa kusisha bûtomboki no kwêyaga muntû, no kumwimia Yesû kwabalê kibalo bamulongele bya bakampilwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûkonkomenwa kwa Yesû ku mutê gwa mpênga mpêtia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoano 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Basilêkale lwababele bagyata no Yesû, bamukwatile muntû gûmo witilwe Simo, wa nsê gya Kilene, ûbele waima kûmabala. Nfulo, bamukonkeleshe atwale mutê gwa mpênga mpêtia gwa Yesû, no umulondile nghimba.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Kibûngo kikata kya bantû kimulondile Yesu; mubûkata bwabo mubelemo baana bakasi babele mukûempûla no mukûlêla. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesû wêugulukile wêbalombwele: “Benywe ba madjû ba Yelusalema! Namuka ndililili nene, nambo mwilêlêle benywe beene no baana benyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kibalo sigi lyakasha kyaba bantû abalê kesamba: ‘Lyese baana bakasi baghumba, kwana nshogyabo hagyalibyale, no mabele gabo hagonkye!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Osey 10.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Mput 6.16</ref></char></note>Kyaba kikyo bekabamba kûlombola Lûgûlû: ‘Lwêtûgwêlêlêle,’ no tûngûlû ‘Twêtûsûwêle!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ntêê balonga bilongwa bino kumutêê gûbêsê, bikaba ntê kûgûgo mutêê go kûma?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Babûgwêle bantû bange babêlê bangêla bibê, bakolwe amo no Yesû. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Kyaba kyabaikile hantû etilwe: “Kabongosho katwe,” ao ûabamukolekile Yesû amo no balya bangibi babêlê, gûmo mugela gwage gwa kûlûme no gûnge mugela gwage gwa kûkasi. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Nghib 22.18</ref></char></note>Yesû wêsambile: “Tata, wêbakyêle lûsa! kibalo abedjê bya bakûlonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Kûwa betangene bishalanwa byage kwa kwêkadjêla bûbale. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Nghib 22.7</ref></char></note>Bantû babele bemane alya bakûlola nobo bakûlû ba Bayuda bamusompwele, banine: “Ûandishe benge; no ehandie gee mwine, ntê gee û Kilisitu musololwa wa Kabesha Mpûngû!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Nghib 69.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Basilêkale nobo bamusompwele swa, Bamugêlêle bamuele biênde bibae <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />banine: “Sitê ntê gwee wê mubêkali wa Bayuda, wêhandie gwe mwine!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Byonka nansilya lusinto lûlû lûbele lûbêkwe egûlû lyage: “GÛDJÛ ÛGE MUBEKALI WA BAYUDA.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Gûmo wabalya bangibi bakolekilwe kumutê gwa mpênga mpêtia umutukile wêsambile: “Ntê sitê kwana gwee ûge Kilisitu? Nfulo, wêhandie gwemwine wêtûhandie no betwe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Mone gûlya ngibi gûnge, umukankêle mwinage, wêsambile: “Gwee honokumutûdjûka Kabesha Mpûngû noene asho? Gwee wamona bûkalabale bonka bûbo? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Gwee, no nene, twê bayenene, kibalo kano ûkatolwa kabilya bya tûlongile; mone muntû gûdjû hamulonge bûbê bobonse.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kûwa wêsambile ee Yesû, “Ngidjûkane kyaba kyolê katwela mu Bukolo bobe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesû umuêndwêle: “Na kûlombola sitê, lêno shaûbe amo nane kû paladiso.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wakya kumutê gwa mpênga mpêtia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoano 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.44-45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kuim 26.31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kibele kyaba kya kûikêla meno kenene; kidjo kiutile mukandje konse kuikêla kyaba kya djûba lya ûla malelo, no djûba lilekele kuimia mugenge kikêngo kibele kikolekwe mu Kitotelo kyatikile biba bibêlê. <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Nghib 31.5</ref></char></note>Yesû ulilile kwa djwê likata: “Tata, mumaboko gobe na ningûbêka mutêma gwane!” Lwabidjile kwêsamba nansho wiminie mutêma.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Hao gûlya musilêkale lwamwene biimine, umutumbikile Kabesha Mpûngû, wêsambile: “Sitê gûdjû ûbele muntû musoga!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Kyaba bantû bonse babele babûngakane alya kibalo kya bihitile hao, lwabamwene gigyo giitile bebwêlêle kwabo balê mukwêyaya, kwa kininga. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Lk 8.2-3</ref></char></note>Mone balya bonse bamusingûlwele amo no balya baana bakasi, babele bamulonda kuima Galilaya, bemene ala mpe, mukûlola mianda gigyo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûshêkwa kwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoano 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Nfulo, kûbele muntû gûmo musoga no wasitê sina lyage Yosefu. Gee ûbele kikûla kya kilye kya Bayuda, Mone gee habele mwitabêsanie no nsambû no bilongwa bya bakûlû nage. Gûdjû ûbele mwikani wa kibûndê kya Alimateya mumwalo gwa Bayuda, Noge ûbele waempa no kûlwegelela kûkata Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yosefu ûgêle kwi Pilato, ûlombile aebwe mubêlê gwa Yesû. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Kûwa wigutukishe mubêlê gûgo kuima kumutê gwa mpênga mpêtia, wiguutile kiûto kisoga, wigubikile mu kilêbû kibele kisongwe kûlwala kwana hakibele kishêkwe muntû gûûnge. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Sigi lilyo, libele sigi lya bûtano no bûlongololi bwa sigi lya kwêtûsha libambile.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Balya baana bakasi basile no Yesû kuima Galilaya, bamulondile Yosefu bekimwene kilya kilêbû, no mubêlê gwa Yesû monka mwagûbele gûbêkwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kuim 20.10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Ngib 5.14</ref></char></note>bebwêlêle kwabo, balongishe makita no gaange gaembwe gakusinga luki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">No betulishe sigi lya kwêtûsha, monka mutakisibwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Kûshûka kwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayo 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoano 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Lukindwe bwe sigi litangi lya djênga, balya baana bakasi batwalile makita ga embwe, gababele babêke djambûla, bagêle ku kilêbû. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Basangene lilya bwe lya lundumunwa kûla no kilêbû, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />mone kyaba kyabatwelile mukilêbû, habasangene mubêlê gwa Kolo Yesû. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Lwababele mukwêgalagania kibalo kya mwanda gûgo, onkao bantû babêlê babele bashale bishandê bya kûkenka nagwe kûlyema kwa nkûba, bemene kûbwêhê nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Babo baana bakasi, batwelilwe no kahaga, bakutamine ansê, hûao balya bantû bebalombwele: “Kibalo kyakêê mwamukeba wê bûkome mubûkata bwa baki? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mt 16.21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18-19">20.18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Malk 8.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lk 9.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18.31-33</ref></char></note>Yesû eo ano; washûka! Mwidjûkane byalimilombwele kyaba kyabele ukinenyu amo kû Galilaya, wimilombwele kwana: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Kiyenene Mwana wa Muntû abêkwe mumaboko ga beno bûbê, no bashantaila, kûba akolekwe, no sigi lya bûsatû ashûke.’”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Hao balya baana bakasi bedjûkene mianda gyage gyalibalombwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Bebwêlêle kuima ku kilêbû, bebalombwele balya baana ba babûganga kumi no gûmo, no bange bonse mianda gilya. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Babo bailile musahû gûgo kwi baana ba babûganga ni Malia Mandalena, Yoana no Malia nyage wa Yakobo; amo no baana bakasi bange balondene nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Mone habe betabêshe balya baana bakasi, kibalo mianda gyabo gimonekile nagwe gya sile. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />No nansho Petelo wêmene ûgêle lûbêlo kuika kukilêbû; lwakotamine kwêlêngêla ûmwene bilya bihûto bya kitûngo, nambo hamwene kintû kiinge. Noge wêbwêlêle lwege mukwêbûsha kikê kyaimina.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwendo lwa kûgya ku Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maluko 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Sigi lyonka lilyo babêlê mubûkata mwa baana babûganga ba Yesû babele mundjêla mukûgya mu kibûndê kimo kitilwe Emau, kibele kûla kwa kilometele kumi no kimo kuima Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Babele mukûbanga bobene kwa bobene kibalo kya mianda giimine kû Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Lwababele mukûbanga no kwêbûsenia, Yesû gemwine wimine ûtambile amo nabo; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />bamumwene no meso, mone habamusingûlwêle. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesû wêbabulishe: “Mianda kê gyamulê mukûbanga mundjêla?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Nobo bemene, nkebo gyabo gimwenie kininga. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Gûmo wabo witilwe Keleopa, umubulishe: “Ntê, gwee wê mwika bugima bobe mu Yelusalema kwana awêdjê biimine kûko masigi gano?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Noge Yesû wêbabulishe: “Mianda kê?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Nobo bamuêndwêle: “Mianda gimumwene Yesû Munasaleti.” Gee ûbele mumoni, wêno bûkome bûkata mu mianda gyage no bilongwa, kûgêbwa gya Kabesha Mpûngû no kûgêbwa gya bantû bonse. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bakûlû ba balambwili no babêkali betû bamuiminie mubûkalabale bwa luki, bamukonkomene. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Mone tûbele bakûdjagêle kwana gee ûswele kûandia Isilaeli! Kûgêbwa kwa gigyo, lêno ni sigi lya bûsatû kûbamba mianda gigyo agilongekile. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Byonka baana bakasi baange ba kwetû betûbabukishe; bagêle ku kilêbû lukindwe bwee, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />mone habegûsangene mubêlê gwege. Bebwêlêle besambile kwana, baiminwe no Masalagûlû gebalombwele kwana Yesû wê poo. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Kûwa bange mubûkata bwetû, bagêle ku kilêbû basitêkêkye gilya gya besambile babo baana bakasi, mone boo habamumwene.<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Nfulo, Yesû wêbalombwele: “Kibalo kyakê mwibabidje, mwino mitêma gi busito gya kwêtabêsha gyonse ginenghenwe no bamoni! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ntê hakimuyenene Kilisitu kûsusulwa no nansho atwele mu tûmbo gyage?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Yesû wêbansintûlwêle mwianda gyonse gimukumine gee, mulusinto lûlûmbûlûke kûbambêla bisila bya Musa kuikêla bamoni bonse.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Lwabakishenine kilya kibûndê kya babele mukûgya, Yesû wêbatangelêle ku gêbwa no lwendo; <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />mone boo bamwisasile biiko ekane naabo, banine: “Gikana amo netû, kibalo alilêngolo no busigi bwashena.” Nfulo, ûtwelile mukibûndê wêkene nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Lwabele amutalako amo nabo, ûtwalile mukate, gee kufwisha no kwêgwesela malyese, ugutimwine, ubambile kwêbatanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Hûao meso gabo gaûtwêlwe, bamusingûlwêle, mone gee usimine abûkata bwabo habamumwene. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Nfulo, bebûsenie bobene kwa bobene: “Nintê mitêma gyetû hagibabukile munda gyetû kwansankê, kyaba kyabele walitusintûlwêla lusinto lûlûmbûlûke mulya mundjêla?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Basemukile kyaba kyonka kilya bebwêlêle Yelusalema, basangene balya baana ba bûganga kumi no gûmo no balya bange bana babûganga nabo babûngakane amo <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />no banine: “Sitê, Kolo wa washûka! Noge wamwimina Simo!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Nfulo, babo bana babûganga babêlê bebanine gilya gibakumine mundjêla, no monka mwabamusingûlwêle Yesû mukutimuna mukate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wêbaimine baana babûganga bage</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoano 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:6-8">1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Lwababele baki mukûbanga, “Gigyo lukwê lûmo Yesû mwine.” Wêmene abûkata bwabo wêbalombwele, “Angalê libe kwamulê.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bababukile no bakwatilwe no kahaga baningile kwana bamona mulêndê. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Mone gee wêbalombwele: “Kibalo kyakê mwatûdjuka no mwadjemba no kahaga mu mitêma gyenyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mulole maboko no magûlû gane, kwana ni nene mwine. Mumbabate mumone, kibalo mulêndê hagûlê mubêlê no makûdja nantê bya mwamona.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Nghimba gya kwêsamba gigyo, wêbalangêshe maboko no magûlû gege. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Bandilwe kwêtabêsha kibalo kyamulogo gwabo, no kwegalagania kwabale nako; wêbabulishe, “Mwino kya kûlya kyo kyonse ano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bamuele kiêndê kya musha gûtekwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />ukitwalile ûlêle bonse bamumwene.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Hûao wêbalombwele, “Kiki ûkyo kibalo kya mianda gyanimilombwele ambele amo nenyu: Kuana kibele kiyenene kûgwanininia gyonse gisintilwe mulûsinto lûlûmbûluke, kibalo kyane mu bisila bya Musa, no mumabûkû ga bamoni, no mubûkû lya Lwêmbo.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Kûwa ûhûtwêle lango lyabo kibalo basingûlûle Lusinto Lûlûmbûlûke <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />no wêbalombwele, “Ûbyo bya bisintilwe: Kuana Kilisitu wê kasûsûlwa no sigi lya bûsatû wakashûka kuima kû baki, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />kisintilwe byonka nansilya mulûsinto lûlûmbûlûke kwana mu sina lyage misoo gyonse gikasawêlwa, kûbambêla Yelusalema, kibalo balabûke kuima mu bûbê bwabo no bamone kûlêkelelwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />No benywe mwikaba basitêkêkya ba mianda gigyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Bilb 1.4</ref></char></note>Lola, nikemitumina kyabûntû kilya Tata wane kyalimilagêlêle kitûke kibalo kyenyu; mone mwinake mu mwalo gwa Yelusalema kuikêla amulê kadjusibwa Bûkome kuima mwigûlû.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûtûlûlwa kwa Yesû mwigûlû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maluko 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bilongwa bya Bikûla 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bilb 1.9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kyaba Yesû lwaimine no baana babûganga bage mu mwalo gwa Yelusalema, no kugya kûbwehe no kibûndê kya Betania, ûtûlwêle maboko gage egûlû no kwêbesela malyese. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Abele mukwêbesela malyese, wêbasigile ûtwalilwe mwigûlû. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Kuwa bamutotile no kwêbwêlela Yelusalema balê no ndoge gikata, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />bekene kyaba kyonse mu Kitotelo mukumutûmbêsha Kabesha Mpûngû.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>